,"Billing":["Facturaci\u00f3n"],"Settings Saved":["Ajustes guardados"],"Saving\u2026":["Guardando\u2026"],"Save Settings":["Guardar configuraci\u00f3n"],"Regular Price of the product":["Precio regular del producto"],"Price after discount.":["Precio despu\u00e9s del descuento."],"Product Name":["Nombre del producto"],"Use {{product_name}} and {{quantity}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Utiliza {{product_name}} y {{quantity}} para obtener din\u00e1micamente los detalles respectivos del producto."],"Subtext":["Subtexto"],"Use {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Utiliza {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} para obtener din\u00e1micamente los detalles respectivos del producto."],"Enable Highlight":["Habilitar resaltado"],"Highlight Text":["Resaltar texto"],"Create New Product":["Crear nuevo producto"],"Add":["A\u00f1adir"],"Once you have selected products, they will be displayed here.":["Una vez que hayas seleccionado productos, se mostrar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed."],"Items":["Art\u00edculos"],"Quantity":["Cantidad"],"Discount":["Descuento"],"Adding\u2026":["Agregando\u2026"],"Please search and select at-lease one product to add.":["Por favor, busca y selecciona al menos un producto para a\u00f1adir."],"Reset":["Restablecer"],"Image Preview":["Vista previa de la imagen"],"Upload a file":["Subir un archivo"],"or drag and drop":["o arrastrar y soltar"],"PNG, JPG, GIF up to 10MB":["PNG, JPG, GIF hasta 10MB"],"Select Dates":["Seleccionar fechas"],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Por favor, actualice a %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s para usar la funci\u00f3n %3$s."],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Por favor, actualice al %1$s Plan Superior de CartFlows %2$s para usar la funci\u00f3n %3$s."],"Please upgrade to the CartFlows Higher Plan to use the %s feature.":["Por favor, actualice al Plan Superior de CartFlows para usar la funci\u00f3n %s."],"Role":["Rol"],"Access":["Acceso"],"For more information about the user role management please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Para obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre la gesti\u00f3n de roles de usuario, por favor %1$sHaz clic aqu\u00ed.%2$s"],"Are you sure you want to rollback to %1$s v%2$s?":["\u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro de que quieres revertir a %1$s v%2$s?"],"Rollback":["Revertir"],"Cancel":["Cancelar"],"Experiencing an issue with the current version of CartFlows? Roll back to a previous version to help troubleshoot the problem.":["\u00bfExperimentas un problema con la versi\u00f3n actual de CartFlows? Revi\u00e9rtela a una versi\u00f3n anterior para ayudar a solucionar el problema."],"Regenerate Now":["Regenerar ahora"],"Reset Permalinks Settings":["Restablecer la configuraci\u00f3n de enlaces permanentes"],"Activate License":["Activar licencia"],"Deactivate License":["Desactivar licencia"],"Please enter a valid license key!":["\u00a1Por favor, introduzca una clave de licencia v\u00e1lida!"],"Processing":["Procesando"],"Unknown error occurred while activating the license.":["Se produjo un error desconocido al activar la licencia."],"Facebook Pixel":["Facebook Pixel"],"Google Analytics Pixel":["Pixel de Google Analytics"],"Google Ads Pixel":["Pixel de Google Ads"],"Tiktok Pixel":["P\u00edxel de Tiktok"],"Pinterest Tag":["Etiqueta de Pinterest"],"Snapchat Pixel":["Snapchat Pixel"],"Google Auto Address":["Direcci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica de Google"],"Regenerate Inline CSS":["Regenerar CSS en l\u00ednea"]," Regenerating\u2026.":["Regenerando\u2026."],"Regenerated":["Regenerado"],"If you are using the CartFlows Shortcode and using the Design Settings, then this option will regenerate the steps inline CSS. To learn more, %1$1s Click here %2$2s.":["Si est\u00e1s utilizando el shortcode de CartFlows y los ajustes de dise\u00f1o, entonces esta opci\u00f3n regenerar\u00e1 los pasos del CSS en l\u00ednea. Para saber m\u00e1s, %1$1s haz clic aqu\u00ed %2$2s."],"Updating":["Actualizando"],"Permalinks reset successfully":["Enlaces permanentes restablecidos con \u00e9xito"],"For more information about the CartFlows Permalink settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Para obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre la configuraci\u00f3n de los enlaces permanentes de CartFlows, por favor %1$sHaz clic aqu\u00ed.%2$s"],"Oops! You don't have access to this page.":["\u00a1Vaya! No tienes acceso a esta p\u00e1gina."],"You don't have permission to access this page. Please reach out to your admin for help.":["No tienes permiso para acceder a esta p\u00e1gina. Por favor, contacta a tu administrador para obtener ayuda."],"Back to Dashboard":["Volver al panel de control"],"Integrations":["Integraciones"],"User Role Manager":["Administrador de Roles de Usuario"],"Permalink":["Enlace permanente"],"Version Control":["Control de versiones"],"Order":["Orden"],"License":["Licencia"],"Sync Knowledge Base":["Sincronizar la base de conocimientos"],"Knowledge Base":["Base de Conocimientos"],"Search knowledge base":["Buscar en la base de conocimientos"],"No Docs Founds":["No se encontraron documentos"],"Please try syncing the docs library":["Por favor, intenta sincronizar la biblioteca de documentos"],"Syncing\u2026":["Sincronizando\u2026"],"Synced. Reloading..":["Sincronizado. Recargando.."],"Need Help?":["\u00bfNecesitas ayuda?"],"We aim to answer all priority support requests within 2-3 hours.":["Nuestro objetivo es responder a todas las solicitudes de soporte prioritario dentro de 2-3 horas."],"Get Support":["Obtener soporte"],"All Documentation":["Toda la documentaci\u00f3n"],"Browse documentation, reference material, and tutorials for CartFlows.":["Consulta la documentaci\u00f3n, el material de referencia y los tutoriales de CartFlows."],"View documentation":["Ver documentaci\u00f3n"],"Videos":["Videos"],"Browse tutorial videos on our YouTube channel.":["Explora videos tutoriales en nuestro canal de YouTube."],"Youtube Channel":["Canal de Youtube"],"Support":["Soporte"],"What's New?":["\u00bfQu\u00e9 hay de nuevo?"],"Unlicensed":["Sin licencia"],"Licensed":["Con licencia"],"Open Global Settings":["Abrir configuraciones globales"],"Tutorial Videos":["Videos tutoriales"],"More Options":["M\u00e1s opciones"],"Control":["Control"],"Variation-%d":["Variaci\u00f3n-%d"],"No Product Assigned":["No hay producto asignado"],"Store Checkout - Remove selected checkout product":["Pago en tienda - Eliminar producto seleccionado del carrito"],"PRO":["PRO"],"Offer Accepted":["Oferta aceptada"],"Offer Rejected":["Oferta rechazada"],"Invalid Position":["Posici\u00f3n no v\u00e1lida"],"Views":["Vistas"],"Conversions":["Conversiones"],"Revenue":["Ingresos"],"Upgrade to Pro":["Actualizar a Pro"],"%s Step":["Paso %s"],"Step Editing is Disabled":["La edici\u00f3n de pasos est\u00e1 deshabilitada"],"Open Settings":["Abrir configuraci\u00f3n"],"Duplicate Step":["Paso duplicado"],"Do you want to duplicate this step? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres duplicar este paso? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"Delete Step":["Eliminar paso"],"Do you want to delete this step? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres eliminar este paso? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"Declare Winner":["Declarar ganador"],"Do you want to declare this step as winner? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres declarar este paso como ganador? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"Archive Step":["Paso de archivo"],"Do you want to archive this step? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres archivar este paso? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"Saving..":["Guardando.."],"Saved":["Guardado"],"Reloading..":["Recargando.."],"Split Test Testing":["Prueba de Test A\/B"],"Stop Split Test":["Detener prueba dividida"],"Start Split Test":["Iniciar prueba dividida"],"Split Test":["Prueba A\/B"],"Stopping\u2026":["Deteniendo\u2026"],"Starting\u2026":["Iniciando\u2026"],"Reloading\u2026":["Recargando\u2026"],"Split Test Settings":["Configuraci\u00f3n de Prueba Dividida"],"Restore Archived Variation":["Restaurar variaci\u00f3n archivada"],"Do you want to restore this archived variation? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres restaurar esta variaci\u00f3n archivada? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"Trash Archived Variation":["Variaci\u00f3n archivada de basura"],"This action will trash this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Esta acci\u00f3n eliminar\u00e1 permanentemente esta variaci\u00f3n archivada y sus datos anal\u00edticos. %1$s \u00bfDesea eliminar esta variaci\u00f3n archivada?"],"Hide Archived Variation":["Ocultar variaci\u00f3n archivada"],"This action will hide this archived variation from the list of steps, but its analytics will be visible. %1$s Do you want to hide this archived variation?":["Esta acci\u00f3n ocultar\u00e1 esta variaci\u00f3n archivada de la lista de pasos, pero su an\u00e1lisis ser\u00e1 visible. %1$s \u00bfDesea ocultar esta variaci\u00f3n archivada?"],"This action will delete this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Esta acci\u00f3n eliminar\u00e1 esta variaci\u00f3n archivada y sus datos anal\u00edticos de forma permanente. %1$s \u00bfDesea eliminar esta variaci\u00f3n archivada?"],"Deleted On: ":["Eliminado el:"],"Archived On: ":["Archivado en:"],"Archived Steps":["Pasos archivados"],"Edit Step Name":["Editar nombre del paso"],"Save":["Guardar"],"Update Template":["Actualizar plantilla"],"Changing the template will permanently delete the current design in this step. Would you still like to proceed?":["Cambiar la plantilla eliminar\u00e1 permanentemente el dise\u00f1o actual en este paso. \u00bfA\u00fan deseas continuar?"],"Change Template":["Cambiar plantilla"],"If you are using shortcodes, enable this design settings to apply styles.":["Si est\u00e1s utilizando c\u00f3digos cortos, activa esta configuraci\u00f3n de dise\u00f1o para aplicar estilos."],"Enable Design Settings":["Habilitar configuraciones de dise\u00f1o"],"Activate %s":["Activar %s"],"Activating %s":["Activando %s"],"Successfully Activated!":["\u00a1Activado con \u00e9xito!"],"Failed! Activation!":["\u00a1Fallido! \u00a1Activaci\u00f3n!"],"Upgrade to Cartflows Pro":["Actualiza a Cartflows Pro"],"Activate the License":["Activar la licencia"],"Step Type: ":["Tipo de paso:"],"License is required!":["\u00a1Se requiere licencia!"],"Activate the license to modify this offer step's settings":["Activa la licencia para modificar la configuraci\u00f3n de este paso de la oferta"],"No product Selected":["No se ha seleccionado ning\u00fan producto"],"Once you select the product, they will be displayed here.":["Una vez que selecciones el producto, se mostrar\u00e1n aqu\u00ed."],"Shipping Rate":["Tarifa de env\u00edo"],"Once you have add product, it will be displayed here.":["Una vez que hayas agregado el producto, se mostrar\u00e1 aqu\u00ed."],"Coupon will apply on checkout page":["El cup\u00f3n se aplicar\u00e1 en la p\u00e1gina de pago"],"AND":["Y"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the conditional order bump feature.":["Por favor, actualice CartFlows Pro a la \u00faltima versi\u00f3n para usar la funci\u00f3n de aumento de pedido condicional."],"Enable conditional order bump ":["Habilitar el aumento de pedido condicional"],"By enabling this option, you can create the conditions to display the order bump.":["Al habilitar esta opci\u00f3n, puedes crear las condiciones para mostrar el aumento de pedido."],"Show this order bump if following conditions are true":["Muestra este aumento de pedido si se cumplen las siguientes condiciones"],"Add Condition":["Agregar condici\u00f3n"],"OR":["O"],"Add Conditions Group":["Agregar grupo de condiciones"],"Order Bump Product Image":["Imagen del producto adicional en el pedido"],"Styles":["Estilos"],"Conditions":["Condiciones"],"Save Changes":["Guardar cambios"],"You have made changes. Do you want to save the changes?":["Has realizado cambios. \u00bfQuieres guardar los cambios?"],"No product":["Sin producto"],"Duplicate Order Bump":["Duplicar Pedido Adicional"],"Edit Order Bump":["Editar Order Bump"],"Trash Order Bump":["Basura Orden Bump"],"Do you really want to trash this order bump permanently?":["\u00bfRealmente deseas eliminar este aumento de pedido de forma permanente?"],"Delete Order Bump":["Eliminar Order Bump"],"Status":["Estado"],"Actions":["Acciones"],"Create an order bump.":["Crea un aumento de pedido."],"Enter order bump name":["Ingrese el nombre del complemento de pedido"],"Please enter the order bump title":["Por favor, introduzca el t\u00edtulo del complemento de pedido"],"Preview":["Vista previa"],"View in Full Screen":["Ver en pantalla completa"],"Exit Full Screen":["Salir de pantalla completa"],"Order Submitted":["Pedido enviado"],"Special Offer":["Oferta Especial"],"Order Receipt":["Recibo de Pedido"],"Enable Checkout Offer":["Habilitar oferta de pago"],"Dynamic Conditions":["Condiciones Din\u00e1micas"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the dynamic offers feature.":["Por favor, actualice CartFlows Pro a la \u00faltima versi\u00f3n para usar la funci\u00f3n de ofertas din\u00e1micas."],"Enable Dynamic Offers":["Habilitar ofertas din\u00e1micas"],"Redirect to: ":["Redirigir a:"],"Search for step\u2026":["Buscar paso\u2026"],"If the following conditions are true":["Si las siguientes condiciones son verdaderas"],"Add Dynamic Offer":["Agregar oferta din\u00e1mica"],"Search for default step\u2026":["Buscar el paso predeterminado\u2026"],"If all of the above conditions failed.":["Si todas las condiciones anteriores fallaron."],"Label":["Etiqueta"],"ID":["ID"],"Enable":["Habilitar"],"Add New Field":["Agregar nuevo campo"],"Date & Time":["Fecha y hora"],"Add Custom Field":["Agregar campo personalizado"],"TextArea":["\u00c1rea de texto"],"Number":["N\u00famero"],"Checkbox":["Casilla de verificaci\u00f3n"],"Radio":["Radio"],"Select":["Seleccionar"],"Hidden":["Oculto"],"Add To":["Agregar a"],"Label %1$s*%2$s":["Etiqueta %1$s*%2$s"],"Field value will store in this meta key. Add field id without prefix like \"billing_\" or \"shipping_\". %s Use \"_\" instead of spaces.":["El valor del campo se almacenar\u00e1 en esta clave meta. Agregue el id del campo sin prefijo como \"billing_\" o \"shipping_\". %s Use \"_\" en lugar de espacios."],"Min Value":["Valor m\u00ednimo"],"Max Value":["Valor m\u00e1ximo"],"Enter your options separated by (|).":["Ingrese sus opciones separadas por (|)."],"UnChecked":["Desmarcado"],"Field Input Type":["Tipo de entrada de campo"],"Date":["Fecha"],"Time":["Tiempo"],"Min ":["Min"],"Max ":["Max"],"Show in Email":["Mostrar en correo electr\u00f3nico"],"Billing Fields":["Campos de facturaci\u00f3n"],"Shipping Fields":["Campos de env\u00edo"],"Delete Field":["Eliminar campo"],"Are you really want to delete field?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres eliminar el campo?"],"Field Editor":["Editor de Campo"],"Label is required field":["La etiqueta es un campo obligatorio"],"WooCommerce is Required!":["\u00a1Se requiere WooCommerce!"],"To modify the %s step options, please install and activate the WooCommerce plugin.":["Para modificar las opciones del paso %s, por favor instala y activa el plugin WooCommerce."],"Activating\u2026":["Activando\u2026"],"Activated":["Activado"],"Funnel Settings":["Configuraci\u00f3n del embudo"],"Save Setting":["Guardar configuraci\u00f3n"],"Disable Store Checkout":["Desactivar la caja de la tienda"],"Enable Store Checkout":["Habilitar la caja de la tienda"],"Edit Title":["Editar t\u00edtulo"],"Publish":["Publicar"],"Do you really want to publish this funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres publicar este embudo?"],"Draft Funnel":["Embudo de Borrador"],"Do you really want to draft this funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres redactar este embudo?"],"Unique Visits":["Visitas \u00danicas"],"Conversion Rate":["Tasa de conversi\u00f3n"],"Total number of orders.":["N\u00famero total de pedidos."],"Grand total of all orders.":["Total general de todos los pedidos."],"Average total of every order.":["Promedio total de cada pedido."],"Grand total of all order bumps.":["Total general de todos los aumentos de pedidos."],"Export Flow":["Flujo de Exportaci\u00f3n"],"View Funnel":["Ver embudo"],"Open Funnel Settings":["Abrir configuraci\u00f3n del embudo"],"Delete Store Checkout":["Eliminar pago de la tienda"],"Do you really want to delete store checkout?%1$1sNOTE: This action cannot be reversed.":["\u00bfRealmente deseas eliminar el pago de la tienda?%1$1sNOTA: Esta acci\u00f3n no se puede deshacer."],"archived_date":["archived_date"],"%1$sNote:%2$s The orders which are placed by the admins are not considered while calculating the analytics.":["%1$sNota:%2$s Los pedidos realizados por los administradores no se consideran al calcular los an\u00e1lisis."],"Reset Analytics":["Restablecer an\u00e1lisis"],"Are you really want to reset funnel analytics?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres restablecer el an\u00e1lisis del embudo?"],"Resetting":["Restableciendo"],"Automation for":["Automatizaci\u00f3n para"],"Create a distraction free, high-converting checkout experience without needing a page builder.":["Crea una experiencia de pago sin distracciones y de alta conversi\u00f3n sin necesidad de un creador de p\u00e1ginas."],"Funnel Steps":["Pasos del embudo"],"Add New Step":["Agregar nuevo paso"],"No Steps Added.":["No se han a\u00f1adido pasos."],"Seems like there are no steps created or added in this flow":["Parece que no hay pasos creados o a\u00f1adidos en este flujo"],"Add new step":["Agregar nuevo paso"],"Select Step Type":["Seleccionar tipo de paso"],"Activating WooCommerce..":["Activando WooCommerce.."],"Installing WooCommerce..":["Instalando WooCommerce.."],"Successfully Installed!":["\u00a1Instalado con \u00e9xito!"],"Installation Failed!":["\u00a1Instalaci\u00f3n fallida!"],"Import Step":["Paso de importaci\u00f3n"],"Add multiple steps to your flows today with an upgraded CartFlows plan.":["Agrega m\u00faltiples pasos a tus flujos hoy con un plan mejorado de CartFlows."],"Get CartFlows Higher Plan":["Obtener el plan superior de CartFlows"],"Add multiple steps to your flows by activating %s.":["Agrega m\u00faltiples pasos a tus flujos activando %s."],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating %2$s.":["Agrega el paso %1$s a tus flujos activando %2$s."],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click %s to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Higher plan today.":["Agrega %s de un solo clic para aumentar ingresos ilimitados a tus flujos cuando actualices a nuestro plan CartFlows Higher hoy."],"Add %1$s step to your flow by activating CartFlows license.":["Agrega el paso %1$s a tu flujo activando la licencia de CartFlows."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s.":["Accede a todas nuestras plantillas profesionales activando %s."],"Access all of our pro templates when you upgrade your plan to CartFlows Pro today.":["Accede a todas nuestras plantillas profesionales cuando actualices tu plan a CartFlows Pro hoy."],"Get CartFlows Pro":["Obtener CartFlows Pro"],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating license.":["Agrega el paso %1$s a tus flujos activando la licencia."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this step.":["Necesitas tener el plugin WooCommerce instalado y activado para importar este paso."],"Imported! Redirecting\u2026":["\u00a1Importado! Redirigiendo\u2026"]," Please sync the library and try importing the template again.":["Por favor, sincroniza la biblioteca e intenta importar la plantilla nuevamente."],"Import Failed! Try again.":["\u00a1La importaci\u00f3n fall\u00f3! Int\u00e9ntalo de nuevo."],"Create Step":["Crear paso"],"Creating Step..":["Creando paso.."],"Step Created! Redirecting\u2026":["\u00a1Paso creado! Redirigiendo\u2026"],"Failed to Create Step!":["\u00a1Error al crear el paso!"],"Activate license for adding more steps and other features.":["Activa la licencia para a\u00f1adir m\u00e1s pasos y otras funciones."],"Close the window":["Cierra la ventana"],"Name Your Step":["Nombre su paso"],"Step Name":["Nombre del paso"],"Enter Step Name":["Ingrese el nombre del paso"],"Learn How":["Aprende c\u00f3mo"],"Create from Scratch":["Crear desde cero"],"Step thumbnail image":["Imagen en miniatura del paso"],"Import":["Importar"],"Back":["Atr\u00e1s"],"Sync Library":["Sincronizar biblioteca"],"Importing page %d":["Importando p\u00e1gina %d"],"Sync Complete":["Sincronizaci\u00f3n completa"],"Syncing Library\u2026":["Sincronizando biblioteca\u2026"],"Library Synced":["Biblioteca sincronizada"],"Steps Library":["Biblioteca de pasos"],"Get CartFlows Higher plan":["Obtener el plan superior de CartFlows"],"Activate license for adding more flows and other features.":["Activa la licencia para a\u00f1adir m\u00e1s flujos y otras caracter\u00edsticas."],"Importing Step..":["Importando paso.."],"Close":["Cerrar"],"Error":["Error"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows by activating %s":["Agrega ventas adicionales de un solo clic que aumentan los ingresos ilimitadamente a tus flujos activando %s"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Plus or Pro plan today.":["Agrega ventas adicionales de un solo clic que aumentan los ingresos ilimitadamente a tus flujos cuando actualizas a nuestro plan CartFlows Plus o Pro hoy mismo."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s":["Accede a todas nuestras plantillas profesionales activando %s"],"Templates for %s":["Plantillas para %s"],"Please wait\u2026":["Por favor, espera\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating funnel\u2026":["Por favor espera. Duplicando embudo\u2026"],"Please wait. Drafting funnel\u2026":["Por favor espera. Redactando embudo\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting funnel\u2026":["Por favor espera. Eliminando embudo\u2026"],"Please wait. Restoring funnel\u2026":["Por favor espera. Restaurando el embudo\u2026"],"Please wait. Exporting\u2026":["Por favor espera. Exportando\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating step\u2026":["Por favor espera. Duplicando paso\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting step\u2026":["Por favor espera. Eliminando paso\u2026"],"Please wait. Creating variation\u2026":["Por favor espera. Creando variaci\u00f3n\u2026"],"Please wait. Archiving variation\u2026":["Por favor espera. Archivando variaci\u00f3n\u2026"],"Please wait. Declaring winner\u2026":["Por favor espera. Declarando ganador\u2026"],"Getting Started":["Comenzando"],"Introduction to CartFlows":["Introducci\u00f3n a CartFlows"],"Modernizing WordPress eCommerce!":["\u00a1Modernizando el comercio electr\u00f3nico de WordPress!"],"Create Your First Flow":["Crea tu primer flujo"],"Go To Setup Wizard":["Ir al Asistente de Configuraci\u00f3n"],"Import Funnel":["Importar embudo"],"Click for more info":["Haz clic para m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this funnel.":["Necesitas tener el plugin WooCommerce instalado y activado para importar este embudo."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating CartFlows Pro.":["Accede a todas nuestras plantillas profesionales activando CartFlows Pro."],"Access all of our pro templates when you activate CartFlows Pro license.":["Accede a todas nuestras plantillas profesionales cuando actives la licencia de CartFlows Pro."],"Importing Complete Funnel..":["Importaci\u00f3n de embudo completa.."],"Design Your Funnel":["Dise\u00f1a tu embudo"],"Created! Redirecting\u2026":["\u00a1Creado! Redirigiendo\u2026"],"Failed to Create Flow!":["\u00a1Error al crear el flujo!"],"Upgrade To CartFlows Pro":["Actualiza a CartFlows Pro"],"Name Your Funnel":["Nombre su embudo"],"Funnel Name":["Nombre del embudo"],"Enter Funnel Name":["Ingrese el nombre del embudo"],"Welcome to CartFlows ":["Bienvenido a CartFlows"],"Sales funnel builder turns your WordPress website into an optimized selling machine.":["El creador de embudos de ventas convierte tu sitio web de WordPress en una m\u00e1quina de ventas optimizada."],"Create Your First Funnel":["Crea tu primer embudo"],"A sales funnel is the sequence of steps a buyer takes to make a purchase. CartFlows helps optimize funnels to turn visitors into customers.":["Un embudo de ventas es la secuencia de pasos que un comprador sigue para realizar una compra. CartFlows ayuda a optimizar los embudos para convertir visitantes en clientes."],"Create New Funnel":["Crear nuevo embudo"],"Total Page Views":["Total de vistas de p\u00e1gina"],"Total Revenue":["Ingresos Totales"],"Total Orders":["Total de pedidos"],"Offer Revenue":["Ingresos por oferta"],"Total Views":["Vistas totales"],"Overview":["Descripci\u00f3n general"],"WooCommerce plugin is required.":["Se requiere el plugin WooCommerce."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the overview":["Necesitas tener el plugin WooCommerce instalado y activado para ver la descripci\u00f3n general"],"Recent Orders":["Pedidos recientes"],"View All":["Ver todo"],"Customer":["Cliente"],"Payment Method":["M\u00e9todo de pago"],"Value":["Valor"],"at":["en"],"Find recent order here":["Encuentra el pedido reciente aqu\u00ed"],"Once you have received orders, come back here to find it again easily":["Una vez que hayas recibido \u00f3rdenes, vuelve aqu\u00ed para encontrarlo f\u00e1cilmente de nuevo"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the recent orders":["Necesitas tener el plugin WooCommerce instalado y activado para ver los pedidos recientes"],"Quick Actions":["Acciones r\u00e1pidas"],"Create a Funnel":["Crear un embudo"],"Analytics":["Anal\u00edtica"],"Create a Product":["Crear un producto"],"Create new Product":["Crear nuevo producto"],"All Funnels":["Todos los embudos"],"View all funnels":["Ver todos los embudos"],"Previous":["Anterior"],"Next":["Siguiente"],"First":["Primero"],"Last":["\u00daltimo"],"You can specify a file to import by either dragging it into the drag and drop area.(Maximum file size of 5MB; .json file extensions only.)":["Puede especificar un archivo para importar arrastr\u00e1ndolo al \u00e1rea de arrastrar y soltar. (Tama\u00f1o m\u00e1ximo de archivo de 5 MB; solo extensiones de archivo .json.)"],"Change a file":["Cambiar un archivo"],"JSON file up to 5MB":["Archivo JSON de hasta 5MB"],"File Selected: %s":["Archivo seleccionado: %s"],"Please select the valid json file.":["Por favor, seleccione el archivo json v\u00e1lido."],"Importing..":["Importando.."],"Export All":["Exportar todo"],"Exporting\u2026":["Exportando\u2026"],"Search Funnels":["Embudos de b\u00fasqueda"],"Filter Funnels by Date":["Filtrar embudos por fecha"],"Publish ":["Publicar"],"Draft ":["Borrador"],"Trash ":["Basura"],"Mode":["Modo"],"All":["Todo"],"Live":["Vivir"],"SandBox":["SandBox"],"Reset Filters":["Restablecer filtros"],"%s This Flow":["%s Este flujo"],"Do you want to %s this flow? Are you sure?":["\u00bfQuieres %s este flujo? \u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro?"],"items selected":["elementos seleccionados"],"Applying changes\u2026":["Aplicando cambios\u2026"]," Published ":["Publicado"],"Duplicate Funnel":["Duplicar embudo"],"Do you really want to duplicate this funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres duplicar este embudo?"],"Trash Funnel":["Embudo de basura"],"Do you really want to trash this funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres eliminar este embudo?"],"Do you really want to trash this Funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres eliminar este embudo?"],"Restore Funnel":["Restaurar embudo"],"Do you really want to restore this funnel?":["\u00bfRealmente quieres restaurar este embudo?"],"Draft":["Borrador"],"Last Modified: %s":["\u00daltima modificaci\u00f3n: %s"],"Updated ":["Actualizado"],"Sandbox":["Sandbox"],"WooCommerce Required to display the revenue.":["WooCommerce es necesario para mostrar los ingresos."],"Restore Flow":["Restaurar flujo"],"Delete Flow":["Eliminar flujo"],"Upgrade to Pro for this feature.":["Actualiza a Pro para esta funci\u00f3n."],"Duplicate (Pro)":["Duplicar (Pro)"],"Trash Flow":["Flujo de basura"],"Trash":["Basura"],"Name":["Nombre"],"Sales":["Ventas"],"Move to Trash":["Mover a la papelera"],"No matching results found for the search term \"%s\".":["No se encontraron resultados coincidentes para el t\u00e9rmino de b\u00fasqueda \"%s\"."],"No flows found for the selected filter.":["No se encontraron flujos para el filtro seleccionado."],"Please try using different keywords, date range, or filters to refine your results.":["Intenta usar diferentes palabras clave, rango de fechas o filtros para refinar tus resultados."],"Create New":["Crear nuevo"]," %d items":["%d art\u00edculos"],"Create your first funnel":["Crea tu primer embudo"],"Build a sales funnel with everything you need to generate leads and grow sales.":["Construye un embudo de ventas con todo lo que necesitas para generar clientes potenciales y aumentar las ventas."],"One Click Upsells":["Upsells con un solo clic"],"A\/B Split Testing":["Pruebas A\/B"],"Conversion Templates":["Plantillas de conversi\u00f3n"],"Checkout Editor":["Editor de pago"],"Insights":["Perspectivas"],"Create Funnel":["Crear embudo"],"Plugin Required":["Complemento requerido"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to access this page.":["Necesitas tener el plugin WooCommerce instalado y activado para acceder a esta p\u00e1gina."],"Installing":["Instalando"],"Activating":["Activando"],"Failed":["Fallido"],"Redirecting":["Redirigiendo"],"Create Store Checkout":["Crear pago de tienda"],"Name Your Store Checkout":["Nombre su tienda Checkout"],"You can't create more than 3 flows in free version. Upgrade to CartFlows Pro for adding more flows and other features.":["No puedes crear m\u00e1s de 3 flujos en la versi\u00f3n gratuita. Actualiza a CartFlows Pro para agregar m\u00e1s flujos y otras caracter\u00edsticas."],"Upgrade To Cartflows Pro":["Actualizar a Cartflows Pro"],"Store Checkout Name":["Nombre de la caja de la tienda"],"Enter Store Checkout Name":["Ingrese el nombre de pago de la tienda"],"Create a global store checkout":["Crear un proceso de pago global"],"A well-designed checkout page can help streamline the checkout process, reduce cart abandonment rates and increase conversions.":["Una p\u00e1gina de pago bien dise\u00f1ada puede ayudar a agilizar el proceso de pago, reducir las tasas de abandono del carrito e incrementar las conversiones."],"Improved user experience":["Experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"Brand consistency":["Consistencia de marca"],"Increased trust and credibility":["Mayor confianza y credibilidad"],"Flexibility and customization":["Flexibilidad y personalizaci\u00f3n"],"Competitive advantage":["Ventaja competitiva"],"Active":["Activo"],"Activate":["Activar"],"Install":["Instalar"],"Installing\u2026":["Instalando\u2026"],"Installed":["Instalado"],"Let's Go":["Vamos"],"Recommended Plugins":["Plugins recomendados"],"Recommended Themes":["Temas recomendados"],"View All Steps":["Ver todos los pasos"],"Funnel thumbnail image":["Imagen en miniatura del embudo"],"Funnel Preview":["Vista previa del embudo"],"Live Preview":["Vista previa en vivo"],"Funnel Templates":["Plantillas de embudo"],"Start from scratch":["Empezar desde cero"],"It seems that the page builder you selected is inactive.":["Parece que el constructor de p\u00e1ginas que seleccionaste est\u00e1 inactivo."]," to see CartFlows templates. If you prefer another page builder tool, you can ":["para ver las plantillas de CartFlows. Si prefieres otra herramienta de creaci\u00f3n de p\u00e1ginas, puedes"],"select it here":["selecci\u00f3nalo aqu\u00ed"],"Are you using any other page builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with every other page builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for every page builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["\u00bfEst\u00e1s usando alg\u00fan otro constructor de p\u00e1ginas? No te preocupes. CartFlows funciona bien con cualquier otro constructor de p\u00e1ginas. En este momento no tenemos plantillas listas para cada constructor de p\u00e1ginas, pero planeamos a\u00f1adirlas muy pronto."],"Learn How ":["Aprende c\u00f3mo"],"No Results Found.":["No se encontraron resultados."],"Don't see a funnel that you would like to import?":["\u00bfNo ves un embudo que te gustar\u00eda importar?"],"Please suggest us ":["Por favor, sugi\u00e9renos"],"Choose a Funnel Templates":["Elige una plantilla de embudo"],"Search Templates":["Buscar plantillas"],"Start from Scratch":["Empezar desde cero"],"It seems that you are using the Bricks Builder.":["Parece que est\u00e1s usando el Bricks Builder."],"It seems that you are using the page builder other than Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder.":["Parece que est\u00e1s utilizando un constructor de p\u00e1ginas que no es Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder."],"Are you using Bricks Builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with Bricks Builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for Bricks Builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["\u00bfEst\u00e1s usando Bricks Builder? No te preocupes. CartFlows funciona bien con Bricks Builder. En este momento no tenemos plantillas listas para Bricks Builder, pero planeamos a\u00f1adirlas muy pronto."],"Checkout Page":["P\u00e1gina de pago"],"Oops!!! No template Found.":["\u00a1Ups! No se encontr\u00f3 ninguna plantilla."],"Seems like no template is available for chosen editor.":["Parece que no hay ninguna plantilla disponible para el editor elegido."],"Store Checkout Templates":["Plantillas de pago de la tienda"],"No CartFlows Logs Found.":["No se encontraron registros de CartFlows."],"CartFlows Logs":["Registros de CartFlows"],"Copied":["Copiado"],"Copy":["Copiar"],"Downloading":["Descargando"],"Download":["Descargar"],"Deleting":["Eliminando"],"Deleted":["Eliminado"],"Email Marketing Automation":["Automatizaci\u00f3n del Marketing por Correo Electr\u00f3nico"],"Automate email marketing campaigns based on customer actions, such as abandoned carts or completed purchases in WooCommerce.":["Automatiza las campa\u00f1as de marketing por correo electr\u00f3nico basadas en las acciones de los clientes, como carritos abandonados o compras completadas en WooCommerce."],"Customer Birthday Campaigns":["Campa\u00f1as de Cumplea\u00f1os para Clientes"],"Automatically send personalized birthday offers or discounts to customers based on their birthdate stored in WooCommerce.":["Env\u00eda autom\u00e1ticamente ofertas o descuentos personalizados de cumplea\u00f1os a los clientes basados en su fecha de nacimiento almacenada en WooCommerce."],"Order Notification":["Notificaci\u00f3n de Pedido"],"Receive instant notifications via SMS, Slack, WhatsApp, or messaging apps when new orders are placed in your WooCommerce store.":["Recibe notificaciones instant\u00e1neas a trav\u00e9s de SMS, Slack, WhatsApp o aplicaciones de mensajer\u00eda cuando se realicen nuevos pedidos en tu tienda WooCommerce."],"Payment and Accounting Integration":["Integraci\u00f3n de Pagos y Contabilidad"],"Sync WooCommerce sales data with your accounting software for streamlined financial management.":["Sincroniza los datos de ventas de WooCommerce con tu software de contabilidad para una gesti\u00f3n financiera simplificada."],"Coupon Code Marketing":["Marketing de c\u00f3digos de cup\u00f3n"],"Automate the creation and distribution of coupon codes based on specific conditions or customer actions in WooCommerce.":["Automatiza la creaci\u00f3n y distribuci\u00f3n de c\u00f3digos de cup\u00f3n basados en condiciones espec\u00edficas o acciones de los clientes en WooCommerce."],"Upsell and Cross-sell Campaigns":["Campa\u00f1as de venta adicional y venta cruzada"],"Automate targeted upsell and cross-sell offers based on customers' purchase history or product interactions in WooCommerce.":["Automatiza las ofertas de upsell y cross-sell dirigidas basadas en el historial de compras de los clientes o las interacciones con productos en WooCommerce."],"Connect Your Website":["Conecta tu sitio web"],"Reloading":["Recargando"],"Connecting":["Conectando"],"Integrate WooCommerce and CartFlows with Anything":["Integra WooCommerce y CartFlows con cualquier cosa"],"Integrate all your apps, plugins, and services to automate repetitive tasks.":["Integra todas tus aplicaciones, complementos y servicios para automatizar tareas repetitivas."],"These are just some examples. The possibilities are truly endless!":["Estos son solo algunos ejemplos. \u00a1Las posibilidades son realmente infinitas!"],"Trusted by World's Top Brands to Connect Their Apps":["Confiado por las principales marcas del mundo para conectar sus aplicaciones"],"Connect your apps and automate your business.":["Conecta tus aplicaciones y automatiza tu negocio."],"Remove Image":["Eliminar imagen"],"Unlock Premium Features with CartFlows PRO!":["\u00a1Desbloquea las funciones premium con CartFlows PRO!"],"Get the tools you need to create powerful sales funnels, increase conversions, and grow your business with ease.":["Obt\u00e9n las herramientas que necesitas para crear embudos de ventas poderosos, aumentar las conversiones y hacer crecer tu negocio con facilidad."],"Select a Settings Tab":["Selecciona una pesta\u00f1a de configuraci\u00f3n"],"Free vs Pro":["Gratis vs Pro"],"Increase Your Revenue with Smart Order Bumps":["Aumenta tus ingresos con incrementos de pedido inteligentes"],"Boost sales with CartFlows\u2019 Order Bump! Offer personalized add-ons at checkout to increase revenue effortlessly. Quick to set up, no coding needed!":["Aumenta las ventas con el Order Bump de CartFlows. Ofrece complementos personalizados en el proceso de pago para aumentar los ingresos sin esfuerzo. \u00a1R\u00e1pido de configurar, sin necesidad de programaci\u00f3n!"],"Show the Right Offer to the Right People \u2013 Automatically!":["\u00a1Muestra la oferta adecuada a las personas adecuadas autom\u00e1ticamente!"],"Personalize deals based on location, cart details, and more. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and unlock this smart feature today!":["Personaliza ofertas basadas en la ubicaci\u00f3n, los detalles del carrito y m\u00e1s. \u00a1Actualiza a CartFlows PRO y desbloquea esta funci\u00f3n inteligente hoy mismo!"],"Boost Sales Instantly with Auto-Applied Coupons!":["\u00a1Aumenta las ventas al instante con cupones aplicados autom\u00e1ticamente!"],"No codes, no hassle\u2014discounts apply instantly at checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start converting more customers today!":["Sin c\u00f3digos, sin complicaciones: los descuentos se aplican instant\u00e1neamente al finalizar la compra. \u00a1Actualiza a CartFlows PRO y comienza a convertir m\u00e1s clientes hoy mismo!"],"Give Your Customers More Choices, Boost Your Sales":["Ofrece a tus clientes m\u00e1s opciones, aumenta tus ventas"],"Make buying easier with flexible product options. Let customers make the right choices from your checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start customizing today!":["Haz que comprar sea m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil con opciones de productos flexibles. Permite que los clientes tomen las decisiones correctas desde tu proceso de pago. \u00a1Actualiza a CartFlows PRO y comienza a personalizar hoy!"],"Optin Product":["Producto de suscripci\u00f3n"],"Select free & virtual product only. Once you select a product, it will be displayed here.":["Seleccione solo productos gratuitos y virtuales. Una vez que seleccione un producto, se mostrar\u00e1 aqu\u00ed."],"Search for a Free & Virtual Product":["Buscar un Producto Gratuito y Virtual"],"Please select a free & virtual product only.":["Por favor, seleccione solo un producto gratuito y virtual."],"Free":["Gratis"],"A\/B Testing":["Pruebas A\/B"],"Optimize your sales with A\/B testing in CartFlows! Experiment with product pricing, page layouts, messaging, and design. Create variants, analyze results, and discover new ways to boost revenue.":["\u00a1Optimiza tus ventas con pruebas A\/B en CartFlows! Experimenta con precios de productos, dise\u00f1os de p\u00e1gina, mensajes y dise\u00f1o. Crea variantes, analiza resultados y descubre nuevas formas de aumentar los ingresos."],"Finish Setup":["Finalizar configuraci\u00f3n"],"Setup CartFlows":["Configurar CartFlows"],"Setup Store Checkout":["Configurar la caja de la tienda"],"Create":["Crear"],"Build Your Funnel":["Construye tu embudo"],"Start From Scratch":["Empezar desde cero"],"Go To Library":["Ir a la biblioteca"],"Offer add-ons with Order Bump.":["Ofrece complementos con Order Bump."],"Increase Revenue with Upsells.":["Aumenta los ingresos con ventas adicionales."],"Almost There! Let's Go Live.":["\u00a1Casi estamos! Vamos en vivo."],"%d out of 5 completed":["%d de 5 completados"],"Upgrade to PRO":["Actualizar a PRO"],"Completed":["Completado"],"Upgrade your plan anytime and get more detailed analytics data.":["Actualiza tu plan en cualquier momento y obt\u00e9n datos anal\u00edticos m\u00e1s detallados."],"Total Page Views is a Premium Feature":["El total de vistas de p\u00e1gina es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["Los ingresos por ofertas son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Custom Filter:":["Filtro personalizado:"],"Checkout Features":["Caracter\u00edsticas de pago"],"Modern Checkout Styles":["Estilos de Pago Modernos"],"Optimized replacement for the standard WooCommerce checkout page designed for higher conversion":["Reemplazo optimizado para la p\u00e1gina de pago est\u00e1ndar de WooCommerce dise\u00f1ado para una mayor conversi\u00f3n"],"Custom Checkout Fields":["Campos de pago personalizados"],"Have complete control over the field editor to manage the fields as required":["Tenga control total sobre el editor de campos para gestionar los campos seg\u00fan sea necesario"],"One-Click Upsells \/ Downsells":["Upsells \/ Downsells con un solo clic"],"Dynamic One-Click Upsells":["Upsells din\u00e1micos de un solo clic"],"Use cart contents or customer data to display relevant upsells for maximum conversion":["Utiliza el contenido del carrito o los datos del cliente para mostrar ventas adicionales relevantes y maximizar la conversi\u00f3n"],"Dynamic Upsell Templates":["Plantillas de venta adicional din\u00e1mica"],"Professional templates to help you sell more even if you\u2019re not a designer":["Plantillas profesionales para ayudarte a vender m\u00e1s incluso si no eres dise\u00f1ador"],"Order Bump Features":["Caracter\u00edsticas de Order Bump"],"Dynamic Order Bumps":["Incrementos de Pedido Din\u00e1micos"],"Smart order bumps using customer data to display most relevant products or offers":["Incrementos de pedido inteligentes utilizando datos del cliente para mostrar los productos u ofertas m\u00e1s relevantes"],"Advanced Funnel Features":["Funciones avanzadas de embudo"],"A \/ B Split Testing":["Pruebas A \/ B"],"Increase conversions and sales with CartFlows A\/B Testing by running simple tests":["Aumenta las conversiones y ventas con las pruebas A\/B de CartFlows realizando pruebas simples"],"Analyze transactions and user behavior to refine conversions and make more profit":["Analiza las transacciones y el comportamiento de los usuarios para refinar las conversiones y obtener m\u00e1s beneficios"],"Cloud-based automation tools that intelligently links your websites, stores, plugins and apps":["Herramientas de automatizaci\u00f3n basadas en la nube que vinculan inteligentemente tus sitios web, tiendas, plugins y aplicaciones"],"SkillJet Academy Access":["Acceso a SkillJet Academy"],"CartFlows offers full training to help you make more profit with SkillJet academy":["CartFlows ofrece formaci\u00f3n completa para ayudarte a obtener m\u00e1s beneficios con la academia SkillJet"],"Others Benefits":["Otros beneficios"],"Premium Support":["Soporte Premium"],"Professional Support, Professional Support Team or Dedicated Support Team":["Soporte Profesional, Equipo de Soporte Profesional o Equipo de Soporte Dedicado"],"Amazing User Community":["Incre\u00edble comunidad de usuarios"],"Amazing User Community is already a great message unless you\u2019re looking for a different meaning":["La incre\u00edble comunidad de usuarios ya es un gran mensaje a menos que est\u00e9s buscando un significado diferente"],"Great Documentation & Video Tutorials":["Excelente documentaci\u00f3n y tutoriales en video"],"Comprehensive Documentation and Video Tutorials or Comprehensive Documentation and Video Guides":["Documentaci\u00f3n integral y tutoriales en video o Documentaci\u00f3n integral y gu\u00edas en video"],"Free Plugins":["Plugins gratuitos"],"Variation Swatches":["Muestras de variaci\u00f3n"],"Give customers choice by including relevant product variations including size, color and more":["Ofrece a los clientes opciones incluyendo variaciones de producto relevantes como tama\u00f1o, color y m\u00e1s"],"Stripe Payment Gateway":["Pasarela de Pago Stripe"],"Accepting multiple payment methods gives customers choice and can significantly increase conversion":["Aceptar m\u00faltiples m\u00e9todos de pago ofrece opciones a los clientes y puede aumentar significativamente la conversi\u00f3n"],"Features":["Caracter\u00edsticas"],"See all CartFlows Pro features":["Ver todas las funciones de CartFlows Pro"],"Sell More with CartFlows Pro":["Vende m\u00e1s con CartFlows Pro"],"Get access to powerful features for painless WordPress designing, without the high costs. With all the time you will save, it\u2019s a product that pays for itself!":["Obt\u00e9n acceso a potentes funciones para un dise\u00f1o de WordPress sin complicaciones, sin los altos costos. Con todo el tiempo que ahorrar\u00e1s, \u00a1es un producto que se paga solo!"],"Modern Cart":["Carrito Moderno"],"Enable Instant Layout":["Habilitar dise\u00f1o instant\u00e1neo"],"Disabled":["Desactivado"],"upgrading to PRO":["actualizaci\u00f3n a PRO"],"activating CartFlows Pro":["activando CartFlows Pro"],"You're using":["Est\u00e1s usando"],"CartFlows Free":["CartFlows Gratis"],"To unlock more features, consider":["Para desbloquear m\u00e1s funciones, considere"],"Activate CartFlows Pro":["Activar CartFlows Pro"],"You can't edit this step directly because Instant Layout is turned on in the funnel settings. To make design changes, go to the Design tab inside this step's settings.":["No puedes editar este paso directamente porque el Dise\u00f1o Instant\u00e1neo est\u00e1 activado en la configuraci\u00f3n del embudo. Para realizar cambios de dise\u00f1o, ve a la pesta\u00f1a de Dise\u00f1o dentro de la configuraci\u00f3n de este paso."],"Use this setting to customize the style of the Instant %s Layout.":["Utiliza esta configuraci\u00f3n para personalizar el estilo del dise\u00f1o Instant\u00e1neo %s."],"Turn this on to set up rules that decide when visitors should be redirected to a special offer or the next step.":["Activa esto para configurar reglas que decidan cu\u00e1ndo los visitantes deben ser redirigidos a una oferta especial o al siguiente paso."],"Your email address can't be edited when using the Modern Checkout Style.":["No se puede editar tu direcci\u00f3n de correo electr\u00f3nico al usar el estilo de pago moderno."],"The Company field won't be visible if you're using the Instant Layout Style.":["El campo de la empresa no ser\u00e1 visible si est\u00e1s utilizando el estilo de dise\u00f1o instant\u00e1neo."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all your funnels combined.":["Esto muestra la cantidad total de dinero ganado de todos tus embudos combinados."],"This shows the total number of orders placed through your CartFlows checkout pages.":["Esto muestra el n\u00famero total de pedidos realizados a trav\u00e9s de tus p\u00e1ginas de pago de CartFlows."],"This shows the total number of times people visited any step in your funnel.":["Esto muestra el n\u00famero total de veces que las personas visitaron cualquier paso en tu embudo."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from your Upsell and Downsell offers.":["Esto muestra la cantidad total de dinero ganado con tus ofertas de Upsell y Downsell."],"Set up a Store Checkout in just one click:":["Configura un pago en la tienda con solo un clic:"],"Thank You Page":["P\u00e1gina de Agradecimiento"],"Use ready-made templates from the CartFlows Library, our custom widget, or shortcodes on each page to set this up easily\u2014no coding needed!":["Utiliza plantillas predise\u00f1adas de la Biblioteca de CartFlows, nuestro widget personalizado o shortcodes en cada p\u00e1gina para configurarlo f\u00e1cilmente, \u00a1sin necesidad de codificaci\u00f3n!"],"Install OttoKit for Free":["Instala OttoKit gratis"],"Visit OttoKit Website":["Visita el sitio web de OttoKit"],"Here are a few simple examples of what OttoKit can do on your WooCommerce store:":["Aqu\u00ed hay algunos ejemplos simples de lo que OttoKit puede hacer en tu tienda WooCommerce:"],"Join Thousands of Entrepreneurs Already Using OttoKit.":["\u00danete a miles de emprendedores que ya est\u00e1n usando OttoKit."],"Bonus ($200 Value)":["Bono (Valor de $200)"],"Access to OttoKit Pro Plan":["Acceso al Plan Pro de OttoKit"],"Plus - Annual":["Plus - Anual"],"\/ year":["\/ a\u00f1o"],"Pro - Annual":["Pro - Anual"],"Pro - Lifetime (One Time Pay)":["Pro - De por vida (Pago \u00fanico)"],"for Lifetime":["de por vida"],"Pro - Lifetime (11 x Split Pay)":["Pro - De por vida (11 x Pago dividido)"],"x 11 Months":["x 11 Meses"],"Explore the key differences between Plus and Pro to find the perfect fit for your needs.":["Explora las diferencias clave entre Plus y Pro para encontrar el ajuste perfecto para tus necesidades."],"CartFlows Free vs Pro Image":["Imagen de CartFlows Gratis vs Pro"],"Unlock Pro Features":["Desbloquear funciones Pro"],"Generate More Sales With CartFlows Pro!":["\u00a1Genera m\u00e1s ventas con CartFlows Pro!"],"And More\u2026":["Y m\u00e1s\u2026"],"Buy Now":["Comprar ahora"],"View plans":["Ver planes"],"Moderncart":["Moderncart"],"Trusted by Top Brands to Boost Conversions Instantly":["Confiado por las principales marcas para aumentar las conversiones al instante"],"Brand logo":["Logotipo de la marca"],"Stop Losing Sales at the Cart \u2014 Fix It in Minutes!":["\u00a1Deja de perder ventas en el carrito \u2014 arr\u00e9glalo en minutos!"],"Modern Cart is your instant upgrade for more sales, bigger orders, and smoother checkouts.":["Modern Cart es tu actualizaci\u00f3n instant\u00e1nea para m\u00e1s ventas, pedidos m\u00e1s grandes y pagos m\u00e1s fluidos."],"Opt-in":["Optar por participar"],"The product previously added as an Order Bump has been deleted. Please add a new product.":["El producto previamente a\u00f1adido como un Order Bump ha sido eliminado. Por favor, a\u00f1ade un nuevo producto."],"Choose a variation":["Elige una variaci\u00f3n"],"For more information about order bump settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Para obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre la configuraci\u00f3n del aumento de pedidos, por favor %1$sHaz clic aqu\u00ed.%2$s"],"Sum of all step views in this funnel.":["Suma de todas las vistas de pasos en este embudo."],"Total upsell\/downsell revenue.":["Ingresos totales por venta adicional\/venta descendente."],"Revenue per visit.":["Ingresos por visita."],"Revenue per unique visitor.":["Ingresos por visitante \u00fanico."],"Sandbox Mode":["Modo Sandbox"],"Live Mode":["Modo en vivo"],"No. of Orders":["N.\u00ba de pedidos"],"Opt-in Step":["Paso de suscripci\u00f3n"],"Opt-in Form":["Formulario de suscripci\u00f3n"],"Popup":["Ventana emergente"],"Lead Magnets":["Imanes de clientes potenciales"],"Top Performing Funnels":["Embudos de mejor rendimiento"],"Find top performing funnels here":["Encuentra los embudos de mejor rendimiento aqu\u00ed"],"Once you set up funnels, come back here to top performing funnels":["Una vez que configures los embudos, vuelve aqu\u00ed a los embudos de mejor rendimiento"],"Top Performing Funnels is a Premium Feature":["Los embudos de mejor rendimiento son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"View sales analytics":["Ver an\u00e1lisis de ventas"],"Fast and customizable cart for your website.":["Carrito r\u00e1pido y personalizable para tu sitio web."],"Recover abandonded carts with ease.":["Recupera los carritos abandonados con facilidad."],"Automate your repititive tasks, effortlessly!":["\u00a1Automatiza tus tareas repetitivas, sin esfuerzo!"],"Product choices made visual and clickable.":["Opciones de productos visuales y clicables."],"Extend Your Store":["Ampl\u00eda tu tienda"],"Replace Store Checkout Funnel?":["\u00bfReemplazar el embudo de pago de la tienda?"],"A Store Checkout funnel already exists. Importing will replace the current Store Checkout funnel.":["Ya existe un embudo de pago de la tienda. Importar reemplazar\u00e1 el embudo de pago de la tienda actual."],"Replace & Import":["Reemplazar e importar"],"Import from JSON file":["Importar desde archivo JSON"],"Average Order Value":["Valor Promedio de Pedido"],"Average Order Value is a Premium Feature":["El valor promedio del pedido es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Bump Offer Revenue":["Ingresos por oferta adicional"],"Bump Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["El ingreso por oferta adicional es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Revenue Per Visit":["Ingresos por visita"],"Revenue Per Visit is a Premium Feature":["El ingreso por visita es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"RPUV":["RPUV"],"Revenue Per Unique Visitor is a Premium Feature":["El ingreso por visitante \u00fanico es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Loading flows\u2026":["Cargando flujos\u2026"],"Select Flow":["Seleccionar flujo"],"No data available":["No hay datos disponibles"],"All Funnels is a Premium Feature":["Todos los embudos es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Previous Period":["Per\u00edodo anterior"],"Previous Year":["A\u00f1o anterior"],"Total Visitors":["Visitantes Totales"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all steps combined.":["Esto muestra la cantidad total de dinero ganado de todos los pasos combinados."],"Avg. Order Value":["Valor promedio del pedido"],"Average value of each order (Total Revenue \/ Total Orders).":["Valor promedio de cada pedido (Ingresos Totales \/ Pedidos Totales)."],"Bump Revenue":["Incrementar ingresos"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all order bump offers.":["Esto muestra la cantidad total de dinero ganado de todas las ofertas adicionales de pedido."],"Revenue per each visit (Total Revenue \/ Total Visitors).":["Ingresos por cada visita (Ingresos Totales \/ Visitantes Totales)."],"This shows average revenue generated per individual visitor.":["Esto muestra el ingreso promedio generado por cada visitante individual."],"Total Submissions":["Total de env\u00edos"],"Total Submissions is a Premium Feature":["El total de env\u00edos es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Conversion Rate is a Premium Feature":["La tasa de conversi\u00f3n es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"List Growth":["Crecimiento de la lista"],"Optin Overview is a Premium Feature":["La descripci\u00f3n general de Optin es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"This shows the total opt-in form submissions.":["Esto muestra el total de env\u00edos del formulario de suscripci\u00f3n."],"This shows the percentage of visitors who completed the opt-in.":["Esto muestra el porcentaje de visitantes que completaron el registro."],"Laptop Conversions":["Conversiones de port\u00e1tiles"],"Laptop Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Las conversiones de port\u00e1tiles son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Mobile Conversions":["Conversiones m\u00f3viles"],"Mobile Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Las conversiones m\u00f3viles son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Total Conversions":["Conversiones Totales"],"Total Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Las conversiones totales son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Bump Conversions":["Impulsar conversiones"],"Bump Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Bump Conversions es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Offer Conversions":["Conversiones de ofertas"],"Offer Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Las conversiones de ofertas son una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Steps":["Pasos"],"This section lists funnel conversion data.":["Esta secci\u00f3n enumera los datos de conversi\u00f3n del embudo."],"This is where your funnel drop-off statistics will appear":["Aqu\u00ed es donde aparecer\u00e1n las estad\u00edsticas de abandono de tu embudo"],"Step Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["La entrega por etapas es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"Product Details":["Detalles del producto"],"This section lists product conversion data.":["Esta secci\u00f3n enumera los datos de conversi\u00f3n de productos."],"Product Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["La entrega de productos es una funci\u00f3n premium"],"This shows the total number of visitors for the selected funnel\/s.":["Esto muestra el n\u00famero total de visitantes para el\/los embudo\/s seleccionado\/s."],"This shows the total conversions for the selected funnel.":["Esto muestra las conversiones totales para el embudo seleccionado."],"This shows the order bump conversions for the selected funnel.":["Esto muestra las conversiones de aumento de pedido para el embudo seleccionado."],"This shows the total offer conversions from Upsell and Downsell combined for the selected funnel.":["Esto muestra las conversiones totales de la oferta de Upsell y Downsell combinadas para el embudo seleccionado."],"This shows the orders completed on large-screen devices (over 1024px).":["Esto muestra los pedidos completados en dispositivos de pantalla grande (m\u00e1s de 1024px)."],"This shows orders completed on mobile and small-screen devices (under 1024px).":["Esto muestra los pedidos completados en dispositivos m\u00f3viles y de pantalla peque\u00f1a (menos de 1024px)."],"Hot":["Caliente"],"Get ModernCart Now":["Obt\u00e9n ModernCart ahora"],"Your WooCommerce Cart, Reinvented %sto Sell More.":["Tu carrito de WooCommerce, reinventado %spara vender m\u00e1s."],"ModernCart replaces redirects and reloads with a smooth slide-out cart \u2014 fewer steps, fewer drop-offs, more conversions.":["ModernCart reemplaza las redirecciones y recargas con un carrito deslizante suave: menos pasos, menos abandonos, m\u00e1s conversiones."],"See Plans & Pricing \u2192":["Ver planes y precios \u2192"],"Here's What ModernCart Does for Your Store":["Esto es lo que ModernCart hace por tu tienda"],"Slide-Out Cart":["Carro deslizante"],"Keep shoppers on the same page while adding or editing items, reducing steps and boosting completed purchases.":["Mant\u00e9n a los compradores en la misma p\u00e1gina mientras a\u00f1aden o editan art\u00edculos, reduciendo pasos y aumentando las compras completadas."],"Smart Product Recommendations":["Recomendaciones de productos inteligentes"],"Show relevant product suggestions inside the cart, automatically increasing order value with simple, effective upsells.":["Muestra sugerencias de productos relevantes dentro del carrito, aumentando autom\u00e1ticamente el valor del pedido con ventas adicionales simples y efectivas."],"Free Shipping Progress Bar":["Barra de progreso de env\u00edo gratis"],"Motivate customers to spend more by clearly showing how close they are to unlocking free shipping.":["Motiva a los clientes a gastar m\u00e1s mostrando claramente lo cerca que est\u00e1n de obtener el env\u00edo gratis."],"Smooth Coupon Management":["Gesti\u00f3n fluida de cupones"],"Make discounts effortless \u2014 shoppers can quickly apply or remove coupon codes without page reloads or confusion.":["Haz que los descuentos sean sencillos: los compradores pueden aplicar o eliminar c\u00f3digos de cup\u00f3n r\u00e1pidamente sin recargar la p\u00e1gina ni confusiones."],"Instant Updates, No Reloads":["Actualizaciones instant\u00e1neas, sin recargas"],"Deliver a seamless, app-like cart experience with real-time updates that keep customers engaged without interruptions.":["Ofrece una experiencia de carrito fluida, similar a una aplicaci\u00f3n, con actualizaciones en tiempo real que mantienen a los clientes comprometidos sin interrupciones."],"Customize Everything":["Personaliza todo"],"Easily change cart icons, labels, colors, and texts to perfectly match your brand and store's style.":["Cambia f\u00e1cilmente los iconos del carrito, las etiquetas, los colores y los textos para que coincidan perfectamente con el estilo de tu marca y tienda."],"Learn":["Aprender"],"File Size (MB)":["Tama\u00f1o de Archivo (MB)"],"Accepted File Types":["Tipos de Archivo Aceptados"],"Back to Webhooks":["Volver a Webhooks"],"Edit Webhook":["Editar Webhook"],"Add New Webhook":["Agregar nuevo Webhook"],"e.g. CRM Integration":["p. ej. Integraci\u00f3n de CRM"],"Endpoint URL":["URL del endpoint"],"Events":["Eventos"],"Select events that will trigger this webhook.":["Seleccione los eventos que activar\u00e1n este webhook."],"Select All":["Seleccionar todo"],"Enabled":["Habilitado"],"Max Retries":["M\u00e1ximas reintentos"],"Number of retry attempts for failed deliveries (0-5).":["N\u00famero de intentos de reintento para entregas fallidas (0-5)."],"Secret Key":["Clave secreta"],"Used to sign webhook payloads (HMAC-SHA256).":["Utilizada para firmar las cargas \u00fatiles del webhook (HMAC-SHA256)."],"Copy to clipboard":["Copiar al portapapeles"],"Copied!":["\u00a1Copiado!"],"Please enter a webhook name.":["Por favor, ingrese un nombre para el webhook."],"Please enter a webhook URL.":["Por favor, ingrese una URL para el webhook."],"Please enter a valid URL.":["Por favor, ingrese una URL v\u00e1lida."],"Please select at least one event.":["Por favor, seleccione al menos un evento."],"Failed to save webhook.":["Error al guardar el webhook."],"Something went wrong.":["Algo sali\u00f3 mal."],"Update Webhook":["Actualizar Webhook"],"Create Webhook":["Crear Webhook"],"Webhooks":["Webhooks"],"Send real-time event data to external services when key funnel events occur.":["Env\u00eda datos de eventos en tiempo real a servicios externos cuando ocurren eventos clave del embudo."],"No webhooks configured yet. Click \"Add New Webhook\" to get started.":["No hay webhooks configurados a\u00fan. Haz clic en \"Agregar Nuevo Webhook\" para comenzar."],"URL":["URL"],"Last Delivery":["\u00daltima Entrega"],"events":["eventos"],"Success":["\u00c9xito"],"Never triggered":["Nunca activado"],"Test sent!":["\u00a1Prueba enviada!"],"Send Test":["Enviar Prueba"],"Are you sure you want to delete this webhook?":["\u00bfEst\u00e1s seguro de que deseas eliminar este webhook?"],"Global CSS & Scripts":["CSS y Scripts Globales"],"Successfully Activated":["Activado con \u00c9xito"],"Activation Failed":["Fallo en la Activaci\u00f3n"],"File":["Archivo"],"Enter the maximum allowed file size. Default is 5MB.":["Ingresa el tama\u00f1o m\u00e1ximo de archivo permitido. El valor predeterminado es 5MB."],"Enter comma-separated file extensions (e.g. jpg, png, gif)":["Ingresa las extensiones de archivo separadas por comas (por ejemplo, jpg, png, gif)"],"Invalid file type(s): %s":["Tipo(s) de archivo no v\u00e1lidos: %s"],"Processing\u2026":["Procesando\u2026"],"Install %s":["Instalar %s"],"Mark %s as not completed":["Marcar %s como no completado"],"Mark %s as completed":["Marcar %s como completado"],"Learn how: %s":["Aprende c\u00f3mo: %s"],"%1$s - %2$s":["%1$s - %2$s"],"%1$s - %2$d of %3$d steps completed":["%1$s - %2$d de %3$d pasos completados"],"%1$d of %2$d steps completed":["%1$d de %2$d pasos completados"],"No sections available.":["No hay secciones disponibles."],"Close video":["Cerrar video"],"Learn CartFlows":["Aprender CartFlows"],"Set up high-converting funnels in CartFlows with step-by-step guidance and launch with confidence.":["Configura embudos de alta conversi\u00f3n en CartFlows con orientaci\u00f3n paso a paso y lanza con confianza."],"Watch video: Learn CartFlows":["Ver video: Aprender CartFlows"],"Watch Video":["Ver video"],"Delete Webhook":["Eliminar Webhook"],"Failed!":[""]}}}
plugins/cartflows/languages/cartflows-de_DE-ee6a0bf214c77dcdac7a8e34bb625df3.json:1:{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-04T15:33:29+00:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"admin-core\/assets\/build\/settings-app.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"(no title)":["(kein Titel)"],"Thank You":["Danke"],"View":["Ansicht"],"Edit":["Bearbeiten"],"Duplicate":["Duplikat"],"Export":["Exportieren"],"Delete":["L\u00f6schen"],"Default":["Standard"],"Restore":["Wiederherstellen"],"Edit Funnel":["Trichter bearbeiten"],"Funnels":["Trichter"],"Store Checkout":["Kasse"],"Automations":["Automatisierungen"],"Add-ons":["Add-ons"],"Dashboard":["Armaturenbrett"],"Cart Abandonment":["Warenkorbabbruch"],"Yes":["Ja"],"No":["Nein"],"Step":["Schritt"],"Settings":["Einstellungen"],"Rollback to Previous Version":["Zur\u00fcck zur vorherigen Version"],"33%":["33%"],"50%":["50%"],"100%":["100%"],"Field ID":["Feld-ID"],"Checked":["Gepr\u00fcft"],"Options":["Optionen"],"Placeholder":["Platzhalter"],"Required":["Erforderlich"],"Collapsible":["Zusammenklappbar"],"Activate WooCommerce":["WooCommerce aktivieren"],"Install WooCommerce":["WooCommerce installieren"],"General":["Allgemein"],"Text":["Text"],"Type":["Typ"],"Width":["Breite"],"Shipping":["Versand"],"Order Bumps":["Bestell-Erg\u00e4nzungen"],"Dynamic Offers":["Dynamische Angebote"],"Search for a coupon":["Suche nach einem Gutschein"],"Auto Apply Coupon":["Gutschein automatisch anwenden"],"Product Options":["Produktoptionen"],"Advanced":["Fortgeschritten"],"Product":["Produkt"],"Title":["Titel"],"Content":["Inhalt"],"Total Visits":["Gesamtbesuche"],"All Flows":["Alle Flows"],"Add New":["Neu hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Upgrade to CartFlows Pro":["Upgrade auf CartFlows Pro"],"Search Steps":["Suchschritte"],"Enable Custom Field Editor":["Benutzerdefinierten Felde-Editor aktivieren"],"Search for a Product":["Nach einem Produkt suchen"],"Billing":["Abrechnung"],"Settings Saved":["Einstellungen gespeichert"],"Saving\u2026":["Speichern\u2026"],"Save Settings":["Einstellungen speichern"],"Regular Price of the product":["Regul\u00e4rer Preis des Produkts"],"Price after discount.":["Preis nach Rabatt."],"Product Name":["Produktname"],"Use {{product_name}} and {{quantity}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Verwenden Sie {{product_name}} und {{quantity}}, um die jeweiligen Produktdetails dynamisch abzurufen."],"Subtext":["Untertext"],"Use {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Verwenden Sie {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}}, um die jeweiligen Produktdetails dynamisch abzurufen."],"Enable Highlight":["Hervorheben aktivieren"],"Highlight Text":["Text hervorheben"],"Create New Product":["Neues Produkt erstellen"],"Add":["Hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Once you have selected products, they will be displayed here.":["Sobald Sie Produkte ausgew\u00e4hlt haben, werden sie hier angezeigt."],"Items":["Artikel"],"Quantity":["Menge"],"Discount":["Rabatt"],"Adding\u2026":["Hinzuf\u00fcgen\u2026"],"Please search and select at-lease one product to add.":["Bitte suchen und w\u00e4hlen Sie mindestens ein Produkt aus, das hinzugef\u00fcgt werden soll."],"Reset":["Zur\u00fccksetzen"],"Image Preview":["Bildvorschau"],"Upload a file":["Datei hochladen"],"or drag and drop":["oder ziehen und ablegen"],"PNG, JPG, GIF up to 10MB":["PNG, JPG, GIF bis zu 10 MB"],"Select Dates":["Datum ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Bitte aktualisieren Sie auf das %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s, um die %3$s Funktion zu nutzen."],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Bitte upgraden Sie auf den %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s, um die %3$s Funktion zu nutzen."],"Please upgrade to the CartFlows Higher Plan to use the %s feature.":["Bitte upgraden Sie auf den CartFlows Higher Plan, um die