pla! Sie haben keinen Zugriff auf diese Seite."],"You don't have permission to access this page. Please reach out to your admin for help.":["Sie haben keine Berechtigung, auf diese Seite zuzugreifen. Bitte wenden Sie sich an Ihren Administrator, um Hilfe zu erhalten."],"Back to Dashboard":["Zur\u00fcck zum Dashboard"],"Integrations":["Integrationen"],"User Role Manager":["Benutzerrollen-Manager"],"Permalink":["Permalink"],"Version Control":["Versionskontrolle"],"Order":["Bestellung"],"License":["Lizenz"],"Sync Knowledge Base":["Wissensdatenbank synchronisieren"],"Knowledge Base":["Wissensdatenbank"],"Search knowledge base":["Wissensdatenbank durchsuchen"],"No Docs Founds":["Keine Dokumente gefunden"],"Please try syncing the docs library":["Bitte versuchen Sie, die Dokumentenbibliothek zu synchronisieren"],"Syncing\u2026":["Synchronisieren\u2026"],"Synced. Reloading..":["Synchronisiert. Neu laden.."],"Need Help?":["Brauchen Sie Hilfe?"],"We aim to answer all priority support requests within 2-3 hours.":["Wir streben an, alle vorrangigen Supportanfragen innerhalb von 2-3 Stunden zu beantworten."],"Get Support":["Unterst\u00fctzung erhalten"],"All Documentation":["Alle Dokumentation"],"Browse documentation, reference material, and tutorials for CartFlows.":["Durchsuchen Sie die Dokumentation, Referenzmaterialien und Tutorials f\u00fcr CartFlows."],"View documentation":["Dokumentation anzeigen"],"Videos":["Videos"],"Browse tutorial videos on our YouTube channel.":["Durchsuchen Sie Tutorial-Videos auf unserem YouTube-Kanal."],"Youtube Channel":["Youtube-Kanal"],"Support":["Unterst\u00fctzung"],"What's New?":["Was gibt's Neues?"],"Unlicensed":["Ohne Lizenz"],"Licensed":["Lizenziert"],"Open Global Settings":["Globale Einstellungen \u00f6ffnen"],"Tutorial Videos":["Lernvideos"],"More Options":["Weitere Optionen"],"Control":["Steuerung"],"Variation-%d":["Variation-%d"],"No Product Assigned":["Kein Produkt zugewiesen"],"Store Checkout - Remove selected checkout product":["Kasse - Ausgew\u00e4hltes Produkt aus dem Warenkorb entfernen"],"PRO":["PRO"],"Offer Accepted":["Angebot angenommen"],"Offer Rejected":["Angebot abgelehnt"],"Invalid Position":["Ung\u00fcltige Position"],"Views":["Ansichten"],"Conversions":["Konversionen"],"Revenue":["Einnahmen"],"Upgrade to Pro":["Upgrade auf Pro"],"%s Step":["%s Schritt"],"Step Editing is Disabled":["Die Bearbeitung von Schritten ist deaktiviert"],"Open Settings":["Einstellungen \u00f6ffnen"],"Duplicate Step":["Doppelter Schritt"],"Do you want to duplicate this step? Are you sure?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Schritt duplizieren? Sind Sie sicher?"],"Delete Step":["Schritt l\u00f6schen"],"Do you want to delete this step? Are you sure?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Schritt l\u00f6schen? Sind Sie sicher?"],"Declare Winner":["Gewinner erkl\u00e4ren"],"Do you want to declare this step as winner? Are you sure?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Schritt als Gewinner erkl\u00e4ren? Sind Sie sicher?"],"Archive Step":["Archivierungsschritt"],"Do you want to archive this step? Are you sure?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Schritt archivieren? Sind Sie sicher?"],"Saving..":["Speichern.."],"Saved":["Gespeichert"],"Reloading..":["Neu laden.."],"Split Test Testing":["Split-Test-Tests"],"Stop Split Test":["Split-Test stoppen"],"Start Split Test":["Split-Test starten"],"Split Test":["Split-Test"],"Stopping\u2026":["Stoppen\u2026"],"Starting\u2026":["Starten\u2026"],"Reloading\u2026":["Neu laden\u2026"],"Split Test Settings":["Einstellungen f\u00fcr den Split-Test"],"Restore Archived Variation":["Archivierte Variante wiederherstellen"],"Do you want to restore this archived variation? Are you sure?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diese archivierte Variante wiederherstellen? Sind Sie sicher?"],"Trash Archived Variation":["M\u00fcll archivierte Variation"],"This action will trash this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Diese Aktion wird diese archivierte Variante und ihre Analysedaten dauerhaft l\u00f6schen. %1$s M\u00f6chten Sie diese archivierte Variante l\u00f6schen?"],"Hide Archived Variation":["Archivierte Variante ausblenden"],"This action will hide this archived variation from the list of steps, but its analytics will be visible. %1$s Do you want to hide this archived variation?":["Diese Aktion wird diese archivierte Variante aus der Liste der Schritte ausblenden, aber ihre Analysen werden sichtbar sein. %1$s M\u00f6chten Sie diese archivierte Variante ausblenden?"],"This action will delete this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Diese Aktion wird diese archivierte Variante und ihre Analysedaten dauerhaft l\u00f6schen. %1$s M\u00f6chten Sie diese archivierte Variante l\u00f6schen?"],"Deleted On: ":["Gel\u00f6scht am:"],"Archived On: ":["Archiviert am:"],"Archived Steps":["Archivierte Schritte"],"Edit Step Name":["Schrittnamen bearbeiten"],"Save":["Speichern"],"Update Template":["Vorlage aktualisieren"],"Changing the template will permanently delete the current design in this step. Would you still like to proceed?":["Das \u00c4ndern der Vorlage wird das aktuelle Design in diesem Schritt dauerhaft l\u00f6schen. M\u00f6chten Sie trotzdem fortfahren?"],"Change Template":["Vorlage \u00e4ndern"],"If you are using shortcodes, enable this design settings to apply styles.":["Wenn Sie Shortcodes verwenden, aktivieren Sie diese Designeinstellungen, um Stile anzuwenden."],"Enable Design Settings":["Design-Einstellungen aktivieren"],"Activate %s":["Aktiviere %s"],"Activating %s":["Aktivierung von %s"],"Successfully Activated!":["Erfolgreich aktiviert!"],"Failed! Activation!":["Fehlgeschlagen! Aktivierung!"],"Upgrade to Cartflows Pro":["Upgrade zu Cartflows Pro"],"Activate the License":["Aktivieren Sie die Lizenz"],"Step Type: ":["Schritttyp:"],"License is required!":["Lizenz ist erforderlich!"],"Activate the license to modify this offer step's settings":["Aktivieren Sie die Lizenz, um die Einstellungen dieses Angebotschritts zu \u00e4ndern"],"No product Selected":["Kein Produkt ausgew\u00e4hlt"],"Once you select the product, they will be displayed here.":["Sobald Sie das Produkt ausgew\u00e4hlt haben, wird es hier angezeigt."],"Shipping Rate":["Versandkosten"],"Once you have add product, it will be displayed here.":["Sobald Sie ein Produkt hinzugef\u00fcgt haben, wird es hier angezeigt."],"Coupon will apply on checkout page":["Der Gutschein wird auf der Kassenseite angewendet"],"AND":["UND"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the conditional order bump feature.":["Bitte aktualisieren Sie CartFlows Pro auf die neueste Version, um die bedingte Order-Bump-Funktion zu nutzen."],"Enable conditional order bump ":["Bedingte Bestell-Erh\u00f6hung aktivieren"],"By enabling this option, you can create the conditions to display the order bump.":["Wenn Sie diese Option aktivieren, k\u00f6nnen Sie die Bedingungen schaffen, um den Bestellaufschlag anzuzeigen."],"Show this order bump if following conditions are true":["Zeige diesen Bestellaufschlag, wenn die folgenden Bedingungen erf\u00fcllt sind"],"Add Condition":["Bedingung hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"OR":["ODER"],"Add Conditions Group":["Bedingungsgruppe hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Order Bump Product Image":["Produktbild f\u00fcr Bestellaufschlag"],"Styles":["Stile"],"Conditions":["Bedingungen"],"Save Changes":["\u00c4nderungen speichern"],"You have made changes. Do you want to save the changes?":["Sie haben \u00c4nderungen vorgenommen. M\u00f6chten Sie die \u00c4nderungen speichern?"],"No product":["Kein Produkt"],"Duplicate Order Bump":["Doppelter Bestellsto\u00df"],"Edit Order Bump":["Bestell-Bump bearbeiten"],"Trash Order Bump":["M\u00fcll-Bestellsto\u00df"],"Do you really want to trash this order bump permanently?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Bestellaufschlag wirklich dauerhaft l\u00f6schen?"],"Delete Order Bump":["Bestellaufschlag l\u00f6schen"],"Status":["Status"],"Actions":["Aktionen"],"Create an order bump.":["Erstellen Sie einen Bestellaufschlag."],"Enter order bump name":["Geben Sie den Namen des Bestellaufschlags ein"],"Please enter the order bump title":["Bitte geben Sie den Titel des Bestellzusatzes ein"],"Preview":["Vorschau"],"View in Full Screen":["Im Vollbild anzeigen"],"Exit Full Screen":["Vollbildmodus beenden"],"Order Submitted":["Bestellung abgeschickt"],"Special Offer":["Sonderangebot"],"Order Receipt":["Bestellbeleg"],"Enable Checkout Offer":["Checkout-Angebot aktivieren"],"Dynamic Conditions":["Dynamische Bedingungen"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the dynamic offers feature.":["Bitte aktualisieren Sie CartFlows Pro auf die neueste Version, um die Funktion f\u00fcr dynamische Angebote zu nutzen."],"Enable Dynamic Offers":["Dynamische Angebote aktivieren"],"Redirect to: ":["Weiterleiten an:"],"Search for step\u2026":["Nach Schritt suchen\u2026"],"If the following conditions are true":["Wenn die folgenden Bedingungen zutreffen"],"Add Dynamic Offer":["Dynamisches Angebot hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Search for default step\u2026":["Suche nach dem Standard-Schritt\u2026"],"If all of the above conditions failed.":["Wenn alle oben genannten Bedingungen fehlgeschlagen sind."],"Label":["Etikett"],"ID":["ID"],"Enable":["Aktivieren"],"Add New Field":["Neues Feld hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Date & Time":["Datum & Uhrzeit"],"Add Custom Field":["Benutzerdefiniertes Feld hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"TextArea":["Textbereich"],"Number":["Zahl"],"Checkbox":["Kontrollk\u00e4stchen"],"Radio":["Radio"],"Select":["Ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Hidden":["Versteckt"],"Add To":["Hinzuf\u00fcgen zu"],"Label %1$s*%2$s":["Beschriftung %1$s*%2$s"],"Field value will store in this meta key. Add field id without prefix like \"billing_\" or \"shipping_\". %s Use \"_\" instead of spaces.":["Der Feldwert wird in diesem Metaschl\u00fcssel gespeichert. F\u00fcgen Sie die Feld-ID ohne Pr\u00e4fix wie \"billing_\" oder \"shipping_\" hinzu. %s Verwenden Sie \"_\" anstelle von Leerzeichen."],"Min Value":["Mindestwert"],"Max Value":["Maximalwert"],"Enter your options separated by (|).":["Geben Sie Ihre Optionen getrennt durch (|) ein."],"UnChecked":["Deaktiviert"],"Field Input Type":["Feld-Eingabetyp"],"Date":["Datum"],"Time":["Zeit"],"Min ":["Min"],"Max ":["Max"],"Show in Email":["In E-Mail anzeigen"],"Billing Fields":["Abrechnungsfelder"],"Shipping Fields":["Versandfelder"],"Delete Field":["Feld l\u00f6schen"],"Are you really want to delete field?":["M\u00f6chten Sie das Feld wirklich l\u00f6schen?"],"Field Editor":["Feldeditor"],"Label is required field":["Etikett ist ein Pflichtfeld"],"WooCommerce is Required!":["WooCommerce ist erforderlich!"],"To modify the %s step options, please install and activate the WooCommerce plugin.":["Um die %s Schrittoptionen zu \u00e4ndern, installieren und aktivieren Sie bitte das WooCommerce-Plugin."],"Activating\u2026":["Aktivierung\u2026"],"Activated":["Aktiviert"],"Funnel Settings":["Trichtereinstellungen"],"Save Setting":["Einstellung speichern"],"Disable Store Checkout":["Store-Checkout deaktivieren"],"Enable Store Checkout":["Store-Checkout aktivieren"],"Edit Title":["Titel bearbeiten"],"Publish":["Ver\u00f6ffentlichen"],"Do you really want to publish this funnel?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Funnel wirklich ver\u00f6ffentlichen?"],"Draft Funnel":["Entwurfs-Trichter"],"Do you really want to draft this funnel?":["M\u00f6chten Sie diesen Trichter wirklich entwerfen?"],"Unique Visits":["Einzigartige Besuche"],"Conversion Rate":["Konversionsrate"],"Total number of orders.":["Gesamtanzahl der Bestellungen."],"Grand total of all orders.":["Gesamtsumme aller Bestellungen."],"Average total of every order.":["Durchschnittlicher Gesamtbetrag jeder Bestellung."],"Grand total of all order bumps.":["Gesamtsumme aller Bestellaufschl\u00e4ge."],"Export Flow":["Exportfluss"],"View Funnel":["Trichter anzeigen"],"Open Funnel Settings":["Trichtereinstellungen \u00f6ffnen"],"Delete Store Checkout":["Kassenbereich des Gesch\u00e4fts l\u00f6schen"],"Do you really want to delete store checkout?%1$1sNOTE: This action cannot be reversed.":["M\u00f6chten Sie den Kassenbereich des Gesch\u00e4fts wirklich l\u00f6schen?%1$1sHINWEIS: Diese Aktion kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden."],"archived_date":["archived_date"],"%1$sNote:%2$s The orders which are placed by the admins are not considered while calculating the analytics.":["%1$sHinweis:%2$s Die Bestellungen, die von den Administratoren aufgegeben werden, werden bei der Berechnung der Analysen nicht ber\u00fccksichtigt."],"Reset Analytics":["Analysen zur\u00fccksetzen"],"Are you really want to reset funnel analytics?":["M\u00f6chten Sie die Trichteranalysen wirklich zur\u00fccksetzen?"],"Resetting":["Zur\u00fccksetzen"],"Automation for":["Automatisierung f\u00fcr"],"Create a distraction free, high-converting checkout experience without needing a page builder.":["Erstellen Sie ein ablenkungsfreies, hochkonvertierendes Checkout-Erlebnis, ohne einen Seitenersteller zu ben\u00f6tigen."],"Funnel Steps":["Trichterstufen"],"Add New Step":["Neuen Schritt hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"No Steps Added.":["Keine Schritte hinzugef\u00fcgt."],"Seems like there are no steps created or added in this flow":["Es scheint, dass in diesem Ablauf keine Schritte erstellt oder hinzugef\u00fcgt wurden"],"Add new step":["Neuen Schritt hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Select Step Type":["Schrittart ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Activating WooCommerce..":["WooCommerce wird aktiviert.."],"Installing WooCommerce..":["WooCommerce wird installiert.."],"Successfully Installed!":["Erfolgreich installiert!"],"Installation Failed!":["Installation fehlgeschlagen!"],"Import Step":["Importschritt"],"Add multiple steps to your flows today with an upgraded CartFlows plan.":["F\u00fcgen Sie heute mehrere Schritte zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen mit einem erweiterten CartFlows-Plan hinzu."],"Get CartFlows Higher Plan":["Holen Sie sich den h\u00f6heren Plan von CartFlows"],"Add multiple steps to your flows by activating %s.":["F\u00fcgen Sie mehrere Schritte zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen hinzu, indem Sie %s aktivieren."],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating %2$s.":["F\u00fcgen Sie %1$s Schritt zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen hinzu, indem Sie %2$s aktivieren."],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click %s to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Higher plan today.":["F\u00fcgen Sie unbegrenzt einkommenssteigernde Ein-Klick-%s zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen hinzu, wenn Sie heute auf unseren CartFlows Higher-Plan upgraden."],"Add %1$s step to your flow by activating CartFlows license.":["F\u00fcgen Sie %1$s Schritt zu Ihrem Ablauf hinzu, indem Sie die CartFlows-Lizenz aktivieren."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s.":["Greifen Sie auf alle unsere Pro-Vorlagen zu, indem Sie %s aktivieren."],"Access all of our pro templates when you upgrade your plan to CartFlows Pro today.":["Greifen Sie auf alle unsere Pro-Vorlagen zu, wenn Sie Ihr Abonnement noch heute auf CartFlows Pro upgraden."],"Get CartFlows Pro":["Holen Sie sich CartFlows Pro"],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating license.":["F\u00fcgen Sie %1$s Schritt zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen hinzu, indem Sie die Lizenz aktivieren."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this step.":["Sie ben\u00f6tigen das WooCommerce-Plugin, das installiert und aktiviert ist, um diesen Schritt zu importieren."],"Imported! Redirecting\u2026":["Importiert! Weiterleitung\u2026"]," Please sync the library and try importing the template again.":["Bitte synchronisieren Sie die Bibliothek und versuchen Sie, die Vorlage erneut zu importieren."],"Import Failed! Try again.":["Import fehlgeschlagen! Versuchen Sie es erneut."],"Create Step":["Schritt erstellen"],"Creating Step..":["Schritt wird erstellt.."],"Step Created! Redirecting\u2026":["Schritt erstellt! Weiterleitung\u2026"],"Failed to Create Step!":["Erstellen des Schritts fehlgeschlagen!"],"Activate license for adding more steps and other features.":["Aktivieren Sie die Lizenz, um weitere Schritte und andere Funktionen hinzuzuf\u00fcgen."],"Close the window":["Schlie\u00dfe das Fenster"],"Name Your Step":["Nennen Sie Ihren Schritt"],"Step Name":["Schrittname"],"Enter Step Name":["Schrittname eingeben"],"Learn How":["Erfahren Sie, wie"],"Create from Scratch":["Von Grund auf neu erstellen"],"Step thumbnail image":["Schritt Miniaturbild"],"Import":["Importieren"],"Back":["Zur\u00fcck"],"Sync Library":["Bibliothek synchronisieren"],"Importing page %d":["Seite %d wird importiert"],"Sync Complete":["Synchronisierung abgeschlossen"],"Syncing Library\u2026":["Bibliothek wird synchronisiert\u2026"],"Library Synced":["Bibliothek synchronisiert"],"Steps Library":["Schritte-Bibliothek"],"Get CartFlows Higher plan":["Holen Sie sich den h\u00f6heren CartFlows-Plan"],"Activate license for adding more flows and other features.":["Lizenz aktivieren, um weitere Flows und andere Funktionen hinzuzuf\u00fcgen."],"Importing Step..":["Schritt wird importiert.."],"Close":["Schlie\u00dfen"],"Error":["Fehler"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows by activating %s":["F\u00fcgen Sie Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen unbegrenzte einkommenssteigernde One-Click-Upsells hinzu, indem Sie %s aktivieren"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Plus or Pro plan today.":["F\u00fcgen Sie unbegrenzt einkommenssteigernde One-Click-Upsells zu Ihren Abl\u00e4ufen hinzu, wenn Sie heute auf unseren CartFlows Plus- oder Pro-Plan upgraden."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s":["Greifen Sie auf alle unsere Pro-Vorlagen zu, indem Sie %s aktivieren"],"Templates for %s":["Vorlagen f\u00fcr %s"],"Please wait\u2026":["Bitte warten\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating funnel\u2026":["Bitte warten. Trichter wird dupliziert\u2026"],"Please wait. Drafting funnel\u2026":["Bitte warten. Trichter wird entworfen\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting funnel\u2026":["Bitte warten. Trichter wird gel\u00f6scht\u2026"],"Please wait. Restoring funnel\u2026":["Bitte warten. Trichter wird wiederhergestellt\u2026"],"Please wait. Exporting\u2026":["Bitte warten. Exportieren\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating step\u2026":["Bitte warten. Schritt wird dupliziert\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting step\u2026":["Bitte warten. Schritt wird gel\u00f6scht\u2026"],"Please wait. Creating variation\u2026":["Bitte warten. Variation wird erstellt\u2026"],"Please wait. Archiving variation\u2026":["Bitte warten. Variation wird archiviert\u2026"],"Please wait. Declaring winner\u2026":["Bitte warten. Gewinner wird ermittelt\u2026"],"Analytics":["Analytik"],"Draft":["Entwurf"],"Name":["Name"],"Activating":["Aktivieren"],"Failed":["Fehlgeschlagen"],"Remove Image":["Bild entfernen"],"Unlock Premium Features with CartFlows PRO!":["Schalten Sie Premium-Funktionen mit CartFlows PRO frei!"],"Get the tools you need to create powerful sales funnels, increase conversions, and grow your business with ease.":["Holen Sie sich die Werkzeuge, die Sie ben\u00f6tigen, um leistungsstarke Verkaufstrichter zu erstellen, die Konversionen zu steigern und Ihr Gesch\u00e4ft m\u00fchelos auszubauen."],"Select a Settings Tab":["W\u00e4hlen Sie einen Einstellungen-Tab"],"Free vs Pro":["Frei vs Pro"],"Increase Your Revenue with Smart Order Bumps":["Steigern Sie Ihren Umsatz mit intelligenten Bestell-Erg\u00e4nzungen"],"Boost sales with CartFlows\u2019 Order Bump! Offer personalized add-ons at checkout to increase revenue effortlessly. Quick to set up, no coding needed!":["Steigern Sie den Umsatz mit dem Order Bump von CartFlows! Bieten Sie personalisierte Zusatzangebote beim Checkout an, um den Umsatz m\u00fchelos zu steigern. Schnell einzurichten, keine Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich!"],"Show the Right Offer to the Right People \u2013 Automatically!":["Zeigen Sie das richtige Angebot den richtigen Personen \u2013 automatisch!"],"Personalize deals based on location, cart details, and more. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and unlock this smart feature today!":["Personalisieren Sie Angebote basierend auf Standort, Warenkorbdetails und mehr. Upgraden Sie auf CartFlows PRO und schalten Sie dieses intelligente Feature noch heute frei!"],"Boost Sales Instantly with Auto-Applied Coupons!":["Steigern Sie den Umsatz sofort mit automatisch angewendeten Gutscheinen!"],"No codes, no hassle\u2014discounts apply instantly at checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start converting more customers today!":["Keine Codes, kein Aufwand \u2013 Rabatte werden sofort an der Kasse angewendet. Upgrade auf CartFlows PRO und beginnen Sie noch heute, mehr Kunden zu gewinnen!"],"Give Your Customers More Choices, Boost Your Sales":["Geben Sie Ihren Kunden mehr Auswahlm\u00f6glichkeiten, steigern Sie Ihren Umsatz"],"Make buying easier with flexible product options. Let customers make the right choices from your checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start customizing today!":["Machen Sie den Kauf einfacher mit flexiblen Produktoptionen. Lassen Sie Kunden die richtigen Entscheidungen an der Kasse treffen. Upgraden Sie zu CartFlows PRO und beginnen Sie noch heute mit der Anpassung!"],"Optin Product":["Optin-Produkt"],"Select free & virtual product only. Once you select a product, it will be displayed here.":["W\u00e4hlen Sie nur kostenlose und virtuelle Produkte aus. Sobald Sie ein Produkt ausgew\u00e4hlt haben, wird es hier angezeigt."],"Search for a Free & Virtual Product":["Suche nach einem kostenlosen und virtuellen Produkt"],"Please select a free & virtual product only.":["Bitte w\u00e4hlen Sie nur ein kostenloses und virtuelles Produkt aus."],"Free":["Kostenlos"],"A\/B Testing":["A\/B-Tests"],"Optimize your sales with A\/B testing in CartFlows! Experiment with product pricing, page layouts, messaging, and design. Create variants, analyze results, and discover new ways to boost revenue.":["Optimieren Sie Ihre Verk\u00e4ufe mit A\/B-Tests in CartFlows! Experimentieren Sie mit Produktpreisen, Seitenlayouts, Nachrichten und Design. Erstellen Sie Varianten, analysieren Sie Ergebnisse und entdecken Sie neue Wege zur Umsatzsteigerung."],"Modern Cart":["Moderner Warenkorb"],"Enable Instant Layout":["Sofortlayout aktivieren"],"Disabled":["Deaktiviert"],"upgrading to PRO":["Upgrade auf PRO"],"activating CartFlows Pro":["CartFlows Pro aktivieren"],"You're using":["Sie verwenden"],"CartFlows Free":["CartFlows Kostenlos"],"To unlock more features, consider":["Um mehr Funktionen freizuschalten, ziehen Sie in Betracht"],"Activate CartFlows Pro":["CartFlows Pro aktivieren"],"You can't edit this step directly because Instant Layout is turned on in the funnel settings. To make design changes, go to the Design tab inside this step's settings.":["Sie k\u00f6nnen diesen Schritt nicht direkt bearbeiten, da das Instant Layout in den Trichtereinstellungen aktiviert ist. Um Design\u00e4nderungen vorzunehmen, gehen Sie zum Design-Tab in den Einstellungen dieses Schritts."],"Use this setting to customize the style of the Instant %s Layout.":["Verwenden Sie diese Einstellung, um den Stil des Instant-%s-Layouts anzupassen."],"Turn this on to set up rules that decide when visitors should be redirected to a special offer or the next step.":["Schalten Sie dies ein, um Regeln festzulegen, die entscheiden, wann Besucher zu einem Sonderangebot oder dem n\u00e4chsten Schritt weitergeleitet werden sollen."],"Your email address can't be edited when using the Modern Checkout Style.":["Ihre E-Mail-Adresse kann nicht bearbeitet werden, wenn Sie den modernen Checkout-Stil verwenden."],"The Company field won't be visible if you're using the Instant Layout Style.":["Das Feld \"Firma\" wird nicht sichtbar sein, wenn Sie den Sofort-Layout-Stil verwenden."],"Opt-in":["Einwilligung"],"The product previously added as an Order Bump has been deleted. Please add a new product.":["Das zuvor als Bestell-Erg\u00e4nzung hinzugef\u00fcgte Produkt wurde gel\u00f6scht. Bitte f\u00fcgen Sie ein neues Produkt hinzu."],"Choose a variation":["W\u00e4hlen Sie eine Variante"],"For more information about order bump settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["F\u00fcr weitere Informationen zu den Einstellungen f\u00fcr Bestellaufschl\u00e4ge %1$sKlicken Sie hier.%2$s"],"Sum of all step views in this funnel.":["Summe aller Schrittansichten in diesem Trichter."],"Total upsell\/downsell revenue.":["Gesamter Umsatz durch Upselling\/Downselling."],"Revenue per visit.":["Umsatz pro Besuch."],"Revenue per unique visitor.":["Umsatz pro einzigartigen Besucher."],"Sandbox Mode":["Sandbox-Modus"],"Live Mode":["Live-Modus"],"Learn":["Lernen"],"File Size (MB)":["Dateigr\u00f6\u00dfe (MB)"],"Accepted File Types":["Akzeptierte Dateitypen"],"Back to Webhooks":["Zur\u00fcck zu Webhooks"],"Edit Webhook":["Webhook bearbeiten"],"Add New Webhook":["Neuen Webhook hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"e.g. CRM Integration":["z.B. CRM-Integration"],"Endpoint URL":["Endpoint-URL"],"Events":["Ereignisse"],"Select events that will trigger this webhook.":["W\u00e4hlen Sie Ereignisse aus, die diesen Webhook ausl\u00f6sen."],"Select All":["Alle ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Enabled":["Aktiviert"],"Max Retries":["Maximale Wiederholungen"],"Number of retry attempts for failed deliveries (0-5).":["Anzahl der Wiederholungsversuche f\u00fcr fehlgeschlagene Zustellungen (0-5)."],"Secret Key":["Geheimer Schl\u00fcssel"],"Used to sign webhook payloads (HMAC-SHA256).":["Wird verwendet, um Webhook-Nutzlasten zu signieren (HMAC-SHA256)."],"Copy to clipboard":["In die Zwischenablage kopieren"],"Copied!":["Kopiert!"],"Please enter a webhook name.":["Bitte geben Sie einen Webhook-Namen ein."],"Please enter a webhook URL.":["Bitte geben Sie eine Webhook-URL ein."],"Please enter a valid URL.":["Bitte geben Sie eine g\u00fcltige URL ein."],"Please select at least one event.":["Bitte w\u00e4hlen Sie mindestens ein Ereignis aus."],"Failed to save webhook.":["Webhook konnte nicht gespeichert werden."],"Something went wrong.":["Etwas ist schiefgelaufen."],"Update Webhook":["Webhook aktualisieren"],"Create Webhook":["Webhook erstellen"],"Webhooks":["Webhooks"],"Send real-time event data to external services when key funnel events occur.":["Senden Sie Echtzeit-Ereignisdaten an externe Dienste, wenn wichtige Trichterereignisse auftreten."],"No webhooks configured yet. Click \"Add New Webhook\" to get started.":["Noch keine Webhooks konfiguriert. Klicken Sie auf \"Neuen Webhook hinzuf\u00fcgen\", um zu beginnen."],"URL":["URL"],"Last Delivery":["Letzte Lieferung"],"events":["Ereignisse"],"Success":["Erfolg"],"Never triggered":["Nie ausgel\u00f6st"],"Test sent!":["Test gesendet!"],"Send Test":["Test senden"],"Are you sure you want to delete this webhook?":["Sind Sie sicher, dass Sie diesen Webhook l\u00f6schen m\u00f6chten?"],"Global CSS & Scripts":["Globale CSS & Skripte"],"Successfully Activated":["Erfolgreich aktiviert"],"Activation Failed":["Aktivierung fehlgeschlagen"],"File":["Datei"],"Enter the maximum allowed file size. Default is 5MB.":["Geben Sie die maximal erlaubte Dateigr\u00f6\u00dfe ein. Standard ist 5 MB."],"Enter comma-separated file extensions (e.g. jpg, png, gif)":["Geben Sie durch Kommas getrennte Dateierweiterungen ein (z. B. jpg, png, gif)"],"Invalid file type(s): %s":["Ung\u00fcltiger Dateityp(e): %s"],"Delete Webhook":["Webhook l\u00f6schen"]}}}
plugins/cartflows/languages/cartflows-it_IT-ee6a0bf214c77dcdac7a8e34bb625df3.json:1:{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-04T15:33:29+00:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"admin-core\/assets\/build\/settings-app.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"(no title)":["(nessun titolo)"],"Thank You":["Grazie"],"View":["Visualizza"],"Edit":["Modifica"],"Duplicate":["Duplicato"],"Export":["Esporta"],"Delete":["Elimina"],"Default":["Predefinito"],"Restore":["Ripristina"],"Edit Funnel":["Modifica Funnel"],"Funnels":["Imbuti"],"Store Checkout":["Cassa del negozio"],"Automations":["Automazioni"],"Add-ons":["Componenti aggiuntivi"],"Dashboard":["Cruscotto"],"Cart Abandonment":["Abbandono del carrello"],"Yes":["S\u00ec"],"No":["No"],"Step":["Passo"],"Settings":["Impostazioni"],"Rollback to Previous Version":["Ripristina alla versione precedente"],"33%":["33%"],"50%":["50%"],"100%":["100%"],"Field ID":["ID del campo"],"Checked":["Controllato"],"Options":["Opzioni"],"Placeholder":["Segnaposto"],"Required":["Richiesto"],"Collapsible":["Pieghevole"],"Activate WooCommerce":["Attiva WooCommerce"],"Install WooCommerce":["Installa WooCommerce"],"General":["Generale"],"Text":["Testo"],"Type":["Digita"],"Width":["Larghezza"],"Shipping":["Spedizione"],"Order Bumps":["Incrementi d'ordine"],"Dynamic Offers":["Offerte Dinamiche"],"Search for a coupon":["Cerca un coupon"],"Auto Apply Coupon":["Applica automaticamente il coupon"],"Product Options":["Opzioni del prodotto"],"Advanced":["Avanzato"],"Product":["Prodotto"],"Title":["Titolo"],"Content":["Contenuto"],"Total Visits":["Visite totali"],"All Flows":["Tutti i flussi"],"Add New":["Aggiungi nuovo"],"Upgrade to CartFlows Pro":["Aggiorna a CartFlows Pro"],"Search Steps":["Passaggi di ricerca"],"Enable Custom Field Editor":["Abilita l'editor di campi personalizzati"],"Search for a Product":["Cerca un prodotto"],"Billing":["Fatturazione"],"Settings Saved":["Impostazioni salvate"],"Saving\u2026":["Salvataggio in corso\u2026"],"Save Settings":["Salva impostazioni"],"Regular Price of the product":["Prezzo normale del prodotto"],"Price after discount.":["Prezzo dopo lo sconto."],"Product Name":["Nome del prodotto"],"Use {{product_name}} and {{quantity}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Usa {{product_name}} e {{quantity}} per recuperare dinamicamente i dettagli del rispettivo prodotto."],"Subtext":["Sottotesto"],"Use {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Usa {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} per recuperare dinamicamente i rispettivi dettagli del prodotto."],"Enable Highlight":["Abilita evidenziazione"],"Highlight Text":["Testo evidenziato"],"Create New Product":["Crea nuovo prodotto"],"Add":["Aggiungi"],"Once you have selected products, they will be displayed here.":["Una volta selezionati i prodotti, verranno visualizzati qui."],"Items":["Articoli"],"Quantity":["Quantit\u00e0"],"Discount":["Sconto"],"Adding\u2026":["Aggiungendo\u2026"],"Please search and select at-lease one product to add.":["Si prega di cercare e selezionare almeno un prodotto da aggiungere."],"Reset":["Reimposta"],"Image Preview":["Anteprima immagine"],"Upload a file":["Carica un file"],"or drag and drop":["o trascina e rilascia"],"PNG, JPG, GIF up to 10MB":["PNG, JPG, GIF fino a 10MB"],"Select Dates":["Seleziona date"],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Si prega di eseguire l'upgrade a %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s per utilizzare la funzione %3$s."],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Si prega di eseguire l'upgrade al %1$s piano superiore di CartFlows %2$s per utilizzare la funzione %3$s."],"Please upgrade to the CartFlows Higher Plan to use the %s feature.":["Si prega di eseguire l'upgrade al piano superiore di CartFlows per utilizzare la funzione %s."],"Role":["Ruolo"],"Access":["Accesso"],"For more information about the user role management please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Per ulteriori informazioni sulla gestione dei ruoli utente, si prega di %1$sfare clic qui.%2$s"],"Are you sure you want to rollback to %1$s v%2$s?":["Sei sicuro di voler tornare a %1$s v%2$s?"],"Rollback":["Ripristina"],"Cancel":["Annulla"],"Experiencing an issue with the current version of CartFlows? Roll back to a previous version to help troubleshoot the problem.":["Stai riscontrando un problema con la versione attuale di CartFlows? Torna a una versione precedente per aiutare a risolvere il problema."],"Regenerate Now":["Rigenera ora"],"Reset Permalinks Settings":["Reimposta le impostazioni dei permalink"],"Activate License":["Attiva licenza"],"Deactivate License":["Disattiva licenza"],"Please enter a valid license key!":["Per favore, inserisci un codice di licenza valido!"],"Processing":["Elaborazione"],"Unknown error occurred while activating the license.":["Si \u00e8 verificato un errore sconosciuto durante l'attivazione della licenza."],"Facebook Pixel":["Pixel di Facebook"],"Google Analytics Pixel":["Pixel di Google Analytics"],"Google Ads Pixel":["Pixel di Google Ads"],"Tiktok Pixel":["Pixel di Tiktok"],"Pinterest Tag":["Tag di Pinterest"],"Snapchat Pixel":["Snapchat Pixel"],"Google Auto Address":["Indirizzo automatico di Google"],"Regenerate Inline CSS":["Rigenera CSS inline"]," Regenerating\u2026.":["Rigenerazione in corso\u2026."],"Regenerated":["Rigenerato"],"If you are using the CartFlows Shortcode and using the Design Settings, then this option will regenerate the steps inline CSS. To learn more, %1$1s Click here %2$2s.":["Se stai utilizzando lo Shortcode di CartFlows e le Impostazioni di Design, questa opzione rigenerer\u00e0 i passaggi del CSS inline. Per saperne di pi\u00f9, %1$1s fai clic qui %2$2s."],"Updating":["Aggiornamento"],"Permalinks reset successfully":["Permalink reimpostati con successo"],"For more information about the CartFlows Permalink settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Per ulteriori informazioni sulle impostazioni del Permalink di CartFlows, si prega di %1$sfare clic qui.%2$s"],"Oops! You don't have access to this page.":["Ops! Non hai accesso a questa pagina."],"You don't have permission to access this page. Please reach out to your admin for help.":["Non hai il permesso di accedere a questa pagina. Contatta il tuo amministratore per assistenza."],"Back to Dashboard":["Torna alla Dashboard"],"Integrations":["Integrazioni"],"User Role Manager":["Gestore dei Ruoli Utente"],"Permalink":["Permalink"],"Version Control":["Controllo delle versioni"],"Order":["Ordine"],"License":["Licenza"],"Sync Knowledge Base":["Sincronizza la base di conoscenza"],"Knowledge Base":["Base di conoscenza"],"Search knowledge base":["Cerca nella base di conoscenza"],"No Docs Founds":["Nessun documento trovato"],"Please try syncing the docs library":["Per favore, prova a sincronizzare la libreria di documenti"],"Syncing\u2026":["Sincronizzazione in corso\u2026"],"Synced. Reloading..":["Sincronizzato. Ricaricamento in corso.."],"Need Help?":["Hai bisogno di aiuto?"],"We aim to answer all priority support requests within 2-3 hours.":["Miriamo a rispondere a tutte le richieste di supporto prioritario entro 2-3 ore."],"Get Support":["Ottieni supporto"],"All Documentation":["Tutta la documentazione"],"Browse documentation, reference material, and tutorials for CartFlows.":["Esplora la documentazione, il materiale di riferimento e i tutorial per CartFlows."],"View documentation":["Visualizza documentazione"],"Videos":["Video"],"Browse tutorial videos on our YouTube channel.":["Sfoglia i video tutorial sul nostro canale YouTube."],"Youtube Channel":["Canale Youtube"],"Support":["Supporto"],"What's New?":["Novit\u00e0?"],"Unlicensed":["Senza licenza"],"Licensed":["Concesso in licenza"],"Open Global Settings":["Apri Impostazioni Globali"],"Tutorial Videos":["Video tutorial"],"More Options":["Altre opzioni"],"Control":["Controllo"],"Variation-%d":["Variazione-%d"],"No Product Assigned":["Nessun prodotto assegnato"],"Store Checkout - Remove selected checkout product":["Cassa del negozio - Rimuovi il prodotto selezionato dal carrello"],"PRO":["PRO"],"Offer Accepted":["Offerta accettata"],"Offer Rejected":["Offerta rifiutata"],"Invalid Position":["Posizione non valida"],"Views":["Visualizzazioni"],"Conversions":["Conversioni"],"Revenue":["Entrate"],"Upgrade to Pro":["Passa a Pro"],"%s Step":["Passo %s"],"Step Editing is Disabled":["Modifica del passaggio disabilitata"],"Open Settings":["Apri Impostazioni"],"Duplicate Step":["Duplica passaggio"],"Do you want to duplicate this step? Are you sure?":["Vuoi duplicare questo passaggio? Sei sicuro?"],"Delete Step":["Elimina passaggio"],"Do you want to delete this step? Are you sure?":["Vuoi eliminare questo passaggio? Sei sicuro?"],"Declare Winner":["Dichiara vincitore"],"Do you want to declare this step as winner? Are you sure?":["Vuoi dichiarare questo passaggio come vincitore? Sei sicuro?"],"Archive Step":["Passaggio di archiviazione"],"Do you want to archive this step? Are you sure?":["Vuoi archiviare questo passaggio? Sei sicuro?"],"Saving..":["Salvataggio in corso.."],"Saved":["Salvato"],"Reloading..":["Ricaricamento in corso.."],"Split Test Testing":["Test di suddivisione"],"Stop Split Test":["Interrompi test diviso"],"Start Split Test":["Inizia il test diviso"],"Split Test":["Test diviso"],"Stopping\u2026":["Interrompendo\u2026"],"Starting\u2026":["Inizio\u2026"],"Reloading\u2026":["Ricaricamento\u2026"],"Split Test Settings":["Impostazioni del test diviso"],"Restore Archived Variation":["Ripristina variazione archiviata"],"Do you want to restore this archived variation? Are you sure?":["Vuoi ripristinare questa variazione archiviata? Sei sicuro?"],"Trash Archived Variation":["Variazione Archiviata del Cestino"],"This action will trash this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Questa azione eliminer\u00e0 definitivamente questa variazione archiviata e i suoi dati analitici. %1$s Vuoi eliminare questa variazione archiviata?"],"Hide Archived Variation":["Nascondi variazione archiviata"],"This action will hide this archived variation from the list of steps, but its analytics will be visible. %1$s Do you want to hide this archived variation?":["Questa azione nasconder\u00e0 questa variazione archiviata dall'elenco dei passaggi, ma le sue analisi saranno visibili. %1$s Vuoi nascondere questa variazione archiviata?"],"This action will delete this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Questa azione eliminer\u00e0 definitivamente questa variazione archiviata e i suoi dati analitici. %1$s Vuoi eliminare questa variazione archiviata?"],"Deleted On: ":["Eliminato il:"],"Archived On: ":["Archiviato il:"],"Archived Steps":["Passaggi archiviati"],"Edit Step Name":["Modifica il nome del passaggio"],"Save":["Salva"],"Update Template":["Aggiorna modello"],"Changing the template will permanently delete the current design in this step. Would you still like to proceed?":["Modificare il modello eliminer\u00e0 definitivamente il design attuale in questo passaggio. Vuoi comunque procedere?"],"Change Template":["Cambia modello"],"If you are using shortcodes, enable this design settings to apply styles.":["Se stai utilizzando i codici brevi, abilita queste impostazioni di design per applicare gli stili."],"Enable Design Settings":["Abilita impostazioni di design"],"Activate %s":["Attiva %s"],"Activating %s":["Attivazione di %s"],"Successfully Activated!":["Attivato con successo!"],"Failed! Activation!":["Fallito! Attivazione!"],"Upgrade to Cartflows Pro":["Aggiorna a Cartflows Pro"],"Activate the License":["Attiva la licenza"],"Step Type: ":["Tipo di passaggio:"],"License is required!":["\u00c8 necessaria la licenza!"],"Activate the license to modify this offer step's settings":["Attiva la licenza per modificare le impostazioni di questo passaggio dell'offerta"],"No product Selected":["Nessun prodotto selezionato"],"Once you select the product, they will be displayed here.":["Una volta selezionato il prodotto, verranno visualizzati qui."],"Shipping Rate":["Tariffa di spedizione"],"Once you have add product, it will be displayed here.":["Una volta aggiunto il prodotto, verr\u00e0 visualizzato qui."],"Coupon will apply on checkout page":["Il coupon verr\u00e0 applicato nella pagina di pagamento"],"AND":["E"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the conditional order bump feature.":["Si prega di aggiornare CartFlows Pro all'ultima versione per utilizzare la funzione di ordine condizionale."],"Enable conditional order bump ":["Abilita l'ordine condizionale aggiuntivo"],"By enabling this option, you can create the conditions to display the order bump.":["Abilitando questa opzione, puoi creare le condizioni per visualizzare l'ordine aggiuntivo."],"Show this order bump if following conditions are true":["Mostra questo ordine aggiuntivo se le seguenti condizioni sono vere"],"Add Condition":["Aggiungi condizione"],"OR":["O"],"Add Conditions Group":["Aggiungi gruppo di condizioni"],"Order Bump Product Image":["Immagine del prodotto aggiuntivo all'ordine"],"Styles":["Stili"],"Conditions":["Condizioni"],"Save Changes":["Salva le modifiche"],"You have made changes. Do you want to save the changes?":["Hai apportato delle modifiche. Vuoi salvare le modifiche?"],"No product":["Nessun prodotto"],"Duplicate Order Bump":["Duplicare l'ordine aggiuntivo"],"Edit Order Bump":["Modifica l'Offerta Aggiuntiva"],"Trash Order Bump":["Elimina l'ordine aggiuntivo"],"Do you really want to trash this order bump permanently?":["Vuoi davvero eliminare definitivamente questo ordine aggiuntivo?"],"Delete Order Bump":["Elimina l'ordine aggiuntivo"],"Status":["Stato"],"Actions":["Azioni"],"Create an order bump.":["Crea un'offerta aggiuntiva."],"Enter order bump name":["Inserisci il nome del bump dell'ordine"],"Please enter the order bump title":["Per favore inserisci il titolo del supplemento all'ordine"],"Preview":["Anteprima"],"View in Full Screen":["Visualizza a schermo intero"],"Exit Full Screen":["Esci dalla modalit\u00e0 a schermo intero"],"Order Submitted":["Ordine inviato"],"Special Offer":["Offerta Speciale"],"Order Receipt":["Ricevuta d'ordine"],"Enable Checkout Offer":["Abilita Offerta di Checkout"],"Dynamic Conditions":["Condizioni dinamiche"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the dynamic offers feature.":["Si prega di aggiornare CartFlows Pro all'ultima versione per utilizzare la funzione di offerte dinamiche."],"Enable Dynamic Offers":["Abilita Offerte Dinamiche"],"Redirect to: ":["Reindirizza a:"],"Search for step\u2026":["Cerca il passaggio\u2026"],"If the following conditions are true":["Se le seguenti condizioni sono vere"],"Add Dynamic Offer":["Aggiungi Offerta Dinamica"],"Search for default step\u2026":["Cerca il passaggio predefinito\u2026"],"If all of the above conditions failed.":["Se tutte le condizioni sopra menzionate falliscono."],"Label":["Etichetta"],"ID":["ID"],"Enable":["Abilita"],"Add New Field":["Aggiungi nuovo campo"],"Date & Time":["Data e Ora"],"Add Custom Field":["Aggiungi campo personalizzato"],"TextArea":["Area di testo"],"Number":["Numero"],"Checkbox":["Casella di controllo"],"Radio":["Radio"],"Select":["Seleziona"],"Hidden":["Nascosto"],"Add To":["Aggiungi a"],"Label %1$s*%2$s":["Etichetta %1$s*%2$s"],"Field value will store in this meta key. Add field id without prefix like \"billing_\" or \"shipping_\". %s Use \"_\" instead of spaces.":["Il valore del campo verr\u00e0 memorizzato in questa chiave meta. Aggiungi l'ID del campo senza prefisso come \"billing_\" o \"shipping_\". %s Usa \"_\" invece degli spazi."],"Min Value":["Valore minimo"],"Max Value":["Valore massimo"],"Enter your options separated by (|).":["Inserisci le tue opzioni separate da (|)."],"UnChecked":["Non selezionato"],"Field Input Type":["Tipo di input del campo"],"Date":["Data"],"Time":["Tempo"],"Min ":["Min"],"Max ":["Max"],"Show in Email":["Mostra nell'email"],"Billing Fields":["Campi di fatturazione"],"Shipping Fields":["Campi di spedizione"],"Delete Field":["Elimina campo"],"Are you really want to delete field?":["Vuoi davvero eliminare il campo?"],"Field Editor":["Editor di campo"],"Label is required field":["Il campo etichetta \u00e8 obbligatorio"],"WooCommerce is Required!":["WooCommerce \u00e8 richiesto!"],"To modify the %s step options, please install and activate the WooCommerce plugin.":["Per modificare le opzioni del passaggio %s, installa e attiva il plugin WooCommerce."],"Activating\u2026":["Attivazione in corso\u2026"],"Activated":["Attivato"],"Funnel Settings":["Impostazioni del funnel"],"Save Setting":["Salva impostazione"],"Disable Store Checkout":["Disabilita il checkout del negozio"],"Enable Store Checkout":["Abilita il checkout del negozio"],"Edit Title":["Modifica titolo"],"Publish":["Pubblica"],"Do you really want to publish this funnel?":["Vuoi davvero pubblicare questo funnel?"],"Draft Funnel":["Bozza di Funnel"],"Do you really want to draft this funnel?":["Vuoi davvero creare questo funnel?"],"Unique Visits":["Visite uniche"],"Conversion Rate":["Tasso di conversione"],"Total number of orders.":["Numero totale di ordini."],"Grand total of all orders.":["Totale complessivo di tutti gli ordini."],"Average total of every order.":["Totale medio di ogni ordine."],"Grand total of all order bumps.":["Totale complessivo di tutti gli aumenti d'ordine."],"Export Flow":["Flusso di esportazione"],"View Funnel":["Visualizza imbuto"],"Open Funnel Settings":["Apri Impostazioni del Funnel"],"Delete Store Checkout":["Elimina il checkout del negozio"],"Do you really want to delete store checkout?%1$1sNOTE: This action cannot be reversed.":["Vuoi davvero eliminare il checkout del negozio?%1$1sNOTA: Questa azione non pu\u00f2 essere annullata."],"archived_date":["archived_date"],"%1$sNote:%2$s The orders which are placed by the admins are not considered while calculating the analytics.":["%1$sNota:%2$s Gli ordini effettuati dagli amministratori non vengono considerati nel calcolo delle analisi."],"Reset Analytics":["Reimposta analisi"],"Are you really want to reset funnel analytics?":["Vuoi davvero reimpostare le analisi del funnel?"],"Resetting":["Reimpostazione"],"Automation for":["Automazione per"],"Create a distraction free, high-converting checkout experience without needing a page builder.":["Crea un'esperienza di pagamento senza distrazioni e ad alta conversione senza bisogno di un costruttore di pagine."],"Funnel Steps":["Fasi del funnel"],"Add New Step":["Aggiungi nuovo passaggio"],"No Steps Added.":["Nessun passaggio aggiunto."],"Seems like there are no steps created or added in this flow":["Sembra che non ci siano passaggi creati o aggiunti in questo flusso"],"Add new step":["Aggiungi nuovo passaggio"],"Select Step Type":["Seleziona il tipo di passaggio"],"Activating WooCommerce..":["Attivazione di WooCommerce.."],"Installing WooCommerce..":["Installazione di WooCommerce.."],"Successfully Installed!":["Installato con successo!"],"Installation Failed!":["Installazione fallita!"],"Import Step":["Passaggio di importazione"],"Add multiple steps to your flows today with an upgraded CartFlows plan.":["Aggiungi pi\u00f9 passaggi ai tuoi flussi oggi con un piano CartFlows aggiornato."],"Get CartFlows Higher Plan":["Ottieni il piano superiore di CartFlows"],"Add multiple steps to your flows by activating %s.":["Aggiungi pi\u00f9 passaggi ai tuoi flussi attivando %s."],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating %2$s.":["Aggiungi il passaggio %1$s ai tuoi flussi attivando %2$s."],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click %s to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Higher plan today.":["Aggiungi %s a clic singolo per aumentare illimitatamente il reddito ai tuoi flussi quando esegui l'upgrade al nostro piano CartFlows Higher oggi stesso."],"Add %1$s step to your flow by activating CartFlows license.":["Aggiungi il passaggio %1$s al tuo flusso attivando la licenza CartFlows."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s.":["Accedi a tutti i nostri modelli pro attivando %s."],"Access all of our pro templates when you upgrade your plan to CartFlows Pro today.":["Accedi a tutti i nostri modelli pro quando aggiorni il tuo piano a CartFlows Pro oggi."],"Get CartFlows Pro":["Ottieni CartFlows Pro"],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating license.":["Aggiungi il passaggio %1$s ai tuoi flussi attivando la licenza."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this step.":["\u00c8 necessario che il plugin WooCommerce sia installato e attivato per importare questo passaggio."],"Imported! Redirecting\u2026":["Importato! Reindirizzamento\u2026"]," Please sync the library and try importing the template again.":["Per favore, sincronizza la libreria e prova a importare di nuovo il modello."],"Import Failed! Try again.":["Importazione fallita! Riprova."],"Create Step":["Crea passaggio"],"Creating Step..":["Creazione del passaggio.."],"Step Created! Redirecting\u2026":["Passo creato! Reindirizzamento\u2026"],"Failed to Create Step!":["Creazione del passaggio non riuscita!"],"Activate license for adding more steps and other features.":["Attiva la licenza per aggiungere pi\u00f9 passaggi e altre funzionalit\u00e0."],"Close the window":["Chiudi la finestra"],"Name Your Step":["Nomina il tuo passo"],"Step Name":["Nome del passaggio"],"Enter Step Name":["Inserisci il nome del passaggio"],"Learn How":["Scopri come"],"Create from Scratch":["Crea da zero"],"Step thumbnail image":["Immagine in miniatura del passaggio"],"Import":["Importa"],"Back":["Indietro"],"Sync Library":["Sincronizza libreria"],"Importing page %d":["Importazione della pagina %d"],"Sync Complete":["Sincronizzazione completata"],"Syncing Library\u2026":["Sincronizzazione della libreria\u2026"],"Library Synced":["Libreria sincronizzata"],"Steps Library":["Biblioteca dei Passi"],"Get CartFlows Higher plan":["Ottieni il piano superiore di CartFlows"],"Activate license for adding more flows and other features.":["Attiva la licenza per aggiungere pi\u00f9 flussi e altre funzionalit\u00e0."],"Importing Step..":["Importazione del passaggio.."],"Close":["Chiudi"],"Error":["Errore"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows by activating %s":["Aggiungi upsell a un clic per aumentare il reddito illimitato ai tuoi flussi attivando %s"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Plus or Pro plan today.":["Aggiungi upsell con un solo clic per aumentare il reddito illimitato ai tuoi flussi quando esegui l'upgrade al nostro piano CartFlows Plus o Pro oggi stesso."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s":["Accedi a tutti i nostri modelli pro attivando %s"],"Templates for %s":["Modelli per %s"],"Please wait\u2026":["Attendere prego\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating funnel\u2026":["Attendere prego. Duplicazione del funnel in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Drafting funnel\u2026":["Attendere prego. Creazione del funnel in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting funnel\u2026":["Attendere prego. Eliminazione del funnel in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Restoring funnel\u2026":["Attendere prego. Ripristino dell'imbuto in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Exporting\u2026":["Attendere. Esportazione in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating step\u2026":["Attendere. Duplicazione del passaggio\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting step\u2026":["Attendere. Eliminazione del passaggio\u2026"],"Please wait. Creating variation\u2026":["Attendere. Creazione della variazione in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Archiving variation\u2026":["Attendere. Archiviazione della variazione in corso\u2026"],"Please wait. Declaring winner\u2026":["Attendere prego. Dichiarazione del vincitore in corso\u2026"],"Getting Started":["Iniziare"],"Introduction to CartFlows":["Introduzione a CartFlows"],"Modernizing WordPress eCommerce!":["Modernizzare l'eCommerce di WordPress!"],"Create Your First Flow":["Crea il tuo primo flusso"],"Go To Setup Wizard":["Vai alla procedura guidata di configurazione"],"Import Funnel":["Importa imbuto"],"Click for more info":["Fai clic per ulteriori informazioni"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this funnel.":["\u00c8 necessario che il plugin WooCommerce sia installato e attivato per importare questo funnel."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating CartFlows Pro.":["Accedi a tutti i nostri modelli professionali attivando CartFlows Pro."],"Access all of our pro templates when you activate CartFlows Pro license.":["Accedi a tutti i nostri modelli professionali quando attivi la licenza CartFlows Pro."],"Importing Complete Funnel..":["Importazione del Funnel Completa.."],"Design Your Funnel":["Progetta il tuo imbuto"],"Created! Redirecting\u2026":["Creato! Reindirizzamento in corso\u2026"],"Failed to Create Flow!":["Creazione del flusso non riuscita!"],"Upgrade To CartFlows Pro":["Aggiorna a CartFlows Pro"],"Name Your Funnel":["Assegna un nome al tuo funnel"],"Funnel Name":["Nome del funnel"],"Enter Funnel Name":["Inserisci il nome dell'imbuto"],"Welcome to CartFlows ":["Benvenuto su CartFlows"],"Sales funnel builder turns your WordPress website into an optimized selling machine.":["Il costruttore di funnel di vendita trasforma il tuo sito WordPress in una macchina di vendita ottimizzata."],"Create Your First Funnel":["Crea il tuo primo funnel"],"A sales funnel is the sequence of steps a buyer takes to make a purchase. CartFlows helps optimize funnels to turn visitors into customers.":["Un funnel di vendita \u00e8 la sequenza di passaggi che un acquirente compie per effettuare un acquisto. CartFlows aiuta a ottimizzare i funnel per trasformare i visitatori in clienti."],"Create New Funnel":["Crea nuovo funnel"],"Total Page Views":["Visualizzazioni totali della pagina"],"Total Revenue":["Entrate Totali"],"Total Orders":["Ordini totali"],"Offer Revenue":["Entrate dall'offerta"],"Total Views":["Visualizzazioni totali"],"Overview":["Panoramica"],"WooCommerce plugin is required.":["\u00c8 richiesto il plugin WooCommerce."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the overview":["\u00c8 necessario che il plugin WooCommerce sia installato e attivato per visualizzare la panoramica"],"Recent Orders":["Ordini recenti"],"View All":["Visualizza tutto"],"Customer":["Cliente"],"Payment Method":["Metodo di pagamento"],"Value":["Valore"],"at":["a"],"Find recent order here":["Trova l'ordine recente qui"],"Once you have received orders, come back here to find it again easily":["Una volta ricevuti gli ordini, torna qui per trovarli facilmente"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the recent orders":["\u00c8 necessario che il plugin WooCommerce sia installato e attivato per visualizzare gli ordini recenti"],"Quick Actions":["Azioni rapide"],"Create a Funnel":["Crea un imbuto"],"Analytics":["Analisi"],"Create a Product":["Crea un prodotto"],"Create new Product":["Crea nuovo prodotto"],"All Funnels":["Tutti i funnel"],"View all funnels":["Visualizza tutti i funnel"],"Previous":["Precedente"],"Next":["Avanti"],"First":["Primo"],"Last":["Ultimo"],"You can specify a file to import by either dragging it into the drag and drop area.(Maximum file size of 5MB; .json file extensions only.)":["Puoi specificare un file da importare trascinandolo nell'area di trascinamento. (Dimensione massima del file di 5 MB; solo estensioni di file .json.)"],"Change a file":["Modifica un file"],"JSON file up to 5MB":["File JSON fino a 5MB"],"File Selected: %s":["File selezionato: %s"],"Please select the valid json file.":["Si prega di selezionare il file json valido."],"Importing..":["Importazione in corso.."],"Export All":["Esporta tutto"],"Exporting\u2026":["Esportazione in corso\u2026"],"Search Funnels":["Canali di ricerca"],"Filter Funnels by Date":["Filtra i funnel per data"],"Publish ":["Pubblica"],"Draft ":["Bozza"],"Trash ":["Spazzatura"],"Mode":["Modalit\u00e0"],"All":["Tutti"],"Live":["Vivi"],"SandBox":["SandBox"],"Reset Filters":["Reimposta filtri"],"%s This Flow":["%s Questo flusso"],"Do you want to %s this flow? Are you sure?":["Vuoi %s questo flusso? Sei sicuro?"],"items selected":["elementi selezionati"],"Applying changes\u2026":["Applicazione delle modifiche\u2026"]," Published ":["Pubblicato"],"Duplicate Funnel":["Duplica Funnel"],"Do you really want to duplicate this funnel?":["Vuoi davvero duplicare questo funnel?"],"Trash Funnel":["Imbuto per rifiuti"],"Do you really want to trash this funnel?":["Vuoi davvero eliminare questo funnel?"],"Do you really want to trash this Funnel?":["Vuoi davvero eliminare questo Funnel?"],"Restore Funnel":["Ripristina il funnel"],"Do you really want to restore this funnel?":["Vuoi davvero ripristinare questo funnel?"],"Draft":["Bozza"],"Last Modified: %s":["Ultima modifica: %s"],"Updated ":["Aggiornato"],"Sandbox":["Sandbox"],"WooCommerce Required to display the revenue.":["WooCommerce \u00e8 necessario per visualizzare il fatturato."],"Restore Flow":["Ripristina flusso"],"Delete Flow":["Elimina flusso"],"Upgrade to Pro for this feature.":["Passa a Pro per questa funzione."],"Duplicate (Pro)":["Duplica (Pro)"],"Trash Flow":["Flusso di rifiuti"],"Trash":["Spazzatura"],"Name":["Nome"],"Sales":["Vendite"],"Move to Trash":["Sposta nel cestino"],"No matching results found for the search term \"%s\".":["Nessun risultato corrispondente trovato per il termine di ricerca \"%s\"."],"No flows found for the selected filter.":["Nessun flusso trovato per il filtro selezionato."],"Please try using different keywords, date range, or filters to refine your results.":["Per favore, prova a utilizzare parole chiave diverse, un intervallo di date o filtri per affinare i tuoi risultati."],"Create New":["Crea nuovo"]," %d items":["%d articoli"],"Create your first funnel":["Crea il tuo primo funnel"],"Build a sales funnel with everything you need to generate leads and grow sales.":["Costruisci un funnel di vendita con tutto ci\u00f2 di cui hai bisogno per generare contatti e aumentare le vendite."],"One Click Upsells":["Upsell con un clic"],"A\/B Split Testing":["Test A\/B"],"Conversion Templates":["Modelli di conversione"],"Checkout Editor":["Editor di Checkout"],"Insights":["Approfondimenti"],"Create Funnel":["Crea imbuto"],"Plugin Required":["Plugin richiesto"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to access this page.":["\u00c8 necessario che il plugin WooCommerce sia installato e attivato per accedere a questa pagina."],"Installing":["Installazione"],"Activating":["Attivazione"],"Failed":["Fallito"],"Redirecting":["Reindirizzamento"],"Create Store Checkout":["Crea il checkout del negozio"],"Name Your Store Checkout":["Nome del tuo negozio Checkout"],"You can't create more than 3 flows in free version. Upgrade to CartFlows Pro for adding more flows and other features.":["Non puoi creare pi\u00f9 di 3 flussi nella versione gratuita. Passa a CartFlows Pro per aggiungere pi\u00f9 flussi e altre funzionalit\u00e0."],"Upgrade To Cartflows Pro":["Aggiorna a Cartflows Pro"],"Store Checkout Name":["Nome del checkout del negozio"],"Enter Store Checkout Name":["Inserisci il nome del checkout del negozio"],"Create a global store checkout":["Crea un checkout globale del negozio"],"A well-designed checkout page can help streamline the checkout process, reduce cart abandonment rates and increase conversions.":["Una pagina di pagamento ben progettata pu\u00f2 aiutare a semplificare il processo di pagamento, ridurre i tassi di abbandono del carrello e aumentare le conversioni."],"Improved user experience":["Esperienza utente migliorata"],"Brand consistency":["Coerenza del marchio"],"Increased trust and credibility":["Aumento della fiducia e della credibilit\u00e0"],"Flexibility and customization":["Flessibilit\u00e0 e personalizzazione"],"Competitive advantage":["Vantaggio competitivo"],"Active":["Attivo"],"Activate":["Attiva"],"Install":["Installa"],"Installing\u2026":["Installazione in corso\u2026"],"Installed":["Installato"],"Let's Go":["Andiamo"],"Recommended Plugins":["Plugin consigliati"],"Recommended Themes":["Temi consigliati"],"View All Steps":["Visualizza tutti i passaggi"],"Funnel thumbnail image":["Immagine di anteprima dell'imbuto"],"Funnel Preview":["Anteprima del funnel"],"Live Preview":["Anteprima dal vivo"],"Funnel Templates":["Modelli di imbuto"],"Start from scratch":["Inizia da zero"],"It seems that the page builder you selected is inactive.":["Sembra che il costruttore di pagine che hai selezionato sia inattivo."]," to see CartFlows templates. If you prefer another page builder tool, you can ":["per vedere i modelli di CartFlows. Se preferisci un altro strumento per la creazione di pagine, puoi"],"select it here":["selezionalo qui"],"Are you using any other page builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with every other page builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for every page builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["Stai utilizzando un altro page builder? Nessun problema. CartFlows funziona bene con ogni altro page builder. Al momento non abbiamo modelli pronti per ogni page builder, ma stiamo pianificando di aggiungerli molto presto."],"Learn How ":["Scopri come"],"No Results Found.":["Nessun risultato trovato."],"Don't see a funnel that you would like to import?":["Non vedi un funnel che vorresti importare?"],"Please suggest us ":["Per favore suggeriscici"],"Choose a Funnel Templates":["Scegli un modello di funnel"],"Search Templates":["Cerca modelli"],"Start from Scratch":["Inizia da zero"],"It seems that you are using the Bricks Builder.":["Sembra che tu stia utilizzando Bricks Builder."],"It seems that you are using the page builder other than Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder.":["Sembra che tu stia utilizzando un page builder diverso da Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder."],"Are you using Bricks Builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with Bricks Builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for Bricks Builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["Stai usando Bricks Builder? Nessun problema. CartFlows funziona bene con Bricks Builder. Al momento non abbiamo modelli pronti per Bricks Builder, ma stiamo pianificando di aggiungerli molto presto."],"Checkout Page":["Pagina di pagamento"],"Oops!!! No template Found.":["Ops!!! Nessun modello trovato."],"Seems like no template is available for chosen editor.":["Sembra che non ci sia alcun modello disponibile per l'editor scelto."],"Store Checkout Templates":["Modelli di pagamento del negozio"],"No CartFlows Logs Found.":["Nessun log di CartFlows trovato."],"CartFlows Logs":["Registri di CartFlows"],"Copied":["Copiato"],"Copy":["Copia"],"Downloading":["Download in corso"],"Download":["Scarica"],"Deleting":["Eliminazione"],"Deleted":["Eliminato"],"Email Marketing Automation":["Automazione del marketing via email"],"Automate email marketing campaigns based on customer actions, such as abandoned carts or completed purchases in WooCommerce.":["Automatizza le campagne di email marketing in base alle azioni dei clienti, come carrelli abbandonati o acquisti completati in WooCommerce."],"Customer Birthday Campaigns":["Campagne di compleanno per i clienti"],"Automatically send personalized birthday offers or discounts to customers based on their birthdate stored in WooCommerce.":["Invia automaticamente offerte o sconti personalizzati di compleanno ai clienti in base alla loro data di nascita memorizzata in WooCommerce."],"Order Notification":["Notifica di Ordine"],"Receive instant notifications via SMS, Slack, WhatsApp, or messaging apps when new orders are placed in your WooCommerce store.":["Ricevi notifiche istantanee tramite SMS, Slack, WhatsApp o app di messaggistica quando vengono effettuati nuovi ordini nel tuo negozio WooCommerce."],"Payment and Accounting Integration":["Integrazione Pagamenti e Contabilit\u00e0"],"Sync WooCommerce sales data with your accounting software for streamlined financial management.":["Sincronizza i dati di vendita di WooCommerce con il tuo software di contabilit\u00e0 per una gestione finanziaria semplificata."],"Coupon Code Marketing":["Marketing dei codici sconto"],"Automate the creation and distribution of coupon codes based on specific conditions or customer actions in WooCommerce.":["Automatizza la creazione e la distribuzione di codici coupon in base a condizioni specifiche o azioni dei clienti in WooCommerce."],"Upsell and Cross-sell Campaigns":["Campagne di Upsell e Cross-sell"],"Automate targeted upsell and cross-sell offers based on customers' purchase history or product interactions in WooCommerce.":["Automatizza le offerte di upsell e cross-sell mirate in base alla cronologia degli acquisti o alle interazioni con i prodotti dei clienti in WooCommerce."],"Connect Your Website":["Collega il tuo sito web"],"Reloading":["Ricaricamento"],"Connecting":["Connessione in corso"],"Integrate WooCommerce and CartFlows with Anything":["Integra WooCommerce e CartFlows con qualsiasi cosa"],"Integrate all your apps, plugins, and services to automate repetitive tasks.":["Integra tutte le tue app, plugin e servizi per automatizzare i compiti ripetitivi."],"These are just some examples. The possibilities are truly endless!":["Questi sono solo alcuni esempi. Le possibilit\u00e0 sono davvero infinite!"],"Trusted by World's Top Brands to Connect Their Apps":["Fidato dai migliori marchi del mondo per connettere le loro app"],"Connect your apps and automate your business.":["Collega le tue app e automatizza la tua attivit\u00e0."],"Remove Image":["Rimuovi immagine"],"Unlock Premium Features with CartFlows PRO!":["Sblocca le funzionalit\u00e0 premium con CartFlows PRO!"],"Get the tools you need to create powerful sales funnels, increase conversions, and grow your business with ease.":["Ottieni gli strumenti necessari per creare potenti funnel di vendita, aumentare le conversioni e far crescere la tua attivit\u00e0 con facilit\u00e0."],"Select a Settings Tab":["Seleziona una scheda Impostazioni"],"Free vs Pro":["Gratuito vs Pro"],"Increase Your Revenue with Smart Order Bumps":["Aumenta il tuo fatturato con i Smart Order Bumps"],"Boost sales with CartFlows\u2019 Order Bump! Offer personalized add-ons at checkout to increase revenue effortlessly. Quick to set up, no coding needed!":["Aumenta le vendite con l'Order Bump di CartFlows! Offri componenti aggiuntivi personalizzati al checkout per aumentare le entrate senza sforzo. Facile da configurare, nessuna programmazione necessaria!"],"Show the Right Offer to the Right People \u2013 Automatically!":["Mostra l'offerta giusta alle persone giuste, automaticamente!"],"Personalize deals based on location, cart details, and more. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and unlock this smart feature today!":["Personalizza le offerte in base alla posizione, ai dettagli del carrello e altro ancora. Passa a CartFlows PRO e sblocca questa funzione intelligente oggi stesso!"],"Boost Sales Instantly with Auto-Applied Coupons!":["Aumenta le vendite istantaneamente con i coupon applicati automaticamente!"],"No codes, no hassle\u2014discounts apply instantly at checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start converting more customers today!":["Nessun codice, nessun problema: gli sconti si applicano istantaneamente al checkout. Passa a CartFlows PRO e inizia a convertire pi\u00f9 clienti oggi stesso!"],"Give Your Customers More Choices, Boost Your Sales":["Dai ai tuoi clienti pi\u00f9 opzioni, aumenta le tue vendite"],"Make buying easier with flexible product options. Let customers make the right choices from your checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start customizing today!":["Rendi l'acquisto pi\u00f9 facile con opzioni di prodotto flessibili. Lascia che i clienti facciano le scelte giuste dal tuo checkout. Passa a CartFlows PRO e inizia a personalizzare oggi stesso!"],"Optin Product":["Prodotto Optin"],"Select free & virtual product only. Once you select a product, it will be displayed here.":["Seleziona solo prodotti gratuiti e virtuali. Una volta selezionato un prodotto, verr\u00e0 visualizzato qui."],"Search for a Free & Virtual Product":["Cerca un prodotto gratuito e virtuale"],"Please select a free & virtual product only.":["Si prega di selezionare solo un prodotto gratuito e virtuale."],"Free":["Gratis"],"A\/B Testing":["Test A\/B"],"Optimize your sales with A\/B testing in CartFlows! Experiment with product pricing, page layouts, messaging, and design. Create variants, analyze results, and discover new ways to boost revenue.":["Ottimizza le tue vendite con i test A\/B in CartFlows! Sperimenta con i prezzi dei prodotti, i layout delle pagine, i messaggi e il design. Crea varianti, analizza i risultati e scopri nuovi modi per aumentare i ricavi."],"Finish Setup":["Completa l'installazione"],"Setup CartFlows":["Configura CartFlows"],"Setup Store Checkout":["Imposta il checkout del negozio"],"Create":["Crea"],"Build Your Funnel":["Costruisci il tuo imbuto"],"Start From Scratch":["Inizia da zero"],"Go To Library":["Vai in biblioteca"],"Offer add-ons with Order Bump.":["Offri componenti aggiuntivi con Order Bump."],"Increase Revenue with Upsells.":["Aumenta le entrate con le vendite aggiuntive."],"Almost There! Let's Go Live.":["Quasi arrivati! Andiamo in diretta."],"%d out of 5 completed":["%d su 5 completati"],"Upgrade to PRO":["Passa a PRO"],"Completed":["Completato"],"Upgrade your plan anytime and get more detailed analytics data.":["Aggiorna il tuo piano in qualsiasi momento e ottieni dati analitici pi\u00f9 dettagliati."],"Total Page Views is a Premium Feature":["Il conteggio totale delle visualizzazioni delle pagine \u00e8 una funzione Premium"],"Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["Il ricavo dell'offerta \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"Custom Filter:":["Filtro personalizzato:"],"Checkout Features":["Funzionalit\u00e0 di checkout"],"Modern Checkout Styles":["Stili di pagamento moderni"],"Optimized replacement for the standard WooCommerce checkout page designed for higher conversion":["Sostituzione ottimizzata per la pagina di pagamento standard di WooCommerce progettata per una maggiore conversione"],"Custom Checkout Fields":["Campi di pagamento personalizzati"],"Have complete control over the field editor to manage the fields as required":["Hai il controllo completo sull'editor dei campi per gestire i campi come richiesto"],"One-Click Upsells \/ Downsells":["Upsell \/ Downsell con un clic"],"Dynamic One-Click Upsells":["Upsell dinamici con un solo clic"],"Use cart contents or customer data to display relevant upsells for maximum conversion":["Utilizza il contenuto del carrello o i dati del cliente per mostrare upsell pertinenti per la massima conversione"],"Dynamic Upsell Templates":["Modelli di Upsell Dinamici"],"Professional templates to help you sell more even if you\u2019re not a designer":["Modelli professionali per aiutarti a vendere di pi\u00f9 anche se non sei un designer"],"Order Bump Features":["Funzionalit\u00e0 di Order Bump"],"Dynamic Order Bumps":["Incrementi d'ordine dinamici"],"Smart order bumps using customer data to display most relevant products or offers":["Incrementi intelligenti degli ordini utilizzando i dati dei clienti per mostrare i prodotti o le offerte pi\u00f9 pertinenti"],"Advanced Funnel Features":["Funzionalit\u00e0 Avanzate dell'Imbuto"],"A \/ B Split Testing":["Test A \/ B"],"Increase conversions and sales with CartFlows A\/B Testing by running simple tests":["Aumenta le conversioni e le vendite con i test A\/B di CartFlows eseguendo test semplici"],"Analyze transactions and user behavior to refine conversions and make more profit":["Analizza le transazioni e il comportamento degli utenti per migliorare le conversioni e aumentare i profitti"],"Cloud-based automation tools that intelligently links your websites, stores, plugins and apps":["Strumenti di automazione basati su cloud che collegano in modo intelligente i tuoi siti web, negozi, plugin e app"],"SkillJet Academy Access":["Accesso a SkillJet Academy"],"CartFlows offers full training to help you make more profit with SkillJet academy":["CartFlows offre una formazione completa per aiutarti a ottenere pi\u00f9 profitto con l'accademia SkillJet"],"Others Benefits":["Altri benefici"],"Premium Support":["Supporto Premium"],"Professional Support, Professional Support Team or Dedicated Support Team":["Supporto professionale, Team di supporto professionale o Team di supporto dedicato"],"Amazing User Community":["Incredibile comunit\u00e0 di utenti"],"Amazing User Community is already a great message unless you\u2019re looking for a different meaning":["Comunit\u00e0 Utente Straordinaria \u00e8 gi\u00e0 un ottimo messaggio a meno che tu non stia cercando un significato diverso"],"Great Documentation & Video Tutorials":["Ottima documentazione e video tutorial"],"Comprehensive Documentation and Video Tutorials or Comprehensive Documentation and Video Guides":["Documentazione completa e tutorial video o Documentazione completa e guide video"],"Free Plugins":["Plugin gratuiti"],"Variation Swatches":["Campioni di variazione"],"Give customers choice by including relevant product variations including size, color and more":["Offri ai clienti una scelta includendo varianti di prodotto rilevanti come taglia, colore e altro"],"Stripe Payment Gateway":["Gateway di pagamento Stripe"],"Accepting multiple payment methods gives customers choice and can significantly increase conversion":["Accettare pi\u00f9 metodi di pagamento offre ai clienti la possibilit\u00e0 di scelta e pu\u00f2 aumentare significativamente la conversione"],"Features":["Caratteristiche"],"See all CartFlows Pro features":["Vedi tutte le funzionalit\u00e0 di CartFlows Pro"],"Sell More with CartFlows Pro":["Vendi di pi\u00f9 con CartFlows Pro"],"Get access to powerful features for painless WordPress designing, without the high costs. With all the time you will save, it\u2019s a product that pays for itself!":["Accedi a potenti funzionalit\u00e0 per progettare WordPress senza sforzo, senza costi elevati. Con tutto il tempo che risparmierai, \u00e8 un prodotto che si ripaga da solo!"],"Modern Cart":["Carrello moderno"],"Enable Instant Layout":["Abilita Layout Istantaneo"],"Disabled":["Disabilitato"],"upgrading to PRO":["aggiornamento a PRO"],"activating CartFlows Pro":["attivazione di CartFlows Pro"],"You're using":["Stai usando"],"CartFlows Free":["CartFlows Free"],"To unlock more features, consider":["Per sbloccare pi\u00f9 funzionalit\u00e0, considera"],"Activate CartFlows Pro":["Attiva CartFlows Pro"],"You can't edit this step directly because Instant Layout is turned on in the funnel settings. To make design changes, go to the Design tab inside this step's settings.":["Non puoi modificare direttamente questo passaggio perch\u00e9 il Layout Istantaneo \u00e8 attivato nelle impostazioni del funnel. Per apportare modifiche al design, vai alla scheda Design all'interno delle impostazioni di questo passaggio."],"Use this setting to customize the style of the Instant %s Layout.":["Usa questa impostazione per personalizzare lo stile del Layout %s istantaneo."],"Turn this on to set up rules that decide when visitors should be redirected to a special offer or the next step.":["Attiva questa opzione per impostare regole che decidano quando i visitatori devono essere reindirizzati a un'offerta speciale o al passaggio successivo."],"Your email address can't be edited when using the Modern Checkout Style.":["Il tuo indirizzo email non pu\u00f2 essere modificato quando si utilizza lo stile di pagamento moderno."],"The Company field won't be visible if you're using the Instant Layout Style.":["Il campo Azienda non sar\u00e0 visibile se stai utilizzando lo stile di layout istantaneo."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all your funnels combined.":["Questo mostra l'importo totale di denaro guadagnato da tutti i tuoi funnel combinati."],"This shows the total number of orders placed through your CartFlows checkout pages.":["Questo mostra il numero totale di ordini effettuati tramite le tue pagine di pagamento CartFlows."],"This shows the total number of times people visited any step in your funnel.":["Questo mostra il numero totale di volte in cui le persone hanno visitato qualsiasi fase del tuo funnel."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from your Upsell and Downsell offers.":["Questo mostra l'importo totale di denaro guadagnato dalle tue offerte di Upsell e Downsell."],"Set up a Store Checkout in just one click:":["Imposta un checkout del negozio con un solo clic:"],"Thank You Page":["Pagina di ringraziamento"],"Use ready-made templates from the CartFlows Library, our custom widget, or shortcodes on each page to set this up easily\u2014no coding needed!":["Usa i modelli predefiniti dalla Libreria CartFlows, il nostro widget personalizzato o gli shortcode su ogni pagina per configurarlo facilmente\u2014senza bisogno di codifica!"],"Install OttoKit for Free":["Installa OttoKit gratuitamente"],"Visit OttoKit Website":["Visita il sito web di OttoKit"],"Here are a few simple examples of what OttoKit can do on your WooCommerce store:":["Ecco alcuni semplici esempi di ci\u00f2 che OttoKit pu\u00f2 fare nel tuo negozio WooCommerce:"],"Join Thousands of Entrepreneurs Already Using OttoKit.":["Unisciti a migliaia di imprenditori che gi\u00e0 utilizzano OttoKit."],"Bonus ($200 Value)":["Bonus (valore di $200)"],"Access to OttoKit Pro Plan":["Accesso al piano OttoKit Pro"],"Plus - Annual":["Plus - Annuale"],"\/ year":["\/ anno"],"Pro - Annual":["Pro - Annuale"],"Pro - Lifetime (One Time Pay)":["Pro - A vita (Pagamento una tantum)"],"for Lifetime":["per tutta la vita"],"Pro - Lifetime (11 x Split Pay)":["Pro - A vita (11 x Pagamento rateale)"],"x 11 Months":["x 11 mesi"],"Explore the key differences between Plus and Pro to find the perfect fit for your needs.":["Esplora le differenze chiave tra Plus e Pro per trovare la soluzione perfetta per le tue esigenze."],"CartFlows Free vs Pro Image":["Immagine CartFlows Free vs Pro"],"Unlock Pro Features":["Sblocca le funzionalit\u00e0 Pro"],"Generate More Sales With CartFlows Pro!":["Genera pi\u00f9 vendite con CartFlows Pro!"],"And More\u2026":["E altro ancora\u2026"],"Buy Now":["Acquista ora"],"View plans":["Visualizza i piani"],"Moderncart":["Moderncart"],"Trusted by Top Brands to Boost Conversions Instantly":["Fidato dai marchi principali per aumentare le conversioni istantaneamente"],"Brand logo":["Logo del marchio"],"Stop Losing Sales at the Cart \u2014 Fix It in Minutes!":["Smetti di perdere vendite al carrello \u2014 Risolvilo in pochi minuti!"],"Modern Cart is your instant upgrade for more sales, bigger orders, and smoother checkouts.":["Modern Cart \u00e8 il tuo aggiornamento istantaneo per aumentare le vendite, incrementare gli ordini e rendere pi\u00f9 fluidi i processi di pagamento."],"Opt-in":["Iscriviti"],"The product previously added as an Order Bump has been deleted. Please add a new product.":["Il prodotto precedentemente aggiunto come Order Bump \u00e8 stato eliminato. Si prega di aggiungere un nuovo prodotto."],"Choose a variation":["Scegli una variante"],"For more information about order bump settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Per ulteriori informazioni sulle impostazioni dell'ordine bump, si prega di %1$sCliccare qui.%2$s"],"Sum of all step views in this funnel.":["Somma di tutte le visualizzazioni dei passaggi in questo funnel."],"Total upsell\/downsell revenue.":["Entrate totali da upsell\/downsell."],"Revenue per visit.":["Ricavo per visita."],"Revenue per unique visitor.":["Entrate per visitatore unico."],"Sandbox Mode":["Modalit\u00e0 Sandbox"],"Live Mode":["Modalit\u00e0 Live"],"No. of Orders":["Numero di ordini"],"Opt-in Step":["Passaggio di adesione"],"Opt-in Form":["Modulo di adesione"],"Popup":["Finestra pop-up"],"Lead Magnets":["Lead Magnet"],"Top Performing Funnels":["Funnel con le migliori prestazioni"],"Find top performing funnels here":["Trova qui i funnel con le migliori prestazioni"],"Once you set up funnels, come back here to top performing funnels":["Una volta impostati i funnel, torna qui ai funnel con le migliori prestazioni"],"Top Performing Funnels is a Premium Feature":["I funnel con le migliori prestazioni sono una funzione premium"],"View sales analytics":["Visualizza le analisi delle vendite"],"Fast and customizable cart for your website.":["Carrello veloce e personalizzabile per il tuo sito web."],"Recover abandonded carts with ease.":["Recupera i carrelli abbandonati con facilit\u00e0."],"Automate your repititive tasks, effortlessly!":["Automatizza i tuoi compiti ripetitivi, senza sforzo!"],"Product choices made visual and clickable.":["Scelte di prodotto rese visive e cliccabili."],"Extend Your Store":["Estendi il tuo negozio"],"Replace Store Checkout Funnel?":["Sostituire il percorso di pagamento del negozio?"],"A Store Checkout funnel already exists. Importing will replace the current Store Checkout funnel.":["Un funnel di checkout del negozio esiste gi\u00e0. L'importazione sostituir\u00e0 l'attuale funnel di checkout del negozio."],"Replace & Import":["Sostituisci e importa"],"Import from JSON file":["Importa da file JSON"],"Average Order Value":["Valore medio dell'ordine"],"Average Order Value is a Premium Feature":["Il valore medio dell'ordine \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"Bump Offer Revenue":["Entrate dall'offerta di incremento"],"Bump Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["Il ricavo dell'offerta Bump \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"Revenue Per Visit":["Entrate per visita"],"Revenue Per Visit is a Premium Feature":["Il ricavo per visita \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"RPUV":["RPUV"],"Revenue Per Unique Visitor is a Premium Feature":["Il ricavo per visitatore unico \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"Loading flows\u2026":["Caricamento dei flussi\u2026"],"Select Flow":["Seleziona flusso"],"No data available":["Nessun dato disponibile"],"All Funnels is a Premium Feature":["Tutti i Funnel \u00e8 una funzione Premium"],"Previous Period":["Periodo precedente"],"Previous Year":["Anno precedente"],"Total Visitors":["Visitatori totali"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all steps combined.":["Questo mostra l'importo totale di denaro guadagnato da tutti i passaggi combinati."],"Avg. Order Value":["Valore medio dell'ordine"],"Average value of each order (Total Revenue \/ Total Orders).":["Valore medio di ciascun ordine (Entrate Totali \/ Ordini Totali)."],"Bump Revenue":["Aumenta il fatturato"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all order bump offers.":["Questo mostra l'importo totale di denaro guadagnato da tutte le offerte di upsell sugli ordini."],"Revenue per each visit (Total Revenue \/ Total Visitors).":["Entrate per ogni visita (Entrate Totali \/ Visitatori Totali)."],"This shows average revenue generated per individual visitor.":["Questo mostra il ricavo medio generato per singolo visitatore."],"Total Submissions":["Totale invii"],"Total Submissions is a Premium Feature":["Il totale delle invii \u00e8 una funzione Premium"],"Conversion Rate is a Premium Feature":["Il tasso di conversione \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"List Growth":["Crescita della lista"],"Optin Overview is a Premium Feature":["Panoramica delle iscrizioni \u00e8 una funzione Premium"],"This shows the total opt-in form submissions.":["Questo mostra il totale delle iscrizioni tramite modulo di adesione."],"This shows the percentage of visitors who completed the opt-in.":["Questo mostra la percentuale di visitatori che hanno completato l'iscrizione."],"Laptop Conversions":["Conversioni di laptop"],"Laptop Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Le conversioni del laptop sono una funzione premium"],"Mobile Conversions":["Conversioni mobili"],"Mobile Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Le conversioni mobili sono una funzione premium"],"Total Conversions":["Conversioni totali"],"Total Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Le conversioni totali sono una funzione premium"],"Bump Conversions":["Aumenta le conversioni"],"Bump Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Bump Conversions \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"Offer Conversions":["Conversioni delle offerte"],"Offer Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Le conversioni delle offerte sono una funzione premium"],"Steps":["Passi"],"This section lists funnel conversion data.":["Questa sezione elenca i dati di conversione dell'imbuto."],"This is where your funnel drop-off statistics will appear":["Qui appariranno le statistiche di abbandono del tuo imbuto"],"Step Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["La funzione di consegna graduale \u00e8 una caratteristica Premium"],"Product Details":["Dettagli del prodotto"],"This section lists product conversion data.":["Questa sezione elenca i dati di conversione dei prodotti."],"Product Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["La consegna del prodotto \u00e8 una funzione premium"],"This shows the total number of visitors for the selected funnel\/s.":["Questo mostra il numero totale di visitatori per il\/i funnel selezionato\/i."],"This shows the total conversions for the selected funnel.":["Questo mostra le conversioni totali per il funnel selezionato."],"This shows the order bump conversions for the selected funnel.":["Questo mostra le conversioni dei bump d'ordine per il funnel selezionato."],"This shows the total offer conversions from Upsell and Downsell combined for the selected funnel.":["Questo mostra le conversioni totali dell'offerta da Upsell e Downsell combinate per il funnel selezionato."],"This shows the orders completed on large-screen devices (over 1024px).":["Questo mostra gli ordini completati su dispositivi con schermo grande (oltre 1024px)."],"This shows orders completed on mobile and small-screen devices (under 1024px).":["Questo mostra gli ordini completati su dispositivi mobili e schermi piccoli (sotto i 1024px)."],"Hot":["Caldo"],"Get ModernCart Now":["Ottieni ModernCart ora"],"Your WooCommerce Cart, Reinvented %sto Sell More.":["Il tuo carrello WooCommerce, reinventato %sper vendere di pi\u00f9."],"ModernCart replaces redirects and reloads with a smooth slide-out cart \u2014 fewer steps, fewer drop-offs, more conversions.":["ModernCart sostituisce i reindirizzamenti e i ricaricamenti con un carrello a scorrimento fluido: meno passaggi, meno abbandoni, pi\u00f9 conversioni."],"See Plans & Pricing \u2192":["Vedi Piani e Prezzi \u2192"],"Here's What ModernCart Does for Your Store":["Ecco cosa fa ModernCart per il tuo negozio"],"Slide-Out Cart":["Carrello estraibile"],"Keep shoppers on the same page while adding or editing items, reducing steps and boosting completed purchases.":["Mantieni gli acquirenti sulla stessa pagina mentre aggiungi o modifichi articoli, riducendo i passaggi e aumentando gli acquisti completati."],"Smart Product Recommendations":["Consigli intelligenti sui prodotti"],"Show relevant product suggestions inside the cart, automatically increasing order value with simple, effective upsells.":["Mostra suggerimenti di prodotti pertinenti all'interno del carrello, aumentando automaticamente il valore dell'ordine con upsell semplici ed efficaci."],"Free Shipping Progress Bar":["Barra di progresso per la spedizione gratuita"],"Motivate customers to spend more by clearly showing how close they are to unlocking free shipping.":["Motiva i clienti a spendere di pi\u00f9 mostrando chiaramente quanto sono vicini a sbloccare la spedizione gratuita."],"Smooth Coupon Management":["Gestione fluida dei coupon"],"Make discounts effortless \u2014 shoppers can quickly apply or remove coupon codes without page reloads or confusion.":["Rendi gli sconti semplici: gli acquirenti possono applicare o rimuovere rapidamente i codici coupon senza ricaricare la pagina o creare confusione."],"Instant Updates, No Reloads":["Aggiornamenti istantanei, nessun ricaricamento"],"Deliver a seamless, app-like cart experience with real-time updates that keep customers engaged without interruptions.":["Offri un'esperienza di carrello fluida, simile a un'app, con aggiornamenti in tempo reale che mantengono i clienti coinvolti senza interruzioni."],"Customize Everything":["Personalizza tutto"],"Easily change cart icons, labels, colors, and texts to perfectly match your brand and store's style.":["Cambia facilmente le icone del carrello, le etichette, i colori e i testi per adattarli perfettamente allo stile del tuo marchio e del tuo negozio."],"Learn":["Impara"],"File Size (MB)":["Dimensione del file (MB)"],"Accepted File Types":["Tipi di file accettati"],"Back to Webhooks":["Torna ai Webhook"],"Edit Webhook":["Modifica Webhook"],"Add New Webhook":["Aggiungi nuovo Webhook"],"e.g. CRM Integration":["ad es. Integrazione CRM"],"Endpoint URL":["URL dell'endpoint"],"Events":["Eventi"],"Select events that will trigger this webhook.":["Seleziona gli eventi che attiveranno questo webhook."],"Select All":["Seleziona tutto"],"Enabled":["Abilitato"],"Max Retries":["Max tentativi"],"Number of retry attempts for failed deliveries (0-5).":["Numero di tentativi di ripetizione per consegne non riuscite (0-5)."],"Secret Key":["Chiave segreta"],"Used to sign webhook payloads (HMAC-SHA256).":["Utilizzata per firmare i payload dei webhook (HMAC-SHA256)."],"Copy to clipboard":["Copia negli appunti"],"Copied!":["Copiato!"],"Please enter a webhook name.":["Inserisci un nome per il webhook."],"Please enter a webhook URL.":["Inserisci un URL per il webhook."],"Please enter a valid URL.":["Inserisci un URL valido."],"Please select at least one event.":["Seleziona almeno un evento."],"Failed to save webhook.":["Impossibile salvare il webhook."],"Something went wrong.":["Qualcosa \u00e8 andato storto."],"Update Webhook":["Aggiorna Webhook"],"Create Webhook":["Crea Webhook"],"Webhooks":["Webhook"],"Send real-time event data to external services when key funnel events occur.":["Invia dati di eventi in tempo reale a servizi esterni quando si verificano eventi chiave del funnel."],"No webhooks configured yet. Click \"Add New Webhook\" to get started.":["Nessun webhook configurato ancora. Clicca su \"Aggiungi Nuovo Webhook\" per iniziare."],"URL":["URL"],"Last Delivery":["Ultima Consegna"],"events":["eventi"],"Success":["Successo"],"Never triggered":["Mai attivato"],"Test sent!":["Test inviato!"],"Send Test":["Invia Test"],"Are you sure you want to delete this webhook?":["Sei sicuro di voler eliminare questo webhook?"],"Global CSS & Scripts":["CSS e Script Globali"],"Successfully Activated":["Attivato con successo"],"Activation Failed":["Attivazione fallita"],"File":["File"],"Enter the maximum allowed file size. Default is 5MB.":["Inserisci la dimensione massima del file consentita. Il valore predefinito \u00e8 5MB."],"Enter comma-separated file extensions (e.g. jpg, png, gif)":["Inserisci le estensioni dei file separate da virgola (es. jpg, png, gif)"],"Invalid file type(s): %s":["Tipo di file non valido: %s"],"Processing\u2026":["Elaborazione\u2026"],"Install %s":["Installa %s"],"Mark %s as not completed":["Segna %s come non completato"],"Mark %s as completed":["Segna %s come completato"],"Learn how: %s":["Scopri come: %s"],"%1$s - %2$s":["%1$s - %2$s"],"%1$s - %2$d of %3$d steps completed":["%1$s - %2$d di %3$d passi completati"],"%1$d of %2$d steps completed":["%1$d di %2$d passi completati"],"No sections available.":["Nessuna sezione disponibile."],"Close video":["Chiudi video"],"Learn CartFlows":["Impara CartFlows"],"Set up high-converting funnels in CartFlows with step-by-step guidance and launch with confidence.":["Imposta funnel ad alta conversione in CartFlows con guida passo-passo e lancia con fiducia."],"Watch video: Learn CartFlows":["Guarda il video: Impara CartFlows"],"Watch Video":["Guarda il video"],"Delete Webhook":["Elimina Webhook"],"Failed!":[""]}}}
plugins/cartflows/languages/cartflows-nl_NL-ee6a0bf214c77dcdac7a8e34bb625df3.json:1:{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-04T15:33:29+00:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"admin-core\/assets\/build\/settings-app.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"(no title)":["(geen titel)"],"Thank You":["Dank je"],"View":["Bekijken"],"Edit":["Bewerken"],"Duplicate":["Dupliceren"],"Export":["Exporteren"],"Delete":["Verwijderen"],"Default":["Standaard"],"Restore":["Herstellen"],"Edit Funnel":["Trechter bewerken"],"Funnels":["Trechters"],"Store Checkout":["Winkelafrekenen"],"Automations":["Automatiseringen"],"Add-ons":["Invoegtoepassingen"],"Dashboard":["Dashboard"],"Cart Abandonment":["Winkelwagen Verlating"],"Yes":["Ja"],"No":["Nee"],"Step":["Stap"],"Settings":["Instellingen"],"Rollback to Previous Version":["Terugzetten naar vorige versie"],"33%":["33%"],"50%":["50%"],"100%":["100%"],"Field ID":["Veld-ID"],"Checked":["Gecontroleerd"],"Options":["Opties"],"Placeholder":["Placeholder"],"Required":["Vereist"],"Collapsible":["Inklapbaar"],"Activate WooCommerce":["Activeer WooCommerce"],"Install WooCommerce":["Installeer WooCommerce"],"General":["Algemeen"],"Text":["Tekst"],"Type":["Type"],"Width":["Breedte"],"Shipping":["Verzending"],"Order Bumps":["Order Bumps"],"Dynamic Offers":["Dynamische Aanbiedingen"],"Search for a coupon":["Zoek naar een coupon"],"Auto Apply Coupon":["Automatisch coupon toepassen"],"Product Options":["Productopties"],"Advanced":["Geavanceerd"],"Product":["Product"],"Title":["Titel"],"Content":["Inhoud"],"Total Visits":["Totaal aantal bezoeken"],"All Flows":["Alle stromen"],"Add New":["Nieuw toevoegen"],"Upgrade to CartFlows Pro":["Upgrade naar CartFlows Pro"],"Search Steps":["Zoekstappen"],"Enable Custom Field Editor":["Aangepaste veldeneditor inschakelen"],"Search for a Product":["Zoek naar een product"],"Billing":["Facturering"],"Settings Saved":["Instellingen opgeslagen"],"Saving\u2026":["Opslaan\u2026"],"Save Settings":["Instellingen opslaan"],"Regular Price of the product":["Reguliere prijs van het product"],"Price after discount.":["Prijs na korting."],"Product Name":["Productnaam"],"Use {{product_name}} and {{quantity}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Gebruik {{product_name}} en {{quantity}} om dynamisch de respectieve productdetails op te halen."],"Subtext":["Subtekst"],"Use {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} to dynamically fetch respective product details.":["Gebruik {{quantity}}, {{discount_value}}, {{discount_percent}} om respectievelijk productdetails dynamisch op te halen."],"Enable Highlight":["Markeren inschakelen"],"Highlight Text":["Tekst markeren"],"Create New Product":["Nieuw product maken"],"Add":["Toevoegen"],"Once you have selected products, they will be displayed here.":["Zodra je producten hebt geselecteerd, worden ze hier weergegeven."],"Items":["Artikelen"],"Quantity":["Hoeveelheid"],"Discount":["Korting"],"Adding\u2026":["Toevoegen\u2026"],"Please search and select at-lease one product to add.":["Zoek en selecteer ten minste \u00e9\u00e9n product om toe te voegen."],"Reset":["Opnieuw instellen"],"Image Preview":["Voorbeeld van afbeelding"],"Upload a file":["Een bestand uploaden"],"or drag and drop":["of slepen en neerzetten"],"PNG, JPG, GIF up to 10MB":["PNG, JPG, GIF tot 10MB"],"Select Dates":["Selecteer datums"],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Upgrade alstublieft naar de %1$s CartFlows Pro %2$s om de %3$s functie te gebruiken."],"Please upgrade to the %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s to use %3$s feature.":["Upgrade alstublieft naar het %1$s CartFlows Higher Plan %2$s om de %3$s functie te gebruiken."],"Please upgrade to the CartFlows Higher Plan to use the %s feature.":["Upgrade alstublieft naar het CartFlows Hogere Plan om de %s functie te gebruiken."],"Role":["Rol"],"Access":["Toegang"],"For more information about the user role management please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Voor meer informatie over het beheer van gebruikersrollen, %1$sklik hier.%2$s"],"Are you sure you want to rollback to %1$s v%2$s?":["Weet je zeker dat je wilt teruggaan naar %1$s v%2$s?"],"Rollback":["Terugdraaien"],"Cancel":["Annuleren"],"Experiencing an issue with the current version of CartFlows? Roll back to a previous version to help troubleshoot the problem.":["Ervaar je een probleem met de huidige versie van CartFlows? Ga terug naar een eerdere versie om het probleem te helpen oplossen."],"Regenerate Now":["Nu opnieuw genereren"],"Reset Permalinks Settings":["Permalink-instellingen opnieuw instellen"],"Activate License":["Licentie activeren"],"Deactivate License":["Licentie deactiveren"],"Please enter a valid license key!":["Voer een geldige licentiesleutel in!"],"Processing":["Verwerken"],"Unknown error occurred while activating the license.":["Er is een onbekende fout opgetreden bij het activeren van de licentie."],"Facebook Pixel":["Facebook Pixel"],"Google Analytics Pixel":["Google Analytics Pixel"],"Google Ads Pixel":["Google Ads Pixel"],"Tiktok Pixel":["Tiktok Pixel"],"Pinterest Tag":["Pinterest-tag"],"Snapchat Pixel":["Snapchat Pixel"],"Google Auto Address":["Google Auto-adres"],"Regenerate Inline CSS":["Inline CSS opnieuw genereren"]," Regenerating\u2026.":["Opnieuw genereren\u2026."],"Regenerated":["Geregeneerd"],"If you are using the CartFlows Shortcode and using the Design Settings, then this option will regenerate the steps inline CSS. To learn more, %1$1s Click here %2$2s.":["Als je de CartFlows Shortcode gebruikt en de Ontwerpinstellingen gebruikt, dan zal deze optie de stappen inline CSS regenereren. Om meer te leren, %1$1s Klik hier %2$2s."],"Updating":["Bijwerken"],"Permalinks reset successfully":["Permanente koppelingen succesvol opnieuw ingesteld"],"For more information about the CartFlows Permalink settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Voor meer informatie over de CartFlows Permalink-instellingen, %1$sklik hier.%2$s"],"Oops! You don't have access to this page.":["Oeps! Je hebt geen toegang tot deze pagina."],"You don't have permission to access this page. Please reach out to your admin for help.":["Je hebt geen toestemming om deze pagina te openen. Neem contact op met je beheerder voor hulp."],"Back to Dashboard":["Terug naar Dashboard"],"Integrations":["Integraties"],"User Role Manager":["Gebruikersrolbeheerder"],"Permalink":["Permanente link"],"Version Control":["Versiebeheer"],"Order":["Bestelling"],"License":["Licentie"],"Sync Knowledge Base":["Synchroniseer kennisbank"],"Knowledge Base":["Kennisbank"],"Search knowledge base":["Zoek in de kennisbank"],"No Docs Founds":["Geen documenten gevonden"],"Please try syncing the docs library":["Probeer de documentbibliotheek te synchroniseren"],"Syncing\u2026":["Synchroniseren\u2026"],"Synced. Reloading..":["Gesynchroniseerd. Opnieuw laden.."],"Need Help?":["Hulp nodig?"],"We aim to answer all priority support requests within 2-3 hours.":["We streven ernaar om alle prioriteitsverzoeken binnen 2-3 uur te beantwoorden."],"Get Support":["Krijg ondersteuning"],"All Documentation":["Alle documentatie"],"Browse documentation, reference material, and tutorials for CartFlows.":["Blader door documentatie, referentiemateriaal en tutorials voor CartFlows."],"View documentation":["Documentatie bekijken"],"Videos":["Video's"],"Browse tutorial videos on our YouTube channel.":["Bekijk tutorialvideo's op ons YouTube-kanaal."],"Youtube Channel":["Youtube-kanaal"],"Support":["Ondersteuning"],"What's New?":["Wat is er nieuw?"],"Unlicensed":["Ongeautoriseerd"],"Licensed":["Gelicentieerd"],"Open Global Settings":["Open globale instellingen"],"Tutorial Videos":["Instructievideo's"],"More Options":["Meer opties"],"Control":["Beheer"],"Variation-%d":["Variatie-%d"],"No Product Assigned":["Geen product toegewezen"],"Store Checkout - Remove selected checkout product":["Winkelafrekenen - Geselecteerd afrekenproduct verwijderen"],"PRO":["PRO"],"Offer Accepted":["Aanbod geaccepteerd"],"Offer Rejected":["Aanbod afgewezen"],"Invalid Position":["Ongeldige positie"],"Views":["Weergaven"],"Conversions":["Conversies"],"Revenue":["Omzet"],"Upgrade to Pro":["Upgrade naar Pro"],"%s Step":["%s Stap"],"Step Editing is Disabled":["Stap bewerken is uitgeschakeld"],"Open Settings":["Instellingen openen"],"Duplicate Step":["Dubbele stap"],"Do you want to duplicate this step? Are you sure?":["Wilt u deze stap dupliceren? Weet u het zeker?"],"Delete Step":["Stap verwijderen"],"Do you want to delete this step? Are you sure?":["Wil je deze stap verwijderen? Weet je het zeker?"],"Declare Winner":["Winnaar aanwijzen"],"Do you want to declare this step as winner? Are you sure?":["Wil je deze stap als winnaar aanwijzen? Weet je het zeker?"],"Archive Step":["Archiefstap"],"Do you want to archive this step? Are you sure?":["Wil je deze stap archiveren? Weet je het zeker?"],"Saving..":["Opslaan.."],"Saved":["Opgeslagen"],"Reloading..":["Opnieuw laden.."],"Split Test Testing":["Split Test Testen"],"Stop Split Test":["Stop split-test"],"Start Split Test":["Start A\/B-test"],"Split Test":["Splittest"],"Stopping\u2026":["Stoppen\u2026"],"Starting\u2026":["Beginnen\u2026"],"Reloading\u2026":["Herladen\u2026"],"Split Test Settings":["Instellingen voor gesplitste test"],"Restore Archived Variation":["Gearchiveerde Variatie Herstellen"],"Do you want to restore this archived variation? Are you sure?":["Wil je deze gearchiveerde variant herstellen? Weet je het zeker?"],"Trash Archived Variation":["Prullenbak Gearchiveerde Variatie"],"This action will trash this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Deze actie zal deze gearchiveerde variant en de bijbehorende analyseggegevens permanent verwijderen. %1$s Wilt u deze gearchiveerde variant verwijderen?"],"Hide Archived Variation":["Gearchiveerde variant verbergen"],"This action will hide this archived variation from the list of steps, but its analytics will be visible. %1$s Do you want to hide this archived variation?":["Deze actie verbergt deze gearchiveerde variant uit de lijst met stappen, maar de analyses blijven zichtbaar. %1$s Wilt u deze gearchiveerde variant verbergen?"],"This action will delete this archived variation and its analytics data permanently. %1$s Do you want to delete this archived variation?":["Deze actie zal deze gearchiveerde variant en de bijbehorende analyseggegevens permanent verwijderen. %1$s Wilt u deze gearchiveerde variant verwijderen?"],"Deleted On: ":["Verwijderd op:"],"Archived On: ":["Gearchiveerd op:"],"Archived Steps":["Gearchiveerde stappen"],"Edit Step Name":["Bewerk stapnaam"],"Save":["Opslaan"],"Update Template":["Template bijwerken"],"Changing the template will permanently delete the current design in this step. Would you still like to proceed?":["Het wijzigen van de sjabloon zal het huidige ontwerp in deze stap permanent verwijderen. Wilt u toch doorgaan?"],"Change Template":["Template wijzigen"],"If you are using shortcodes, enable this design settings to apply styles.":["Als je shortcodes gebruikt, schakel dan deze ontwerpinstellingen in om stijlen toe te passen."],"Enable Design Settings":["Ontwerpinstellingen inschakelen"],"Activate %s":["Activeer %s"],"Activating %s":["%s activeren"],"Successfully Activated!":["Succesvol geactiveerd!"],"Failed! Activation!":["Mislukt! Activering!"],"Upgrade to Cartflows Pro":["Upgrade naar Cartflows Pro"],"Activate the License":["Activeer de licentie"],"Step Type: ":["Staptype:"],"License is required!":["Licentie is vereist!"],"Activate the license to modify this offer step's settings":["Activeer de licentie om de instellingen van deze aanbiedingsstap te wijzigen"],"No product Selected":["Geen product geselecteerd"],"Once you select the product, they will be displayed here.":["Zodra u het product selecteert, worden ze hier weergegeven."],"Shipping Rate":["Verzendtarief"],"Once you have add product, it will be displayed here.":["Zodra je een product hebt toegevoegd, wordt het hier weergegeven."],"Coupon will apply on checkout page":["De coupon wordt toegepast op de afrekenpagina"],"AND":["EN"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the conditional order bump feature.":["Werk CartFlows Pro bij naar de nieuwste versie om de voorwaardelijke order bump-functie te gebruiken."],"Enable conditional order bump ":["Voorwaardelijke orderbump inschakelen"],"By enabling this option, you can create the conditions to display the order bump.":["Door deze optie in te schakelen, kun je de voorwaarden cre\u00ebren om de order bump weer te geven."],"Show this order bump if following conditions are true":["Toon deze orderbump als de volgende voorwaarden waar zijn"],"Add Condition":["Voorwaarde toevoegen"],"OR":["OF"],"Add Conditions Group":["Voorwaarden Groep Toevoegen"],"Order Bump Product Image":["Bestel Bump Productafbeelding"],"Styles":["Stijlen"],"Conditions":["Voorwaarden"],"Save Changes":["Wijzigingen opslaan"],"You have made changes. Do you want to save the changes?":["U heeft wijzigingen aangebracht. Wilt u de wijzigingen opslaan?"],"No product":["Geen product"],"Duplicate Order Bump":["Dubbele Bestelverhoging"],"Edit Order Bump":["Order Bump bewerken"],"Trash Order Bump":["Prullenbak Bestelling Bump"],"Do you really want to trash this order bump permanently?":["Wil je deze orderbump echt permanent verwijderen?"],"Delete Order Bump":["Order Bump verwijderen"],"Status":["Status"],"Actions":["Acties"],"Create an order bump.":["Maak een order bump."],"Enter order bump name":["Voer de naam van de orderbump in"],"Please enter the order bump title":["Voer de titel van de orderbump in"],"Preview":["Voorbeeld"],"View in Full Screen":["Volledig scherm bekijken"],"Exit Full Screen":["Volledig scherm afsluiten"],"Order Submitted":["Bestelling Verzonden"],"Special Offer":["Speciale Aanbieding"],"Order Receipt":["Bestelbevestiging"],"Enable Checkout Offer":["Aanbieding bij afrekenen inschakelen"],"Dynamic Conditions":["Dynamische voorwaarden"],"Please Update the CartFlows Pro to the latest version to use the dynamic offers feature.":["Werk alstublieft CartFlows Pro bij naar de nieuwste versie om de functie voor dynamische aanbiedingen te gebruiken."],"Enable Dynamic Offers":["Dynamische aanbiedingen inschakelen"],"Redirect to: ":["Omleiden naar:"],"Search for step\u2026":["Zoek naar stap\u2026"],"If the following conditions are true":["Als de volgende voorwaarden waar zijn"],"Add Dynamic Offer":["Dynamisch Aanbod Toevoegen"],"Search for default step\u2026":["Zoek naar standaardstap\u2026"],"If all of the above conditions failed.":["Als al de bovenstaande voorwaarden zijn mislukt."],"Label":["Label"],"ID":["ID"],"Enable":["Inschakelen"],"Add New Field":["Nieuw veld toevoegen"],"Date & Time":["Datum & Tijd"],"Add Custom Field":["Aangepast veld toevoegen"],"TextArea":["Tekstgebied"],"Number":["Nummer"],"Checkbox":["Selectievakje"],"Radio":["Radio"],"Select":["Selecteer"],"Hidden":["Verborgen"],"Add To":["Toevoegen aan"],"Label %1$s*%2$s":["Label %1$s*%2$s"],"Field value will store in this meta key. Add field id without prefix like \"billing_\" or \"shipping_\". %s Use \"_\" instead of spaces.":["Veldwaarde wordt opgeslagen in deze meta-sleutel. Voeg veld-id toe zonder voorvoegsel zoals \"billing_\" of \"shipping_\". %s Gebruik \"_\" in plaats van spaties."],"Min Value":["Minimale waarde"],"Max Value":["Maximale waarde"],"Enter your options separated by (|).":["Voer uw opties in, gescheiden door (|)."],"UnChecked":["Niet aangevinkt"],"Field Input Type":["Veld invoertype"],"Date":["Datum"],"Time":["Tijd"],"Min ":["Min"],"Max ":["Max"],"Show in Email":["Weergeven in e-mail"],"Billing Fields":["Factureringsvelden"],"Shipping Fields":["Verzendvelden"],"Delete Field":["Veld verwijderen"],"Are you really want to delete field?":["Weet je zeker dat je het veld wilt verwijderen?"],"Field Editor":["Veldeditor"],"Label is required field":["Label is een verplicht veld"],"WooCommerce is Required!":["WooCommerce is vereist!"],"To modify the %s step options, please install and activate the WooCommerce plugin.":["Om de %s stapopties te wijzigen, installeer en activeer de WooCommerce-plugin."],"Activating\u2026":["Activeren\u2026"],"Activated":["Geactiveerd"],"Funnel Settings":["Trechterinstellingen"],"Save Setting":["Instelling opslaan"],"Disable Store Checkout":["Winkelafrekenen uitschakelen"],"Enable Store Checkout":["Winkelafrekenen inschakelen"],"Edit Title":["Titel bewerken"],"Publish":["Publiceren"],"Do you really want to publish this funnel?":["Wil je deze funnel echt publiceren?"],"Draft Funnel":["Concepttrechter"],"Do you really want to draft this funnel?":["Wil je deze funnel echt opstellen?"],"Unique Visits":["Unieke bezoeken"],"Conversion Rate":["Conversieratio"],"Total number of orders.":["Totaal aantal bestellingen."],"Grand total of all orders.":["Totaalbedrag van alle bestellingen."],"Average total of every order.":["Gemiddeld totaal van elke bestelling."],"Grand total of all order bumps.":["Totaalbedrag van alle orderverhogingen."],"Export Flow":["Exportstroom"],"View Funnel":["Trechter bekijken"],"Open Funnel Settings":["Open trechterinstellingen"],"Delete Store Checkout":["Winkelafrekenen verwijderen"],"Do you really want to delete store checkout?%1$1sNOTE: This action cannot be reversed.":["Weet u zeker dat u de winkelcheckout wilt verwijderen?%1$1sOPMERKING: Deze actie kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."],"archived_date":["archived_date"],"%1$sNote:%2$s The orders which are placed by the admins are not considered while calculating the analytics.":["%1$sOpmerking:%2$s De bestellingen die door de beheerders worden geplaatst, worden niet meegenomen bij het berekenen van de analyses."],"Reset Analytics":["Analytics opnieuw instellen"],"Are you really want to reset funnel analytics?":["Wil je de trechteranalyse echt opnieuw instellen?"],"Resetting":["Opnieuw instellen"],"Automation for":["Automatisering voor"],"Create a distraction free, high-converting checkout experience without needing a page builder.":["Cre\u00eber een afleidingsvrije, hoog converterende afrekenervaring zonder een paginabouwer nodig te hebben."],"Funnel Steps":["Trechterstappen"],"Add New Step":["Nieuwe stap toevoegen"],"No Steps Added.":["Geen stappen toegevoegd."],"Seems like there are no steps created or added in this flow":["Het lijkt erop dat er geen stappen zijn gemaakt of toegevoegd in deze flow"],"Add new step":["Nieuwe stap toevoegen"],"Select Step Type":["Selecteer staptype"],"Activating WooCommerce..":["WooCommerce activeren.."],"Installing WooCommerce..":["WooCommerce installeren.."],"Successfully Installed!":["Succesvol ge\u00efnstalleerd!"],"Installation Failed!":["Installatie mislukt!"],"Import Step":["Importstap"],"Add multiple steps to your flows today with an upgraded CartFlows plan.":["Voeg vandaag nog meerdere stappen toe aan je flows met een ge\u00fcpgraded CartFlows-plan."],"Get CartFlows Higher Plan":["Verkrijg een hoger plan van CartFlows"],"Add multiple steps to your flows by activating %s.":["Voeg meerdere stappen toe aan je flows door %s te activeren."],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating %2$s.":["Voeg %1$s stap toe aan je flows door %2$s te activeren."],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click %s to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Higher plan today.":["Voeg onbeperkte inkomensverhogende \u00e9\u00e9n-klik %s toe aan je flows wanneer je vandaag upgrade naar ons CartFlows Higher-plan."],"Add %1$s step to your flow by activating CartFlows license.":["Voeg %1$s stap toe aan je flow door de CartFlows-licentie te activeren."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s.":["Toegang tot al onze pro-sjablonen door %s te activeren."],"Access all of our pro templates when you upgrade your plan to CartFlows Pro today.":["Toegang tot al onze pro-sjablonen wanneer je je plan vandaag nog upgrade naar CartFlows Pro."],"Get CartFlows Pro":["Koop CartFlows Pro"],"Add %1$s step to your flows by activating license.":["Voeg %1$s stap toe aan je flows door de licentie te activeren."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this step.":["Je hebt de WooCommerce-plugin nodig die ge\u00efnstalleerd en geactiveerd is om deze stap te importeren."],"Imported! Redirecting\u2026":["Ge\u00efmporteerd! Omleiden\u2026"]," Please sync the library and try importing the template again.":["Synchroniseer alstublieft de bibliotheek en probeer de sjabloon opnieuw te importeren."],"Import Failed! Try again.":["Importeren mislukt! Probeer het opnieuw."],"Create Step":["Stap maken"],"Creating Step..":["Stap maken.."],"Step Created! Redirecting\u2026":["Stap gemaakt! Doorverwijzen\u2026"],"Failed to Create Step!":["Stap maken mislukt!"],"Activate license for adding more steps and other features.":["Activeer licentie om meer stappen en andere functies toe te voegen."],"Close the window":["Sluit het raam"],"Name Your Step":["Noem Uw Stap"],"Step Name":["Stapnaam"],"Enter Step Name":["Voer stapnaam in"],"Learn How":["Leer hoe"],"Create from Scratch":["Vanaf nul maken"],"Step thumbnail image":["Stap miniatuurafbeelding"],"Import":["Importeren"],"Back":["Terug"],"Sync Library":["Bibliotheek synchroniseren"],"Importing page %d":["Pagina %d importeren"],"Sync Complete":["Synchronisatie voltooid"],"Syncing Library\u2026":["Bibliotheek synchroniseren\u2026"],"Library Synced":["Bibliotheek gesynchroniseerd"],"Steps Library":["Stappenbibliotheek"],"Get CartFlows Higher plan":["Verkrijg het hogere CartFlows-plan"],"Activate license for adding more flows and other features.":["Activeer licentie om meer flows en andere functies toe te voegen."],"Importing Step..":["Stap importeren.."],"Close":["Sluiten"],"Error":["Fout"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows by activating %s":["Voeg onbeperkte inkomstenverhogende one-click upsells toe aan je flows door %s te activeren"],"Add unlimited income boosting one-click upsells to your flows when you upgrade to our CartFlows Plus or Pro plan today.":["Voeg onbeperkte inkomstenverhogende one-click upsells toe aan je flows wanneer je vandaag nog upgrade naar ons CartFlows Plus- of Pro-plan."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating %s":["Toegang tot al onze pro-sjablonen door %s te activeren"],"Templates for %s":["Templates voor %s"],"Please wait\u2026":["Even geduld\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating funnel\u2026":["Even geduld. Trechter dupliceren\u2026"],"Please wait. Drafting funnel\u2026":["Even geduld. Trechter wordt opgesteld\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting funnel\u2026":["Even geduld. Trechter wordt verwijderd\u2026"],"Please wait. Restoring funnel\u2026":["Even geduld. Trechter wordt hersteld\u2026"],"Please wait. Exporting\u2026":["Even geduld. Exporteren\u2026"],"Please wait. Duplicating step\u2026":["Even geduld. Stap dupliceren\u2026"],"Please wait. Deleting step\u2026":["Even geduld. Stap wordt verwijderd\u2026"],"Please wait. Creating variation\u2026":["Even geduld. Variatie wordt gemaakt\u2026"],"Please wait. Archiving variation\u2026":["Even geduld. Variatie wordt gearchiveerd\u2026"],"Please wait. Declaring winner\u2026":["Even geduld. Winnaar wordt bepaald\u2026"],"Getting Started":["Aan de slag"],"Introduction to CartFlows":["Inleiding tot CartFlows"],"Modernizing WordPress eCommerce!":["WordPress eCommerce moderniseren!"],"Create Your First Flow":["Maak uw eerste flow"],"Go To Setup Wizard":["Ga naar de installatiewizard"],"Import Funnel":["Importtrechter"],"Click for more info":["Klik voor meer info"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to import this funnel.":["Je hebt de WooCommerce-plugin ge\u00efnstalleerd en geactiveerd nodig om deze funnel te importeren."],"Access all of our pro templates by activating CartFlows Pro.":["Verkrijg toegang tot al onze pro-sjablonen door CartFlows Pro te activeren."],"Access all of our pro templates when you activate CartFlows Pro license.":["Toegang tot al onze pro-sjablonen wanneer je de CartFlows Pro-licentie activeert."],"Importing Complete Funnel..":["Importeren van volledige trechter voltooid.."],"Design Your Funnel":["Ontwerp je trechter"],"Created! Redirecting\u2026":["Aangemaakt! Bezig met doorverwijzen\u2026"],"Failed to Create Flow!":["Maken van Flow mislukt!"],"Upgrade To CartFlows Pro":["Upgrade naar CartFlows Pro"],"Name Your Funnel":["Noem je trechter"],"Funnel Name":["Trechternaam"],"Enter Funnel Name":["Voer trechternaam in"],"Welcome to CartFlows ":["Welkom bij CartFlows"],"Sales funnel builder turns your WordPress website into an optimized selling machine.":["Met de sales funnel builder verandert u uw WordPress-website in een geoptimaliseerde verkoopmachine."],"Create Your First Funnel":["Maak je eerste trechter"],"A sales funnel is the sequence of steps a buyer takes to make a purchase. CartFlows helps optimize funnels to turn visitors into customers.":["Een verkooptrechter is de reeks stappen die een koper neemt om een aankoop te doen. CartFlows helpt trechters te optimaliseren om bezoekers in klanten te veranderen."],"Create New Funnel":["Nieuwe Trechter Maken"],"Total Page Views":["Totaal aantal paginaweergaven"],"Total Revenue":["Totale omzet"],"Total Orders":["Totaal aantal bestellingen"],"Offer Revenue":["Aanbiedingsinkomsten"],"Total Views":["Totaal aantal weergaven"],"Overview":["Overzicht"],"WooCommerce plugin is required.":["WooCommerce-plug-in is vereist."],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the overview":["Je hebt de WooCommerce-plugin nodig die ge\u00efnstalleerd en geactiveerd is om het overzicht te bekijken"],"Recent Orders":["Recente bestellingen"],"View All":["Alles bekijken"],"Customer":["Klant"],"Payment Method":["Betaalmethode"],"Value":["Waarde"],"at":["bij"],"Find recent order here":["Vind recente bestelling hier"],"Once you have received orders, come back here to find it again easily":["Zodra je bestellingen hebt ontvangen, kom hier terug om ze gemakkelijk weer te vinden"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to view the recent orders":["Je hebt de WooCommerce-plugin nodig die ge\u00efnstalleerd en geactiveerd is om de recente bestellingen te bekijken"],"Quick Actions":["Snelle acties"],"Create a Funnel":["Een trechter maken"],"Analytics":["Analytics"],"Create a Product":["Een product maken"],"Create new Product":["Nieuw product maken"],"All Funnels":["Alle trechters"],"View all funnels":["Alle trechters bekijken"],"Previous":["Vorige"],"Next":["Volgende"],"First":["Eerste"],"Last":["Laatst"],"You can specify a file to import by either dragging it into the drag and drop area.(Maximum file size of 5MB; .json file extensions only.)":["U kunt een bestand specificeren om te importeren door het naar het sleepgebied te slepen. (Maximale bestandsgrootte van 5MB; alleen .json-bestandsextensies.)"],"Change a file":["Wijzig een bestand"],"JSON file up to 5MB":["JSON-bestand tot 5MB"],"File Selected: %s":["Bestand geselecteerd: %s"],"Please select the valid json file.":["Selecteer het geldige json-bestand."],"Importing..":["Importeren.."],"Export All":["Alles exporteren"],"Exporting\u2026":["Exporteren\u2026"],"Search Funnels":["Zoektrechters"],"Filter Funnels by Date":["Trechters filteren op datum"],"Publish ":["Publiceren"],"Draft ":["Ontwerp"],"Trash ":["Afval"],"Mode":["Modus"],"All":["Alle"],"Live":["Live"],"SandBox":["SandBox"],"Reset Filters":["Filters opnieuw instellen"],"%s This Flow":["%s Deze flow"],"Do you want to %s this flow? Are you sure?":["Wilt u deze flow %s? Weet u het zeker?"],"items selected":["items geselecteerd"],"Applying changes\u2026":["Wijzigingen toepassen\u2026"]," Published ":["Gepubliceerd"],"Duplicate Funnel":["Funnel dupliceren"],"Do you really want to duplicate this funnel?":["Wilt u deze trechter echt dupliceren?"],"Trash Funnel":["Afvaltrechter"],"Do you really want to trash this funnel?":["Wil je deze trechter echt weggooien?"],"Do you really want to trash this Funnel?":["Wil je deze trechter echt verwijderen?"],"Restore Funnel":["Trechter herstellen"],"Do you really want to restore this funnel?":["Wil je deze trechter echt herstellen?"],"Draft":["Concept"],"Last Modified: %s":["Laatst gewijzigd: %s"],"Updated ":["Bijgewerkt"],"Sandbox":["Sandbox"],"WooCommerce Required to display the revenue.":["WooCommerce vereist om de omzet weer te geven."],"Restore Flow":["Herstel Flow"],"Delete Flow":["Flow verwijderen"],"Upgrade to Pro for this feature.":["Upgrade naar Pro voor deze functie."],"Duplicate (Pro)":["Dupliceren (Pro)"],"Trash Flow":["Afvalstroom"],"Trash":["Afval"],"Name":["Naam"],"Sales":["Verkoop"],"Move to Trash":["Verplaatsen naar prullenbak"],"No matching results found for the search term \"%s\".":["Geen overeenkomende resultaten gevonden voor de zoekterm \"%s\"."],"No flows found for the selected filter.":["Geen stromen gevonden voor het geselecteerde filter."],"Please try using different keywords, date range, or filters to refine your results.":["Probeer verschillende trefwoorden, datumbereiken of filters te gebruiken om uw resultaten te verfijnen."],"Create New":["Nieuw maken"]," %d items":["%d items"],"Create your first funnel":["Maak je eerste trechter"],"Build a sales funnel with everything you need to generate leads and grow sales.":["Bouw een verkooptrechter met alles wat je nodig hebt om leads te genereren en de verkoop te laten groeien."],"One Click Upsells":["One Click Upsells"],"A\/B Split Testing":["A\/B-splittesten"],"Conversion Templates":["Conversiesjablonen"],"Checkout Editor":["Afrekeneditor"],"Insights":["Inzichten"],"Create Funnel":["Trechter maken"],"Plugin Required":["Plug-in vereist"],"You need WooCommerce plugin installed and activated to access this page.":["Je hebt de WooCommerce-plugin nodig die ge\u00efnstalleerd en geactiveerd is om deze pagina te openen."],"Installing":["Installeren"],"Activating":["Activeren"],"Failed":["Mislukt"],"Redirecting":["Omleiden"],"Create Store Checkout":["Afrekenen winkel maken"],"Name Your Store Checkout":["Noem uw winkelafrekenpunt"],"You can't create more than 3 flows in free version. Upgrade to CartFlows Pro for adding more flows and other features.":["Je kunt niet meer dan 3 flows maken in de gratis versie. Upgrade naar CartFlows Pro om meer flows en andere functies toe te voegen."],"Upgrade To Cartflows Pro":["Upgrade naar Cartflows Pro"],"Store Checkout Name":["Naam winkelkassa"],"Enter Store Checkout Name":["Voer de naam van de winkelkassa in"],"Create a global store checkout":["Maak een wereldwijde winkelafrekening"],"A well-designed checkout page can help streamline the checkout process, reduce cart abandonment rates and increase conversions.":["Een goed ontworpen afrekenpagina kan helpen het afrekenproces te stroomlijnen, het aantal verlaten winkelwagentjes te verminderen en de conversies te verhogen."],"Improved user experience":["Verbeterde gebruikerservaring"],"Brand consistency":["Merkconsistentie"],"Increased trust and credibility":["Verhoogd vertrouwen en geloofwaardigheid"],"Flexibility and customization":["Flexibiliteit en maatwerk"],"Competitive advantage":["Concurrentievoordeel"],"Active":["Actief"],"Activate":["Activeren"],"Install":["Installeren"],"Installing\u2026":["Installeren\u2026"],"Installed":["Ge\u00efnstalleerd"],"Let's Go":["Laten we gaan"],"Recommended Plugins":["Aanbevolen plug-ins"],"Recommended Themes":["Aanbevolen thema's"],"View All Steps":["Alle stappen bekijken"],"Funnel thumbnail image":["Trechter miniatuurafbeelding"],"Funnel Preview":["Trechtervoorbeeld"],"Live Preview":["Livevoorbeeld"],"Funnel Templates":["Trechtertemplates"],"Start from scratch":["Begin opnieuw"],"It seems that the page builder you selected is inactive.":["Het lijkt erop dat de paginabouwer die je hebt geselecteerd inactief is."]," to see CartFlows templates. If you prefer another page builder tool, you can ":["om CartFlows-sjablonen te bekijken. Als je een andere paginabuildertool verkiest, kun je"],"select it here":["selecteer het hier"],"Are you using any other page builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with every other page builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for every page builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["Gebruik je een andere paginabouwer? Geen zorgen. CartFlows werkt goed met elke andere paginabouwer. Op dit moment hebben we nog geen kant-en-klare sjablonen voor elke paginabouwer, maar we zijn van plan om deze zeer binnenkort toe te voegen."],"Learn How ":["Leer hoe"],"No Results Found.":["Geen resultaten gevonden."],"Don't see a funnel that you would like to import?":["Ziet u geen trechter die u wilt importeren?"],"Please suggest us ":["Stel ons alstublieft voor"],"Choose a Funnel Templates":["Kies een trechtertemplate"],"Search Templates":["Zoeksjablonen"],"Start from Scratch":["Begin helemaal opnieuw"],"It seems that you are using the Bricks Builder.":["Het lijkt erop dat je de Bricks Builder gebruikt."],"It seems that you are using the page builder other than Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder.":["Het lijkt erop dat je een andere paginabouwer gebruikt dan Elementor, Beaver Builder, Block Builder."],"Are you using Bricks Builder? No worries. CartFlows works well with Bricks Builder. Right now we do not have ready templates for Bricks Builder but we are planning to add it very soon.":["Gebruik je Bricks Builder? Geen zorgen. CartFlows werkt goed met Bricks Builder. Op dit moment hebben we nog geen kant-en-klare sjablonen voor Bricks Builder, maar we zijn van plan deze zeer binnenkort toe te voegen."],"Checkout Page":["Afrekenpagina"],"Oops!!! No template Found.":["Oeps!!! Geen sjabloon gevonden."],"Seems like no template is available for chosen editor.":["Het lijkt erop dat er geen sjabloon beschikbaar is voor de gekozen editor."],"Store Checkout Templates":["Winkelafrekeningssjablonen"],"No CartFlows Logs Found.":["Geen CartFlows-logboeken gevonden."],"CartFlows Logs":["CartFlows-logboeken"],"Copied":["Gekopieerd"],"Copy":["Kopi\u00ebren"],"Downloading":["Downloaden"],"Download":["Downloaden"],"Deleting":["Verwijderen"],"Deleted":["Verwijderd"],"Email Marketing Automation":["E-mailmarketingautomatisering"],"Automate email marketing campaigns based on customer actions, such as abandoned carts or completed purchases in WooCommerce.":["Automatiseer e-mailmarketingcampagnes op basis van klantacties, zoals verlaten winkelwagentjes of voltooide aankopen in WooCommerce."],"Customer Birthday Campaigns":["Klantverjaardagscampagnes"],"Automatically send personalized birthday offers or discounts to customers based on their birthdate stored in WooCommerce.":["Stuur automatisch gepersonaliseerde verjaardagsaanbiedingen of kortingen naar klanten op basis van hun geboortedatum die is opgeslagen in WooCommerce."],"Order Notification":["Bestelmelding"],"Receive instant notifications via SMS, Slack, WhatsApp, or messaging apps when new orders are placed in your WooCommerce store.":["Ontvang direct meldingen via SMS, Slack, WhatsApp of berichten-apps wanneer er nieuwe bestellingen worden geplaatst in je WooCommerce-winkel."],"Payment and Accounting Integration":["Betalings- en boekhoudintegratie"],"Sync WooCommerce sales data with your accounting software for streamlined financial management.":["Synchroniseer WooCommerce-verkoopgegevens met uw boekhoudsoftware voor gestroomlijnd financieel beheer."],"Coupon Code Marketing":["Marketing met kortingscodes"],"Automate the creation and distribution of coupon codes based on specific conditions or customer actions in WooCommerce.":["Automatiseer het aanmaken en verspreiden van kortingscodes op basis van specifieke voorwaarden of klantacties in WooCommerce."],"Upsell and Cross-sell Campaigns":["Upsell- en cross-sellcampagnes"],"Automate targeted upsell and cross-sell offers based on customers' purchase history or product interactions in WooCommerce.":["Automatiseer gerichte upsell- en cross-sell-aanbiedingen op basis van de aankoopgeschiedenis of productinteracties van klanten in WooCommerce."],"Connect Your Website":["Verbind uw website"],"Reloading":["Herladen"],"Connecting":["Verbinden"],"Integrate WooCommerce and CartFlows with Anything":["Integreer WooCommerce en CartFlows met Alles"],"Integrate all your apps, plugins, and services to automate repetitive tasks.":["Integreer al je apps, plugins en diensten om repetitieve taken te automatiseren."],"These are just some examples. The possibilities are truly endless!":["Dit zijn slechts enkele voorbeelden. De mogelijkheden zijn werkelijk eindeloos!"],"Trusted by World's Top Brands to Connect Their Apps":["Vertrouwd door 's werelds topmerken om hun apps te verbinden"],"Connect your apps and automate your business.":["Verbind je apps en automatiseer je bedrijf."],"Remove Image":["Afbeelding verwijderen"],"Unlock Premium Features with CartFlows PRO!":["Ontgrendel Premium-functies met CartFlows PRO!"],"Get the tools you need to create powerful sales funnels, increase conversions, and grow your business with ease.":["Verkrijg de tools die je nodig hebt om krachtige verkooptrechters te cre\u00ebren, conversies te verhogen en je bedrijf moeiteloos te laten groeien."],"Select a Settings Tab":["Selecteer een instellingen tabblad"],"Free vs Pro":["Gratis vs Pro"],"Increase Your Revenue with Smart Order Bumps":["Verhoog uw omzet met slimme orderverhogingen"],"Boost sales with CartFlows\u2019 Order Bump! Offer personalized add-ons at checkout to increase revenue effortlessly. Quick to set up, no coding needed!":["Verhoog de verkoop met de Order Bump van CartFlows! Bied gepersonaliseerde extra's aan bij het afrekenen om moeiteloos de omzet te verhogen. Snel in te stellen, geen codering nodig!"],"Show the Right Offer to the Right People \u2013 Automatically!":["Toon de juiste aanbieding aan de juiste mensen \u2013 automatisch!"],"Personalize deals based on location, cart details, and more. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and unlock this smart feature today!":["Personaliseer aanbiedingen op basis van locatie, winkelwagengegevens en meer. Upgrade naar CartFlows PRO en ontgrendel deze slimme functie vandaag nog!"],"Boost Sales Instantly with Auto-Applied Coupons!":["Verhoog de verkoop direct met automatisch toegepaste coupons!"],"No codes, no hassle\u2014discounts apply instantly at checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start converting more customers today!":["Geen codes, geen gedoe\u2014kortingen worden direct bij het afrekenen toegepast. Upgrade naar CartFlows PRO en begin vandaag nog met het converteren van meer klanten!"],"Give Your Customers More Choices, Boost Your Sales":["Geef uw klanten meer keuzes, verhoog uw verkoop"],"Make buying easier with flexible product options. Let customers make the right choices from your checkout. Upgrade to CartFlows PRO and start customizing today!":["Maak kopen gemakkelijker met flexibele productopties. Laat klanten de juiste keuzes maken vanuit uw afrekenproces. Upgrade naar CartFlows PRO en begin vandaag nog met aanpassen!"],"Optin Product":["Optin-product"],"Select free & virtual product only. Once you select a product, it will be displayed here.":["Selecteer alleen gratis en virtueel product. Zodra je een product selecteert, wordt het hier weergegeven."],"Search for a Free & Virtual Product":["Zoek naar een Gratis & Virtueel Product"],"Please select a free & virtual product only.":["Selecteer alstublieft alleen een gratis en virtueel product."],"Free":["Gratis"],"A\/B Testing":["A\/B-test"],"Optimize your sales with A\/B testing in CartFlows! Experiment with product pricing, page layouts, messaging, and design. Create variants, analyze results, and discover new ways to boost revenue.":["Optimaliseer je verkoop met A\/B-testen in CartFlows! Experimenteer met productprijzen, paginalay-outs, berichten en ontwerp. Maak varianten, analyseer resultaten en ontdek nieuwe manieren om de omzet te verhogen."],"Finish Setup":["Voltooi de installatie"],"Setup CartFlows":["CartFlows instellen"],"Setup Store Checkout":["Winkelafrekenen instellen"],"Create":["Maken"],"Build Your Funnel":["Bouw je trechter"],"Start From Scratch":["Begin opnieuw"],"Go To Library":["Ga naar de bibliotheek"],"Offer add-ons with Order Bump.":["Bied add-ons aan met Order Bump."],"Increase Revenue with Upsells.":["Verhoog de omzet met upsells."],"Almost There! Let's Go Live.":["Bijna daar! Laten we live gaan."],"%d out of 5 completed":["%d van de 5 voltooid"],"Upgrade to PRO":["Upgrade naar PRO"],"Completed":["Voltooid"],"Upgrade your plan anytime and get more detailed analytics data.":["Upgrade je plan op elk moment en krijg meer gedetailleerde analyseggevens."],"Total Page Views is a Premium Feature":["Totaal aantal paginaweergaven is een premiumfunctie"],"Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["Aanbiedingsinkomsten is een premiumfunctie"],"Custom Filter:":["Aangepast filter:"],"Checkout Features":["Afrekenfuncties"],"Modern Checkout Styles":["Moderne afrekenstijlen"],"Optimized replacement for the standard WooCommerce checkout page designed for higher conversion":["Geoptimaliseerde vervanging voor de standaard WooCommerce-afrekenpagina, ontworpen voor een hogere conversie"],"Custom Checkout Fields":["Aangepaste afrekenvelden"],"Have complete control over the field editor to manage the fields as required":["Heb volledige controle over de veldeditor om de velden naar wens te beheren"],"One-Click Upsells \/ Downsells":["Upsells \/ Downsells met \u00e9\u00e9n klik"],"Dynamic One-Click Upsells":["Dynamische \u00e9\u00e9n-klik upsells"],"Use cart contents or customer data to display relevant upsells for maximum conversion":["Gebruik de inhoud van de winkelwagen of klantgegevens om relevante upsells weer te geven voor maximale conversie"],"Dynamic Upsell Templates":["Dynamische upsell-sjablonen"],"Professional templates to help you sell more even if you\u2019re not a designer":["Professionele sjablonen om je te helpen meer te verkopen, zelfs als je geen ontwerper bent"],"Order Bump Features":["Order Bump-functies"],"Dynamic Order Bumps":["Dynamische Order Bumps"],"Smart order bumps using customer data to display most relevant products or offers":["Slimme orderverhogingen met behulp van klantgegevens om de meest relevante producten of aanbiedingen weer te geven"],"Advanced Funnel Features":["Geavanceerde trechterfuncties"],"A \/ B Split Testing":["A \/ B-splittesten"],"Increase conversions and sales with CartFlows A\/B Testing by running simple tests":["Verhoog conversies en verkopen met CartFlows A\/B-testen door eenvoudige tests uit te voeren"],"Analyze transactions and user behavior to refine conversions and make more profit":["Analyseer transacties en gebruikersgedrag om conversies te verfijnen en meer winst te maken"],"Cloud-based automation tools that intelligently links your websites, stores, plugins and apps":["Cloudgebaseerde automatiseringstools die intelligent uw websites, winkels, plugins en apps koppelen"],"SkillJet Academy Access":["Toegang tot SkillJet Academy"],"CartFlows offers full training to help you make more profit with SkillJet academy":["CartFlows biedt volledige training om je te helpen meer winst te maken met SkillJet academy"],"Others Benefits":["Andere voordelen"],"Premium Support":["Premium Ondersteuning"],"Professional Support, Professional Support Team or Dedicated Support Team":["Professionele Ondersteuning, Professioneel Ondersteuningsteam of Toegewijd Ondersteuningsteam"],"Amazing User Community":["Geweldige gebruikersgemeenschap"],"Amazing User Community is already a great message unless you\u2019re looking for a different meaning":["Geweldige gebruikersgemeenschap is al een geweldige boodschap, tenzij je op zoek bent naar een andere betekenis"],"Great Documentation & Video Tutorials":["Geweldige documentatie en videotutorials"],"Comprehensive Documentation and Video Tutorials or Comprehensive Documentation and Video Guides":["Uitgebreide documentatie en videotutorials of uitgebreide documentatie en videogidsen"],"Free Plugins":["Gratis plugins"],"Variation Swatches":["Variatie Stalen"],"Give customers choice by including relevant product variations including size, color and more":["Geef klanten keuze door relevante productvariaties op te nemen, waaronder maat, kleur en meer"],"Stripe Payment Gateway":["Stripe-betalingsgateway"],"Accepting multiple payment methods gives customers choice and can significantly increase conversion":["Het accepteren van meerdere betaalmethoden geeft klanten keuze en kan de conversie aanzienlijk verhogen"],"Features":["Kenmerken"],"See all CartFlows Pro features":["Bekijk alle CartFlows Pro-functies"],"Sell More with CartFlows Pro":["Verkoop meer met CartFlows Pro"],"Get access to powerful features for painless WordPress designing, without the high costs. With all the time you will save, it\u2019s a product that pays for itself!":["Krijg toegang tot krachtige functies voor moeiteloos WordPress-ontwerpen, zonder de hoge kosten. Met alle tijd die je bespaart, is het een product dat zichzelf terugverdient!"],"Modern Cart":["Moderne Kar"],"Enable Instant Layout":["Directe lay-out inschakelen"],"Disabled":["Uitgeschakeld"],"upgrading to PRO":["upgraden naar PRO"],"activating CartFlows Pro":["CartFlows Pro activeren"],"You're using":["Je gebruikt"],"CartFlows Free":["CartFlows Gratis"],"To unlock more features, consider":["Overweeg om meer functies te ontgrendelen"],"Activate CartFlows Pro":["Activeer CartFlows Pro"],"You can't edit this step directly because Instant Layout is turned on in the funnel settings. To make design changes, go to the Design tab inside this step's settings.":["Je kunt deze stap niet direct bewerken omdat Instant Layout is ingeschakeld in de trechterinstellingen. Om ontwerpwijzigingen aan te brengen, ga naar het tabblad Ontwerp in de instellingen van deze stap."],"Use this setting to customize the style of the Instant %s Layout.":["Gebruik deze instelling om de stijl van de Instant %s-indeling aan te passen."],"Turn this on to set up rules that decide when visitors should be redirected to a special offer or the next step.":["Zet dit aan om regels in te stellen die bepalen wanneer bezoekers moeten worden doorgestuurd naar een speciale aanbieding of de volgende stap."],"Your email address can't be edited when using the Modern Checkout Style.":["Je e-mailadres kan niet worden bewerkt wanneer je de Moderne Checkout-stijl gebruikt."],"The Company field won't be visible if you're using the Instant Layout Style.":["Het veld Bedrijf zal niet zichtbaar zijn als je de Instant Layout-stijl gebruikt."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all your funnels combined.":["Dit toont het totale bedrag aan geld dat is verdiend met al je funnels samen."],"This shows the total number of orders placed through your CartFlows checkout pages.":["Dit toont het totale aantal bestellingen dat via uw CartFlows-afrekenpagina's is geplaatst."],"This shows the total number of times people visited any step in your funnel.":["Dit toont het totale aantal keren dat mensen een stap in je trechter hebben bezocht."],"This shows the total amount of money earned from your Upsell and Downsell offers.":["Dit toont het totale bedrag dat is verdiend met uw Upsell- en Downsell-aanbiedingen."],"Set up a Store Checkout in just one click:":["Stel een winkelafrekenpunt in met slechts \u00e9\u00e9n klik:"],"Thank You Page":["Bedankpagina"],"Use ready-made templates from the CartFlows Library, our custom widget, or shortcodes on each page to set this up easily\u2014no coding needed!":["Gebruik kant-en-klare sjablonen uit de CartFlows-bibliotheek, onze aangepaste widget of shortcodes op elke pagina om dit eenvoudig in te stellen\u2014geen codering nodig!"],"Install OttoKit for Free":["Installeer OttoKit gratis"],"Visit OttoKit Website":["Bezoek de OttoKit-website"],"Here are a few simple examples of what OttoKit can do on your WooCommerce store:":["Hier zijn een paar eenvoudige voorbeelden van wat OttoKit kan doen in je WooCommerce-winkel:"],"Join Thousands of Entrepreneurs Already Using OttoKit.":["Sluit je aan bij duizenden ondernemers die OttoKit al gebruiken."],"Bonus ($200 Value)":["Bonus (waarde $200)"],"Access to OttoKit Pro Plan":["Toegang tot OttoKit Pro Plan"],"Plus - Annual":["Plus - Jaarlijks"],"\/ year":["\/ jaar"],"Pro - Annual":["Pro - Jaarlijks"],"Pro - Lifetime (One Time Pay)":["Pro - Levenslang (Eenmalige Betaling)"],"for Lifetime":["voor het leven"],"Pro - Lifetime (11 x Split Pay)":["Pro - Levenslang (11 x Gespreide Betaling)"],"x 11 Months":["x 11 maanden"],"Explore the key differences between Plus and Pro to find the perfect fit for your needs.":["Ontdek de belangrijkste verschillen tussen Plus en Pro om de perfecte match voor jouw behoeften te vinden."],"CartFlows Free vs Pro Image":["CartFlows Free vs Pro Afbeelding"],"Unlock Pro Features":["Ontgrendel Pro-functies"],"Generate More Sales With CartFlows Pro!":["Genereer meer verkopen met CartFlows Pro!"],"And More\u2026":["En meer\u2026"],"Buy Now":["Koop nu"],"View plans":["Plannen bekijken"],"Moderncart":["Moderncart"],"Trusted by Top Brands to Boost Conversions Instantly":["Vertrouwd door topmerken om conversies direct te verhogen"],"Brand logo":["Merkenlogo"],"Stop Losing Sales at the Cart \u2014 Fix It in Minutes!":["Stop met het verliezen van verkopen bij de kassa \u2014 Los het binnen enkele minuten op!"],"Modern Cart is your instant upgrade for more sales, bigger orders, and smoother checkouts.":["Modern Cart is jouw directe upgrade voor meer verkopen, grotere bestellingen en soepelere checkouts."],"Opt-in":["Inschrijven"],"The product previously added as an Order Bump has been deleted. Please add a new product.":["Het product dat eerder als een Order Bump was toegevoegd, is verwijderd. Voeg alstublieft een nieuw product toe."],"Choose a variation":["Kies een variant"],"For more information about order bump settings please %1$sClick here.%2$s":["Voor meer informatie over de instellingen van de order bump, %1$sKlik hier.%2$s"],"Sum of all step views in this funnel.":["Som van alle stapweergaven in deze trechter."],"Total upsell\/downsell revenue.":["Totaal upsell\/downsell omzet."],"Revenue per visit.":["Omzet per bezoek."],"Revenue per unique visitor.":["Omzet per unieke bezoeker."],"Sandbox Mode":["Sandboxmodus"],"Live Mode":["Live-modus"],"No. of Orders":["Aantal bestellingen"],"Opt-in Step":["Opt-in Stap"],"Opt-in Form":["Inschrijfformulier"],"Popup":["Popup"],"Lead Magnets":["Leadmagneten"],"Top Performing Funnels":["Top presterende trechters"],"Find top performing funnels here":["Vind hier de best presterende trechters"],"Once you set up funnels, come back here to top performing funnels":["Zodra je trechters hebt ingesteld, kom dan hier terug naar de best presterende trechters"],"Top Performing Funnels is a Premium Feature":["Top Performing Funnels is een premiumfunctie"],"View sales analytics":["Bekijk verkoopanalyses"],"Fast and customizable cart for your website.":["Snelle en aanpasbare winkelwagen voor uw website."],"Recover abandonded carts with ease.":["Herstel verlaten winkelwagentjes met gemak."],"Automate your repititive tasks, effortlessly!":["Automatiseer je repetitieve taken moeiteloos!"],"Product choices made visual and clickable.":["Productkeuzes visueel en klikbaar gemaakt."],"Extend Your Store":["Breid uw winkel uit"],"Replace Store Checkout Funnel?":["Winkelafrekenproces vervangen?"],"A Store Checkout funnel already exists. Importing will replace the current Store Checkout funnel.":["Er bestaat al een winkelcheckout-funnel. Importeren zal de huidige winkelcheckout-funnel vervangen."],"Replace & Import":["Vervangen en importeren"],"Import from JSON file":["Importeren vanuit JSON-bestand"],"Average Order Value":["Gemiddelde Bestelwaarde"],"Average Order Value is a Premium Feature":["Gemiddelde Bestelwaarde is een Premiumfunctie"],"Bump Offer Revenue":["Verhoog Aanbiedingsinkomsten"],"Bump Offer Revenue is a Premium Feature":["Bump Offer Revenue is een premiumfunctie"],"Revenue Per Visit":["Omzet per bezoek"],"Revenue Per Visit is a Premium Feature":["Omzet per bezoek is een premiumfunctie"],"RPUV":["RPUV"],"Revenue Per Unique Visitor is a Premium Feature":["Omzet per unieke bezoeker is een premiumfunctie"],"Loading flows\u2026":["Stromen laden\u2026"],"Select Flow":["Selecteer stroom"],"No data available":["Geen gegevens beschikbaar"],"All Funnels is a Premium Feature":["Alle Trechters is een Premiumfunctie"],"Previous Period":["Vorige periode"],"Previous Year":["Vorig jaar"],"Total Visitors":["Totaal aantal bezoekers"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all steps combined.":["Dit toont het totale bedrag aan geld dat is verdiend uit alle stappen samen."],"Avg. Order Value":["Gem. Bestelwaarde"],"Average value of each order (Total Revenue \/ Total Orders).":["Gemiddelde waarde van elke bestelling (Totale omzet \/ Totale bestellingen)."],"Bump Revenue":["Verhoog de omzet"],"This shows the total amount of money earned from all order bump offers.":["Dit toont het totale bedrag aan geld dat is verdiend met alle order bump-aanbiedingen."],"Revenue per each visit (Total Revenue \/ Total Visitors).":["Omzet per bezoek (Totale Omzet \/ Totaal aantal Bezoekers)."],"This shows average revenue generated per individual visitor.":["Dit toont de gemiddelde omzet gegenereerd per individuele bezoeker."],"Total Submissions":["Totaal aantal inzendingen"],"Total Submissions is a Premium Feature":["Totaal aantal inzendingen is een premiumfunctie"],"Conversion Rate is a Premium Feature":["Conversieratio is een premiumfunctie"],"List Growth":["Lijstgroei"],"Optin Overview is a Premium Feature":["Optin Overzicht is een Premiumfunctie"],"This shows the total opt-in form submissions.":["Dit toont het totale aantal inzendingen van opt-in formulieren."],"This shows the percentage of visitors who completed the opt-in.":["Dit toont het percentage bezoekers dat de opt-in heeft voltooid."],"Laptop Conversions":["Laptopconversies"],"Laptop Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Laptopconversies is een premiumfunctie"],"Mobile Conversions":["Mobiele conversies"],"Mobile Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Mobiele conversies is een premiumfunctie"],"Total Conversions":["Totale conversies"],"Total Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Totale conversies is een premiumfunctie"],"Bump Conversions":["Verhoog conversies"],"Bump Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Bump Conversions is een premiumfunctie"],"Offer Conversions":["Aanbiedingsconversies"],"Offer Conversions is a Premium Feature":["Offer Conversions is een Premiumfunctie"],"Steps":["Stappen"],"This section lists funnel conversion data.":["Dit gedeelte bevat gegevens over trechterconversies."],"This is where your funnel drop-off statistics will appear":["Hier verschijnen de statistieken van het afhaakpercentage in je trechter"],"Step Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["Stap Drop-off is een premiumfunctie"],"Product Details":["Productdetails"],"This section lists product conversion data.":["Dit gedeelte bevat gegevens over productconversie."],"Product Drop-off is a Premium Feature":["Product Drop-off is een premiumfunctie"],"This shows the total number of visitors for the selected funnel\/s.":["Dit toont het totale aantal bezoekers voor de geselecteerde trechter(s)."],"This shows the total conversions for the selected funnel.":["Dit toont de totale conversies voor de geselecteerde trechter."],"This shows the order bump conversions for the selected funnel.":["Dit toont de order bump conversies voor de geselecteerde funnel."],"This shows the total offer conversions from Upsell and Downsell combined for the selected funnel.":["Dit toont de totale aanbodconversies van Upsell en Downsell gecombineerd voor de geselecteerde funnel."],"This shows the orders completed on large-screen devices (over 1024px).":["Dit toont de voltooide bestellingen op apparaten met een groot scherm (meer dan 1024px)."],"This shows orders completed on mobile and small-screen devices (under 1024px).":["Dit toont bestellingen die zijn voltooid op mobiele en kleine schermapparaten (onder 1024px)."],"Hot":["Heet"],"Get ModernCart Now":["Download ModernCart nu"],"Your WooCommerce Cart, Reinvented %sto Sell More.":["Je WooCommerce-winkelwagen, opnieuw uitgevonden %som meer te verkopen."],"ModernCart replaces redirects and reloads with a smooth slide-out cart \u2014 fewer steps, fewer drop-offs, more conversions.":["ModernCart vervangt omleidingen en herlaadacties door een soepel uitschuifbaar winkelwagentje \u2014 minder stappen, minder afhakers, meer conversies."],"See Plans & Pricing \u2192":["Bekijk plannen en prijzen \u2192"],"Here's What ModernCart Does for Your Store":["Dit is wat ModernCart voor uw winkel doet"],"Slide-Out Cart":["Uitschuifbare kar"],"Keep shoppers on the same page while adding or editing items, reducing steps and boosting completed purchases.":["Houd shoppers op dezelfde pagina terwijl ze items toevoegen of bewerken, waardoor stappen worden verminderd en voltooide aankopen worden verhoogd."],"Smart Product Recommendations":["Slimme productaanbevelingen"],"Show relevant product suggestions inside the cart, automatically increasing order value with simple, effective upsells.":["Toon relevante productaanbevelingen in de winkelwagen, waardoor de bestelwaarde automatisch toeneemt met eenvoudige, effectieve upsells."],"Free Shipping Progress Bar":["Gratis Verzending Voortgangsbalk"],"Motivate customers to spend more by clearly showing how close they are to unlocking free shipping.":["Moedig klanten aan om meer te besteden door duidelijk te laten zien hoe dicht ze bij het ontgrendelen van gratis verzending zijn."],"Smooth Coupon Management":["Soepel Couponbeheer"],"Make discounts effortless \u2014 shoppers can quickly apply or remove coupon codes without page reloads or confusion.":["Maak kortingen moeiteloos \u2014 shoppers kunnen snel kortingscodes toepassen of verwijderen zonder pagina-herlaadbeurten of verwarring."],"Instant Updates, No Reloads":["Directe updates, geen herladen"],"Deliver a seamless, app-like cart experience with real-time updates that keep customers engaged without interruptions.":["Bied een naadloze, app-achtige winkelwagenervaring met realtime-updates die klanten betrokken houden zonder onderbrekingen."],"Customize Everything":["Alles aanpassen"],"Easily change cart icons, labels, colors, and texts to perfectly match your brand and store's style.":["Verander eenvoudig winkelwagenpictogrammen, labels, kleuren en teksten om perfect bij uw merk en de stijl van uw winkel te passen."],"Learn":["Leer"],"File Size (MB)":["Bestandsgrootte (MB)"],"Accepted File Types":["Geaccepteerde bestandstypen"],"Back to Webhooks":["Terug naar Webhooks"],"Edit Webhook":["Webhook Bewerken"],"Add New Webhook":["Nieuwe Webhook Toevoegen"],"e.g. CRM Integration":["bijv. CRM Integratie"],"Endpoint URL":["Endpoint URL"],"Events":["Evenementen"],"Select events that will trigger this webhook.":["Selecteer evenementen die deze webhook zullen activeren."],"Select All":["Selecteer Alles"],"Enabled":["Ingeschakeld"],"Max Retries":["Maximale Herhalingen"],"Number of retry attempts for failed deliveries (0-5).":["Aantal pogingen voor mislukte leveringen (0-5)."],"Secret Key":["Geheime Sleutel"],"Used to sign webhook payloads (HMAC-SHA256).":["Gebruikt om webhook payloads te ondertekenen (HMAC-SHA256)."],"Copy to clipboard":["Kopi\u00ebren naar klembord"],"Copied!":["Gekopieerd!"],"Please enter a webhook name.":["Voer alstublieft een webhook naam in."],"Please enter a webhook URL.":["Voer alstublieft een webhook URL in."],"Please enter a valid URL.":["Voer alstublieft een geldige URL in."],"Please select at least one event.":["Selecteer alstublieft ten minste \u00e9\u00e9n evenement."],"Failed to save webhook.":["Mislukt om webhook op te slaan."],"Something went wrong.":["Er is iets misgegaan."],"Update Webhook":["Webhook bijwerken"],"Create Webhook":["Webhook aanmaken"],"Webhooks":["Webhooks"],"