Da khoanh xong nhom entry point chinh: checkout public AJAX, admin REST/AJAX, wizard, rollback, va compatibility hooks. Toi dang mo context tung doan de chot verdict va format JSON cho `negative_findings`/`out_of_scope` truoc khi ghi file.
